(465344, 44335, 10170, '<td valign="top">Stunning colour.  Would have been good if the swans were a little larger, but it is still a sensational shot.  Well done.</td>', 'Stunning colour.  Would have been good if the swans were a little larger, but it is still a sensational shot.  Well done.', '2003-10-29 02:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
