(465353, 44319, 10170, '<td valign="top">Clever twist on the Grace idea, I like it, and a great photo.</td>', 'Clever twist on the Grace idea, I like it, and a great photo.', '2003-10-29 02:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(465354, 44226, 12432, '<td valign="top">Well, gracious, perhaps, but IMO, a posed shot is rarely appealing. The lady should be more in evidence, as the environment doesn''t bring anything to the topic.</td>', 'Well, gracious, perhaps, but IMO, a posed shot is rarely appealing. The lady should be more in evidence, as the environment doesn''t bring anything to the topic.', '2003-10-29 02:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(465355, 44276, 12902, '<td valign="top">Cool picture. I think I saw all the pictures in top 10 with this one. Congrats. 10</td>', 'Cool picture. I think I saw all the pictures in top 10 with this one. Congrats. 10', '2003-10-29 02:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(465356, 44320, 12339, '<td valign="top">The black on white is very effective in this image.    Swans are such very graceful creatures.</td>', 'The black on white is very effective in this image.    Swans are such very graceful creatures.', '2003-10-29 02:51:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(465359, 44419, 12339, '<td valign="top">Your three yellow Moms are very elegant against the blue background.  The halo adds a gracefull effect.</td>', 'Your three yellow Moms are very elegant against the blue background.  The halo adds a gracefull effect.', '2003-10-29 02:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(465360, 43898, 12432, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this one doesn''t work for me. Out of topic, tilted, dull colors. Let''s imagine Bartholdi''s statue has grace, you could have focused your lens on some of the most gracious parts.</td>', 'Sorry, but this one doesn''t work for me. Out of topic, tilted, dull colors. Let''s imagine Bartholdi''s statue has grace, you could have focused your lens on some of the most gracious parts.', '2003-10-29 02:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(465361, 44350, 12339, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of the butterfly against the red flowers and the intense green.   I almost feel like I am  watching and observing this gracefull little creature.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love the contrast of the butterfly against the red flowers and the intense green.   I almost feel like I am  watching and observing this gracefull little creature. ', '2003-10-29 02:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(465362, 44249, 12432, '<td valign="top">A gracious smile, already full of mischievousness (not sure of my translation = malice, in french). Very good choice of framing. Soft colors and texture working well with the subject. Feet, hands and face slightly diagonal... I like it</td>', 'A gracious smile, already full of mischievousness (not sure of my translation = malice, in french). Very good choice of framing. Soft colors and texture working well with the subject. Feet, hands and face slightly diagonal... I like it', '2003-10-29 02:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(465363, 44394, 12339, '<td valign="top">Very humorous and extremely graceful yes.  We used to have a cat like yours, but he didn''t do any tricks (cute)!!</td>', 'Very humorous and extremely graceful yes.  We used to have a cat like yours, but he didn''t do any tricks (cute)!!', '2003-10-29 02:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(465364, 44352, 12339, '<td valign="top">The light is really awesome.  I feel graced.  Very poweful photo.</td>', 'The light is really awesome.  I feel graced.  Very poweful photo.', '2003-10-29 02:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(465365, 44460, 10170, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, and well done, but nothing here says "grace" to me at all, sorry.  If you care to explain it to me, as maybe I missed your point, I can rescore.</td>', 'Interesting photo, and well done, but nothing here says "grace" to me at all, sorry.  If you care to explain it to me, as maybe I missed your point, I can rescore.', '2003-10-29 03:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(465366, 44276, 10170, '<td valign="top">Exceptional flower shot :)</td>', 'Exceptional flower shot :)', '2003-10-29 03:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(465369, 43576, 12432, '<td valign="top">I suppose it''s the grace of colors and shapes that you ment. It''s well thought, and conveys a nice image. The smoky right bottom creates a not so nice impression, as the smoke appears as a foggy spot not giving enough details (lack of texture).</td>', 'I suppose it''s the grace of colors and shapes that you ment. It''s well thought, and conveys a nice image. The smoky right bottom creates a not so nice impression, as the smoke appears as a foggy spot not giving enough details (lack of texture).', '2003-10-29 03:05:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(465370, 44362, 12160, '<td valign="top">very nice vibrant colors and sharp</td>', 'very nice vibrant colors and sharp', '2003-10-29 03:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(465371, 44449, 12339, '<td valign="top">I like the empty foggy space.  Room to dream and to focus on the swan aerating her wings.  Very graceful picture.</td>', 'I like the empty foggy space.  Room to dream and to focus on the swan aerating her wings.  Very graceful picture.', '2003-10-29 03:09:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(465372, 43649, 12339, '<td valign="top">Very emotive picture.  Graceful clouds.  Lots of open space with interesting texture to the land scape.  I wish I was there.</td>', 'Very emotive picture.  Graceful clouds.  Lots of open space with interesting texture to the land scape.  I wish I was there.', '2003-10-29 03:11:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(465374, 43613, 12432, '<td valign="top">Are you sure it''s an oak? Ok for dying in grace and beauty, but not with these colors. Seems hue manipulations has been a bit exaggerated., but the idea is good and the way the leave is leaning is well seen.</td>', 'Are you sure it''s an oak? Ok for dying in grace and beauty, but not with these colors. Seems hue manipulations has been a bit exaggerated., but the idea is good and the way the leave is leaning is well seen.', '2003-10-29 03:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(465375, 44321, 12802, '<td valign="top">I like the shadow, looks like a cross, but it''s to out of focus.</td>', 'I like the shadow, looks like a cross, but it''s to out of focus.', '2003-10-29 03:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(465377, 43785, 12339, '<td valign="top">This is a very happy picture with lots of colour and lights.  It says to me lets go out on the town.  The sky is heavenly as well.  Well centered and composed.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-05 02:51:02.</i></td>', 'This is a very happy picture with lots of colour and lights.  It says to me lets go out on the town.  The sky is heavenly as well.  Well centered and composed.', '2003-10-29 03:13:22.000000', '2003-11-05 02:51:02.000000', 1),
(465379, 44290, 12802, '<td valign="top">You''d better watch out, a big bolt of lightening will come down for you at any minute!<br/> <br/>Your foot?  at the bottom left hand corner puts me off a little, would have like to have seen the whole of the statue too.</td>', 'You''d better watch out, a big bolt of lightening will come down for you at any minute! Your foot?  at the bottom left hand corner puts me off a little, would have like to have seen the whole of the statue too.', '2003-10-29 03:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(465380, 44394, 12802, '<td valign="top">Poor kitty, I can see you now holding his/her paw up in the air!</td>', 'Poor kitty, I can see you now holding his/her paw up in the air!', '2003-10-29 03:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(465381, 43478, 12339, '<td valign="top">Very elegant and graceful rose!  I can smell it - I know I can!  The pink/white shade is wonderfully pure.  I have never seen a prettier rose.</td>', 'Very elegant and graceful rose!  I can smell it - I know I can!  The pink/white shade is wonderfully pure.  I have never seen a prettier rose.', '2003-10-29 03:14:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(465382, 44102, 12432, '<td valign="top">Seems blurred due probably to cropping out a detail from a larger pic. Arabesque is nice, but unfortunately, the straight bars behind are destroying the whole feeling. The wall on the side doesn''t help either.</td>', 'Seems blurred due probably to cropping out a detail from a larger pic. Arabesque is nice, but unfortunately, the straight bars behind are destroying the whole feeling. The wall on the side doesn''t help either.', '2003-10-29 03:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(465383, 44290, 12339, '<td valign="top">I like the wonderful figurine, but I wonder about the gracefull little thing''s life and being smashed.  Colours are beautiful.</td>', 'I like the wonderful figurine, but I wonder about the gracefull little thing''s life and being smashed.  Colours are beautiful.', '2003-10-29 03:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(465384, 44224, 12160, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and good colour choices. I would have picked yellow too instead of a red. A red may introduce too much contrast between the white  and black keys. The flower seems to be incomplete though, it stands out beautifully with just the right amount of  soft focus but without a stem and a couple leaves, it seems something is lacking. 7</td>', 'Nice idea and good colour choices. I would have picked yellow too instead of a red. A red may introduce too much contrast between the white  and black keys. The flower seems to be incomplete though, it stands out beautifully with just the right amount of  soft focus but without a stem and a couple leaves, it seems something is lacking. 7', '2003-10-29 03:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(465385, 44249, 12339, '<td valign="top">What a cutey (I love him).  The colours are wonderful together.  Your monk has a childness about him which makes me feel safe with him.</td>', 'What a cutey (I love him).  The colours are wonderful together.  Your monk has a childness about him which makes me feel safe with him.', '2003-10-29 03:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(465386, 44335, 12339, '<td valign="top">Stunning reflections of colourr.  Those two birds are lucky to have this environment, so peaceful and graceful.</td>', 'Stunning reflections of colourr.  Those two birds are lucky to have this environment, so peaceful and graceful.', '2003-10-29 03:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(465387, 44227, 12339, '<td valign="top">I love your angel, but I wish I saw more to complete my picture in my mind.  Still, this is a very graceful shot with nice colours against the white sky.<br/> <br/></td>', 'I love your angel, but I wish I saw more to complete my picture in my mind.  Still, this is a very graceful shot with nice colours against the white sky. ', '2003-10-29 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(465388, 44143, 12432, '<td valign="top">Nice and gracious orchid. Direct light is too strong, specially contributing to overexpose the right bottom part. You could have made this one with some backlighting to enhance the flower texture by just a bit of transparency. It''s sharp and the dark background help isolating the flower beauty.</td>', 'Nice and gracious orchid. Direct light is too strong, specially contributing to overexpose the right bottom part. You could have made this one with some backlighting to enhance the flower texture by just a bit of transparency. It''s sharp and the dark background help isolating the flower beauty.', '2003-10-29 03:20:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(465389, 44455, 12339, '<td valign="top">Love the colours and the textures to the flowerette''s made of stone.  The lighting is awesome.</td>', 'Love the colours and the textures to the flowerette''s made of stone.  The lighting is awesome.', '2003-10-29 03:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(465390, 44426, 12432, '<td valign="top">Your shortcut with grace is amazing, but well thought. I specially like the several ladders... bringing to eternal grace. An original snapshot where grace is not where one''s may think at first view.</td>', 'Your shortcut with grace is amazing, but well thought. I specially like the several ladders... bringing to eternal grace. An original snapshot where grace is not where one''s may think at first view.', '2003-10-29 03:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(465391, 44385, 12457, '<td valign="top">I love this photo in black and white... but it''s a little too busy.  Maybe a little cropping to remove Mom in the foreground and a larger aperture to blur the unavoidable background would have made this a better shot.</td>', 'I love this photo in black and white... but it''s a little too busy.  Maybe a little cropping to remove Mom in the foreground and a larger aperture to blur the unavoidable background would have made this a better shot.', '2003-10-29 03:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(465393, 44232, 12339, '<td valign="top">The ocean roaring and the seaguls screaming - it is really the call of the wild.  This brings back memories for me (Island life).  I love the light grey of the ocean and the dark grey of the seagulls.</td>', 'The ocean roaring and the seaguls screaming - it is really the call of the wild.  This brings back memories for me (Island life).  I love the light grey of the ocean and the dark grey of the seagulls.', '2003-10-29 03:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(465394, 44253, 10170, '<td valign="top">Great use of light.</td>', 'Great use of light.', '2003-10-29 03:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
