(465529, 43785, 9295, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  The colors are so vivid and the lights on the structures are nicely balanced. The moon is the perfect touch.</td>', 'Beautiful!  The colors are so vivid and the lights on the structures are nicely balanced. The moon is the perfect touch.', '2003-10-29 08:03:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(465530, 44207, 9295, '<td valign="top">Nice use of light and color. This shot is very tranquil to me.</td>', 'Nice use of light and color. This shot is very tranquil to me.', '2003-10-29 08:07:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(465542, 44431, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is an amusing shot with his head down like that. It''s more comical than graceful t me, but I won''t alter my vote because of that.  I do like the contrast of his coloring against the earthy backdrop. Focus on the bird could be a little sharper.</td>', 'This is an amusing shot with his head down like that. It''s more comical than graceful t me, but I won''t alter my vote because of that.  I do like the contrast of his coloring against the earthy backdrop. Focus on the bird could be a little sharper.', '2003-10-29 08:22:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(465545, 44261, 11241, '<td valign="top">great shot, very sharp and clear...also very nice color....10</td>', 'great shot, very sharp and clear...also very nice color....10', '2003-10-29 08:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(465546, 44149, 9295, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept. I think it would be even more effective if the horizontal beam of the cross didn''t stretch the whole span of the clock face.  I like the black and white and the solid white backdrop which really emphasizes your focal point and you have very nice clarity of the details in the face.  Perhaps crop it so that you have just of white behind the clock so that it doesn''t butt up so precisely to the border.</td>', 'Interesting concept. I think it would be even more effective if the horizontal beam of the cross didn''t stretch the whole span of the clock face.  I like the black and white and the solid white backdrop which really emphasizes your focal point and you have very nice clarity of the details in the face.  Perhaps crop it so that you have just of white behind the clock so that it doesn''t butt up so precisely to the border.', '2003-10-29 08:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(465547, 44227, 12061, '<td valign="top">I find the tree to the left a little distracting..</td>', 'I find the tree to the left a little distracting..', '2003-10-29 08:27:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(465549, 44400, 11241, '<td valign="top">great shot....love the background very simple....adds alot to the photo for me...nice a sharp....10</td>', 'great shot....love the background very simple....adds alot to the photo for me...nice a sharp....10', '2003-10-29 08:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(465551, 44349, 13263, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2003-10-29 08:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(465552, 44232, 12432, '<td valign="top">Grey/Blue tones are beautiful, and seagulls in movement very well catched. Line of rocks is harmonious and in the right place. Just regret foregroung gull on the rock and the rock are out of focus. Very nice and harmonious image.</td>', 'Grey/Blue tones are beautiful, and seagulls in movement very well catched. Line of rocks is harmonious and in the right place. Just regret foregroung gull on the rock and the rock are out of focus. Very nice and harmonious image.', '2003-10-29 08:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(465553, 44373, 13263, '<td valign="top">nice colours</td>', 'nice colours', '2003-10-29 08:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(465555, 44454, 13263, '<td valign="top">good lighting</td>', 'good lighting', '2003-10-29 08:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(465556, 43794, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot of this couple but, if they''re posed and knowing they''re getting their picture taken, dapple their faces with some light powder to take away that shine. They look like they''re sweating profusely and it is a terrible distraction.  I also think cropping the gentleman''s face so close to the border so that his cheek seems cut off should be reconsidered.  I love the concept within the challenge theme and with a little tweaking, this would be a great shot.</td>', 'This is a nice shot of this couple but, if they''re posed and knowing they''re getting their picture taken, dapple their faces with some light powder to take away that shine. They look like they''re sweating profusely and it is a terrible distraction.  I also think cropping the gentleman''s face so close to the border so that his cheek seems cut off should be reconsidered.  I love the concept within the challenge theme and with a little tweaking, this would be a great shot.', '2003-10-29 08:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(465558, 44333, 12432, '<td valign="top">Cute image, but I miss the topic here.</td>', 'Cute image, but I miss the topic here.', '2003-10-29 08:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(465561, 43902, 13263, '<td valign="top">cats can be graceful, not sure if this ''pose'' has caught that though</td>', 'cats can be graceful, not sure if this ''pose'' has caught that though', '2003-10-29 08:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(465562, 44449, 9295, '<td valign="top">I would like this better if the little mallard duck had swum away just a little sooner so he wasn''t in the shot.  The swan is terrific and your ability to stop the action of his flapping wings is very well done.  I love the placement within the frame so that you can see all of his reflection to the bottom and the gradation of dark to light as you look up. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'I would like this better if the little mallard duck had swum away just a little sooner so he wasn''t in the shot.  The swan is terrific and your ability to stop the action of his flapping wings is very well done.  I love the placement within the frame so that you can see all of his reflection to the bottom and the gradation of dark to light as you look up. Beautiful shot.', '2003-10-29 08:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(465563, 44328, 13263, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the perceptio of grace</td>', 'I like the composition and the perceptio of grace', '2003-10-29 08:39:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(465564, 44359, 13263, '<td valign="top">so is her name Grace? or what?</td>', 'so is her name Grace? or what?', '2003-10-29 08:40:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(465565, 44453, 12432, '<td valign="top">It''s an original idea, and this peacock feather is gracious indeed. Good DOF with the background, but the choice is IMO not adequate as it too distracting. The only good point of this background choice would be the upper left blus patch, echoing the feather top.</td>', 'It''s an original idea, and this peacock feather is gracious indeed. Good DOF with the background, but the choice is IMO not adequate as it too distracting. The only good point of this background choice would be the upper left blus patch, echoing the feather top.', '2003-10-29 08:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(465566, 43785, 13263, '<td valign="top">really nice colours - the lighting is very powerful</td>', 'really nice colours - the lighting is very powerful', '2003-10-29 08:41:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(465567, 44334, 9295, '<td valign="top">I like the detail of the buildings and how perfect it is that the awning has the word "grace" scrolled on it, but your focal point, the bicyclist, gets lost in the shadows, his head disappearing so completely he seems almost like the Headless Bicylcist.  I know I have a bit of a problem with the darkness of my monitor but I think even on a better monitor he would still not stand out against those shadows as you may wish for him to be.</td>', 'I like the detail of the buildings and how perfect it is that the awning has the word "grace" scrolled on it, but your focal point, the bicyclist, gets lost in the shadows, his head disappearing so completely he seems almost like the Headless Bicylcist.  I know I have a bit of a problem with the darkness of my monitor but I think even on a better monitor he would still not stand out against those shadows as you may wish for him to be.', '2003-10-29 08:41:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(465574, 44389, 12432, '<td valign="top">Technically very well done, and these foreground light feet have something gracious, as well as the tartan dress movement. Conveys a nice moment.</td>', 'Technically very well done, and these foreground light feet have something gracious, as well as the tartan dress movement. Conveys a nice moment.', '2003-10-29 08:45:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(465575, 44211, 13149, '<td valign="top">This is great idea simple and elegant. I think will be nice to play with polarization filter for this glance surface. Anyway I like the idea.</td>', 'This is great idea simple and elegant. I think will be nice to play with polarization filter for this glance surface. Anyway I like the idea.', '2003-10-29 08:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(465578, 44383, 12432, '<td valign="top">Why not, it''s a graceful presentation. The pic looks grainy and needs a bit more of contrast.</td>', 'Why not, it''s a graceful presentation. The pic looks grainy and needs a bit more of contrast.', '2003-10-29 08:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(465579, 44333, 9295, '<td valign="top">What a charming shot this turned out to be.  Too bad the tip of the toes were cropped off, but I like the yellow tint to the shot, giving it an "old fashioned" feel, and the character of the aging wall is as nice a contrast to the youthfulness of this child as the softness of the courtain is a nice comparison to the softness of her young skin. I like that she''s looking down and not at the camera. She looks like she fell asleep taking a break from her melee of mischief!</td>', 'What a charming shot this turned out to be.  Too bad the tip of the toes were cropped off, but I like the yellow tint to the shot, giving it an "old fashioned" feel, and the character of the aging wall is as nice a contrast to the youthfulness of this child as the softness of the courtain is a nice comparison to the softness of her young skin. I like that she''s looking down and not at the camera. She looks like she fell asleep taking a break from her melee of mischief!', '2003-10-29 08:49:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(465580, 43670, 12432, '<td valign="top">Why not, after all, oriental characters are generally very graceful. Choice of overexposing and blurring the occidental alphabet is cleverand well done.</td>', 'Why not, after all, oriental characters are generally very graceful. Choice of overexposing and blurring the occidental alphabet is cleverand well done.', '2003-10-29 08:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(465582, 44457, 9295, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been more effective in black and white, keeping only a hint of red within the rosary.</td>', 'I think this would have been more effective in black and white, keeping only a hint of red within the rosary.', '2003-10-29 08:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(465584, 44457, 13149, '<td valign="top">Oh, this is great composition! Everything you need for the challenge. What I notice is focus point. I think focus should be a bit shifted to background or incised depth of field to keep in focus all fingers. Nice work.</td>', 'Oh, this is great composition! Everything you need for the challenge. What I notice is focus point. I think focus should be a bit shifted to background or incised depth of field to keep in focus all fingers. Nice work.', '2003-10-29 08:52:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(465586, 44394, 9295, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  See what you can do about losing the harsh shadow to the right of the kitty. It''s obtrusive and detracts from her...gracefulness.  I''d also like to see more of her extended paw. Love the concept though.</td>', 'Very cute!  See what you can do about losing the harsh shadow to the right of the kitty. It''s obtrusive and detracts from her...gracefulness.  I''d also like to see more of her extended paw. Love the concept though.', '2003-10-29 08:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(465587, 43962, 12432, '<td valign="top">First, image quality is very poor, (JPEG artefacts, low definition). Isoliting a tree is a good idea, but would have been more punchy if taken closer to the ground, placing the tree in the hill and sky background only. Little wood just behind is reducing the power you want to associate to the sentence you quoted.</td>', 'First, image quality is very poor, (JPEG artefacts, low definition). Isoliting a tree is a good idea, but would have been more punchy if taken closer to the ground, placing the tree in the hill and sky background only. Little wood just behind is reducing the power you want to associate to the sentence you quoted.', '2003-10-29 08:55:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(465589, 44386, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice composition. The child is positioned well in the frame. In my opinion, It could be improved a little by possibly moving her to the left corner of the bottom of the frame and having her look upward a little or with closed eyes.<br/> <br/>Also, the background is just a hare cluttered. remove the lamp from the desk and take down the plaque hanging above the bed (leave the cross).<br/> <br/>Lastly, I would light the background instead of the subject.<br/> <br/>Please do try this shot again...It could become a classic!</td>', 'This is a very nice composition. The child is positioned well in the frame. In my opinion, It could be improved a little by possibly moving her to the left corner of the bottom of the frame and having her look upward a little or with closed eyes. Also, the background is just a hare cluttered. remove the lamp from the desk and take down the plaque hanging above the bed (leave the cross). Lastly, I would light the background instead of the subject. Please do try this shot again...It could become a classic!', '2003-10-29 08:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(465596, 44321, 9295, '<td valign="top">This would have been better if it were bigger and in better focus.  I like the attempt but it''s so blurry, it loses much of  the humor you were going for.  I do like how the shadow looks like a propellor from a helicopter. LOL!  This could have been so silly and cool.</td>', 'This would have been better if it were bigger and in better focus.  I like the attempt but it''s so blurry, it loses much of  the humor you were going for.  I do like how the shadow looks like a propellor from a helicopter. LOL!  This could have been so silly and cool.', '2003-10-29 08:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(465597, 44447, 10785, '<td valign="top">Grace and mercy are very related, therefor this is on topic! I like the spiritual significance of the photo. Being lost in the fog forces one to rely on something other than yourself.<br/> <br/>I can''t really offer any technical comments because I don''t think I could do better myself. Well done!</td>', 'Grace and mercy are very related, therefor this is on topic! I like the spiritual significance of the photo. Being lost in the fog forces one to rely on something other than yourself. I can''t really offer any technical comments because I don''t think I could do better myself. Well done!', '2003-10-29 09:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(465598, 43963, 12432, '<td valign="top">Means something in french, but far away from the topic of this challenge. To be honest, the play on words is not adequate here, and the picture doesn''t show enough to be legible.</td>', 'Means something in french, but far away from the topic of this challenge. To be honest, the play on words is not adequate here, and the picture doesn''t show enough to be legible.', '2003-10-29 09:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(465600, 44386, 9295, '<td valign="top">Great idea but it lacks interest.  I can tell by the angle from which you took the shot was an attempt at something artistic, but the lighting focusing on her jammies draws the eye there instead of to her lovely face.  I''m also not wild about seeing the inside of the lampshade. Angling it away so that the lightbulb isn''t showing might be a better choice.  I do like the cross up on the wall, adding emphasis to this little girls budding spirituality.  A nice statement, if somewhat poorly executed.</td>', 'Great idea but it lacks interest.  I can tell by the angle from which you took the shot was an attempt at something artistic, but the lighting focusing on her jammies draws the eye there instead of to her lovely face.  I''m also not wild about seeing the inside of the lampshade. Angling it away so that the lightbulb isn''t showing might be a better choice.  I do like the cross up on the wall, adding emphasis to this little girls budding spirituality.  A nice statement, if somewhat poorly executed.', '2003-10-29 09:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(465604, 44385, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit too snapshoty with all the extra people.  It would have been better if the two subject children were isolated more.</td>', 'A bit too snapshoty with all the extra people.  It would have been better if the two subject children were isolated more.', '2003-10-29 09:05:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(465606, 43497, 12432, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful! Fantastic blue shades, sharp contours and water surface do the job. It"s gracious too. Well exposed for an underwater shot. Nice diagonal, that could have been enhanced by a square framing (cropping left). Just regret that the dolphin is seen going away and not coming in your direction.</td>', 'This is beautiful! Fantastic blue shades, sharp contours and water surface do the job. It"s gracious too. Well exposed for an underwater shot. Nice diagonal, that could have been enhanced by a square framing (cropping left). Just regret that the dolphin is seen going away and not coming in your direction.', '2003-10-29 09:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(465608, 44431, 3569, '<td valign="top">The flamingo is nice, but the background makes the photo a below average shot.</td>', 'The flamingo is nice, but the background makes the photo a below average shot.', '2003-10-29 09:07:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(465610, 44227, 3569, '<td valign="top">A bit dark on the face to me.</td>', 'A bit dark on the face to me.', '2003-10-29 09:07:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(465612, 44447, 9295, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. What a fabulous photograph this is.  The sailboat looks almost ghostly as it fades into (or out of) the fog and the lack of horizon adds a wonderful, mystical feel to it.  This is a stunning, moving shot to me. Good luck with the challenge. I hope others see the beauty you have captured here. 10</td>', 'Oh wow. What a fabulous photograph this is.  The sailboat looks almost ghostly as it fades into (or out of) the fog and the lack of horizon adds a wonderful, mystical feel to it.  This is a stunning, moving shot to me. Good luck with the challenge. I hope others see the beauty you have captured here. 10', '2003-10-29 09:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(465615, 44281, 11843, '<td valign="top">Hey!!! A fellow climber!<br/>Now this is what I call grace. Good composition. <br/>The only thing I don''t like is that the shot is in a little tight. Would liked to have seen a little more of the climb too. But I think thats just the climber in me wanting to see the climbs difficulty and exposure. Look forward to finding out where you took this.</td>', 'Hey!!! A fellow climber!Now this is what I call grace. Good composition. The only thing I don''t like is that the shot is in a little tight. Would liked to have seen a little more of the climb too. But I think thats just the climber in me wanting to see the climbs difficulty and exposure. Look forward to finding out where you took this.', '2003-10-29 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(465616, 44359, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but unless her name is Grace, I see none.</td>', 'Nice shot, but unless her name is Grace, I see none.', '2003-10-29 09:09:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(465618, 44319, 327, '<td valign="top">Well focused and well lit.</td>', 'Well focused and well lit.', '2003-10-29 09:09:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(465619, 44249, 12435, '<td valign="top">Wish photo was bigger.</td>', 'Wish photo was bigger.', '2003-10-29 09:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(465622, 44143, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice orchid.</td>', 'Nice orchid.', '2003-10-29 09:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(465623, 44314, 327, '<td valign="top">Unique find. I like this shot. Not sure I understand the title &lt;?&gt;</td>', 'Unique find. I like this shot. Not sure I understand the title <?>', '2003-10-29 09:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(465626, 43872, 327, '<td valign="top">I think the subjects are perfect for the challenge. I don''t like that they are facing away from the camera. Good reflections.</td>', 'I think the subjects are perfect for the challenge. I don''t like that they are facing away from the camera. Good reflections.', '2003-10-29 09:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(465627, 43554, 3569, '<td valign="top">Flash on painting is distracting.</td>', 'Flash on painting is distracting.', '2003-10-29 09:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(465628, 44400, 6912, '<td valign="top">Just wonderful, great and simple. I like the shallow DOF and the simple color of the leaf. Did you use softboxes for lighting?  Giving you a 10 and I hope it is gonna be one of the winners :-) <br/>Anastasia</td>', 'Just wonderful, great and simple. I like the shallow DOF and the simple color of the leaf. Did you use softboxes for lighting?  Giving you a 10 and I hope it is gonna be one of the winners :-) Anastasia', '2003-10-29 09:13:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(465630, 44173, 12432, '<td valign="top">IMO, the lower third can be cropped without problem, so to concentrate the attention on Virgin Mary. Grace is obvious here, due to the symbol, but I don''t find much grace in the way the artist has comosed the expression. The light would have been nicer coming from the left, so to avoid the shadow on the face.</td>', 'IMO, the lower third can be cropped without problem, so to concentrate the attention on Virgin Mary. Grace is obvious here, due to the symbol, but I don''t find much grace in the way the artist has comosed the expression. The light would have been nicer coming from the left, so to avoid the shadow on the face.', '2003-10-29 09:14:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(465633, 43769, 12432, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but it''s blurred and out of topic. The only detail close to something gracious here would be the elegant arabesque of the benches. A perspective view taken from the ground (don''t remove the lady) would be a nice try.</td>', 'Sorry, but it''s blurred and out of topic. The only detail close to something gracious here would be the elegant arabesque of the benches. A perspective view taken from the ground (don''t remove the lady) would be a nice try.', '2003-10-29 09:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(465634, 44328, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow This is so beautiful! Great work! - 10</td>', 'Wow This is so beautiful! Great work! - 10', '2003-10-29 09:18:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(465635, 43809, 327, '<td valign="top">I see the grace here and like the composition, and color. I feel this falls short on the background, focus and lighting. The white is a bit too bright &lt;light&gt;. I don''t dislike this, just my observations.</td>', 'I see the grace here and like the composition, and color. I feel this falls short on the background, focus and lighting. The white is a bit too bright <light>. I don''t dislike this, just my observations.', '2003-10-29 09:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(465637, 43817, 13149, '<td valign="top">It''s nice and graceful :). I very like this shot.</td>', 'It''s nice and graceful :). I very like this shot.', '2003-10-29 09:19:01.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(465639, 43649, 6130, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2003-10-29 09:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(465642, 44394, 1368, '<td valign="top">Oh my god Poor little thing!! Looks just like my cat! Hope you didnt steel her and dress her up ;) I do feel sorry for her But I think its very cute too So youll get 8 from me ;) Would be more if you hadnt helt her hand up</td>', 'Oh my god Poor little thing!! Looks just like my cat! Hope you didnt steel her and dress her up ;) I do feel sorry for her But I think its very cute too So youll get 8 from me ;) Would be more if you hadnt helt her hand up', '2003-10-29 09:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(465644, 44455, 12432, '<td valign="top">This is beautiful, pure and graceful. Warm colors and very well exposed to get all details present, including the wall and the fronton. Black background is perfect. Very well done!</td>', 'This is beautiful, pure and graceful. Warm colors and very well exposed to get all details present, including the wall and the fronton. Black background is perfect. Very well done!', '2003-10-29 09:23:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(465645, 44348, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good focus and light.</td>', 'Nice shot, good focus and light.', '2003-10-29 09:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(465646, 44335, 327, '<td valign="top">Very nice ...love the colors and reflection.</td>', 'Very nice ...love the colors and reflection.', '2003-10-29 09:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(465648, 43785, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice..love the light, moon and bridge. Very good work.</td>', 'Nice..love the light, moon and bridge. Very good work.', '2003-10-29 09:25:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(465649, 44386, 1368, '<td valign="top">This is cute But the shadow behind her is distracting and so is the lamp and mickey mouse. I think it would have been beautiful if you had let the light shine straight on her face So that the light would be in front of her and the picture would fade to dark behind her  But I like the pose and the cross there - 6</td>', 'This is cute But the shadow behind her is distracting and so is the lamp and mickey mouse. I think it would have been beautiful if you had let the light shine straight on her face So that the light would be in front of her and the picture would fade to dark behind her  But I like the pose and the cross there - 6', '2003-10-29 09:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(465651, 43737, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful subject, light and tones. Not too crazy about the focus....where is it? I think this shot has a lot of potential.</td>', 'Wonderful subject, light and tones. Not too crazy about the focus....where is it? I think this shot has a lot of potential.', '2003-10-29 09:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(465652, 44238, 12654, '<td valign="top">very nice , i love the blue lighting and the silhouette effect is a really good idea.<br/>This deserves a 10.</td>', 'very nice , i love the blue lighting and the silhouette effect is a really good idea.This deserves a 10.', '2003-10-29 09:27:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(465655, 44340, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is a little too busy The boy in the picture doesnt stand out and my eyes goes straight to that yellow frame wich I think doesnt fit so well in black and white picture :O I think a little more croping could mabey do something But I think this picture needs more light probably no sun there Anyway its a good idea and I think you could make wonderful Good luck - 5</td>', 'I think this picture is a little too busy The boy in the picture doesnt stand out and my eyes goes straight to that yellow frame wich I think doesnt fit so well in black and white picture :O I think a little more croping could mabey do something But I think this picture needs more light probably no sun there Anyway its a good idea and I think you could make wonderful Good luck - 5', '2003-10-29 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(465656, 44035, 3569, '<td valign="top">The grain is very distracting</td>', 'The grain is very distracting', '2003-10-29 09:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(465657, 44349, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think you should have made the sky a little darker cause the balloon is just black So the sky seems a little overexposured, But Its beautiful</td>', 'I think you should have made the sky a little darker cause the balloon is just black So the sky seems a little overexposured, But Its beautiful', '2003-10-29 09:33:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(465660, 44335, 3569, '<td valign="top">Beautiful......</td>', 'Beautiful......', '2003-10-29 09:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(465662, 43929, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think this picture is a little bit too grainy for a flower picture, what iso did you use? It would have been much better I think if the light would shine in front of the flower in stead of behind Its a little overexposured like this, anyway beautiful flowers and good luck :)</td>', 'I think this picture is a little bit too grainy for a flower picture, what iso did you use? It would have been much better I think if the light would shine in front of the flower in stead of behind Its a little overexposured like this, anyway beautiful flowers and good luck :)', '2003-10-29 09:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(465663, 44353, 3569, '<td valign="top">The swan looking off the short side of the photo makes it less appealing and a bit overexposed on the back.</td>', 'The swan looking off the short side of the photo makes it less appealing and a bit overexposed on the back.', '2003-10-29 09:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(465665, 43556, 3569, '<td valign="top">Cute. Children grace our lives.</td>', 'Cute. Children grace our lives.', '2003-10-29 09:39:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(465667, 44357, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice contrasts and colors.</td>', 'Nice contrasts and colors.', '2003-10-29 09:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(465674, 44394, 6130, '<td valign="top">Very funny and a bit sad.</td>', 'Very funny and a bit sad.', '2003-10-29 09:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(465678, 43758, 6130, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2003-10-29 09:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(465680, 44419, 12654, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting</td>', 'Lovely lighting', '2003-10-29 09:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(465683, 44247, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think the lightning is a bit too harsh here and the shadows too you could have put something in front of the light to soften the lightning, and I think the shoes should have been in the right side of the picture cause the shadows are there But its a beautiful idea Would like to see pictures if you try this again, mabey with other than white background? - 6</td>', 'I think the lightning is a bit too harsh here and the shadows too you could have put something in front of the light to soften the lightning, and I think the shoes should have been in the right side of the picture cause the shadows are there But its a beautiful idea Would like to see pictures if you try this again, mabey with other than white background? - 6', '2003-10-29 09:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(465684, 44352, 10673, '<td valign="top">Magnificently done &amp; well captured!  10</td>', 'Magnificently done & well captured!  10', '2003-10-29 09:53:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(465688, 44309, 1368, '<td valign="top">What did you do with that picture? Looks like a cartoon Dont think its legal</td>', 'What did you do with that picture? Looks like a cartoon Dont think its legal', '2003-10-29 09:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(465690, 44285, 1368, '<td valign="top">Wow lovely! I wish a little more of it were in focus Lovely colors :D</td>', 'Wow lovely! I wish a little more of it were in focus Lovely colors :D', '2003-10-29 10:01:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(465696, 44457, 1368, '<td valign="top">I think the light (flash) is a little bit too hars I would like to see this with a little bit softer lightning and no shadows and mabey even in sepia tones And mabey with a little more space around the hands Anyway its beautiful defenatly meets the challenge :) good luck</td>', 'I think the light (flash) is a little bit too hars I would like to see this with a little bit softer lightning and no shadows and mabey even in sepia tones And mabey with a little more space around the hands Anyway its beautiful defenatly meets the challenge :) good luck', '2003-10-29 10:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(465697, 44341, 1368, '<td valign="top">Cute little frogs, I think it would have been better if you had used some other light then flash and got rid of the shadows behind them too, Good luck :)</td>', 'Cute little frogs, I think it would have been better if you had used some other light then flash and got rid of the shadows behind them too, Good luck :)', '2003-10-29 10:09:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(465700, 44224, 1368, '<td valign="top">Beautiful setup, I think it would have been nicer if you made some color adjustments on it and put some more blue and cyan in it, and mabey have the picture a bit darker :o dont know... Good luck :)</td>', 'Beautiful setup, I think it would have been nicer if you made some color adjustments on it and put some more blue and cyan in it, and mabey have the picture a bit darker :o dont know... Good luck :)', '2003-10-29 10:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(465716, 44319, 12796, '<td valign="top">this is a superb shot.... i simply adore this shot... noway i could come close to this with my 2MP C-150!</td>', 'this is a superb shot.... i simply adore this shot... noway i could come close to this with my 2MP C-150!', '2003-10-29 10:36:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(465718, 43717, 12796, '<td valign="top">smart clean shot...!</td>', 'smart clean shot...!', '2003-10-29 10:38:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(465721, 43713, 12796, '<td valign="top">would have been a lot more great if taken from a straight or wide angle.</td>', 'would have been a lot more great if taken from a straight or wide angle.', '2003-10-29 10:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
