(465767, 44021, 6845, '<td valign="top">I don''t like the out of focus thingy in the foreground. It is very distracting. Very interesting subject. And other than the little hot spot on the top of the head I like the light used.</td>', 'I don''t like the out of focus thingy in the foreground. It is very distracting. Very interesting subject. And other than the little hot spot on the top of the head I like the light used.', '2003-10-29 11:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
