(465960, 44352, 10858, '<td valign="top">All together, it''s a really smart shot! I like the idea and the chose of subject a much! Maybe the sun is too glaring, did you use some filters? I guess not, probably would have helped (with the red-purple circles, too, but maybe also cancel the rainbow-alike sunstrokes I love a much). About composition, I would have left a bit more space between the sun and the statue, because it hurts my eyes a bit that I have to look so close to the glaring sun. I also would have chosen a different angle, to place the sun above her head.</td>', 'All together, it''s a really smart shot! I like the idea and the chose of subject a much! Maybe the sun is too glaring, did you use some filters? I guess not, probably would have helped (with the red-purple circles, too, but maybe also cancel the rainbow-alike sunstrokes I love a much). About composition, I would have left a bit more space between the sun and the statue, because it hurts my eyes a bit that I have to look so close to the glaring sun. I also would have chosen a different angle, to place the sun above her head.', '2003-10-29 12:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
