(466001, 44211, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the light and the framing. It makes for a nice composition.</td>', 'I like the light and the framing. It makes for a nice composition.', '2003-10-29 13:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(466002, 43898, 12038, '<td valign="top">to blurry and not really on topic...but i love the idea</td>', 'to blurry and not really on topic...but i love the idea', '2003-10-29 13:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(466003, 44423, 12045, '<td valign="top">Excellent focus and nice cropping.  Might look even better in B&amp;W.</td>', 'Excellent focus and nice cropping.  Might look even better in B&W.', '2003-10-29 13:15:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(466005, 43615, 12003, '<td valign="top">yahhh nice lighting..nice model.. good job!</td>', 'yahhh nice lighting..nice model.. good job!', '2003-10-29 13:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(466007, 44360, 12045, '<td valign="top">Great reflections.  I really like the slight bluish tint.  This is an excellent photograph.</td>', 'Great reflections.  I really like the slight bluish tint.  This is an excellent photograph.', '2003-10-29 13:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(466008, 44380, 12038, '<td valign="top">scary...not graceful</td>', 'scary...not graceful', '2003-10-29 13:17:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(466010, 43962, 5913, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors!</td>', 'Beautiful colors!', '2003-10-29 13:17:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(466011, 43576, 12038, '<td valign="top">thats sooooooooooo cool...but it doesnt really go with the topic</td>', 'thats sooooooooooo cool...but it doesnt really go with the topic', '2003-10-29 13:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(466013, 44348, 13091, '<td valign="top">Nice one. Love the lightings.</td>', 'Nice one. Love the lightings.', '2003-10-29 13:18:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(466014, 44303, 12038, '<td valign="top">that is sooo awesome...wow</td>', 'that is sooo awesome...wow', '2003-10-29 13:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(466015, 43909, 12045, '<td valign="top">Nice photo but since the subject fills most of the image in the lower part of the frame I think it might have looked better if it were more centered.  Still a very nice picture.</td>', 'Nice photo but since the subject fills most of the image in the lower part of the frame I think it might have looked better if it were more centered.  Still a very nice picture.', '2003-10-29 13:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(466016, 44361, 12038, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2003-10-29 13:19:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(466017, 43552, 12038, '<td valign="top">wow that is kinda freaky</td>', 'wow that is kinda freaky', '2003-10-29 13:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(466018, 43948, 12038, '<td valign="top">thats NASTY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'thats NASTY!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-10-29 13:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(466020, 43637, 12038, '<td valign="top">SHE IS SOOOOOOO CUTE</td>', 'SHE IS SOOOOOOO CUTE', '2003-10-29 13:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(466021, 44246, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting abstract and I do like the intense colors, but the photo fails to generate any emotional response from me. It is perhaps technically sound but  I am having a very hard understanding your interpretation into the challenge. For my own personal taste, I prefer the picture speak for itself rather than having to wait for the end of the challenge or a PM explaining to me what I SHOULD be seeing. FYI, after making these remarks, I am raising the score from what I originally gave you since I do see some merit here that, upon first review, I overlooked. I know I have a tendency to be harsher on abstracts which is why I came back to look again.</td>', 'This is an interesting abstract and I do like the intense colors, but the photo fails to generate any emotional response from me. It is perhaps technically sound but  I am having a very hard understanding your interpretation into the challenge. For my own personal taste, I prefer the picture speak for itself rather than having to wait for the end of the challenge or a PM explaining to me what I SHOULD be seeing. FYI, after making these remarks, I am raising the score from what I originally gave you since I do see some merit here that, upon first review, I overlooked. I know I have a tendency to be harsher on abstracts which is why I came back to look again.', '2003-10-29 13:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(466022, 43615, 12001, '<td valign="top">nice lightin piglet lol. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-05 12:56:34.</i></td>', 'nice lightin piglet lol. ', '2003-10-29 13:22:09.000000', '2003-11-05 12:56:34.000000', 1),
(466023, 43809, 12038, '<td valign="top">thats really pretty</td>', 'thats really pretty', '2003-10-29 13:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(466026, 43917, 11241, '<td valign="top">Great shot but I fine it a little bit grainy...not sharp enough....9</td>', 'Great shot but I fine it a little bit grainy...not sharp enough....9', '2003-10-29 13:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(466027, 44305, 9295, '<td valign="top">This looks like just a snapshot of a child''s foot without any real artistic statement being raised from it.  I think this is a case where too much detail is detrimental in that the veins and color variences give it a rather ugly feel instead of evoking a sense of grace.  Maybe it would have been better in black and white.</td>', 'This looks like just a snapshot of a child''s foot without any real artistic statement being raised from it.  I think this is a case where too much detail is detrimental in that the veins and color variences give it a rather ugly feel instead of evoking a sense of grace.  Maybe it would have been better in black and white.', '2003-10-29 13:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(466028, 43615, 5913, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette and yet I can distinquish the face!</td>', 'Nice silhouette and yet I can distinquish the face!', '2003-10-29 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(466029, 43737, 12045, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft but not to bad.  Might have been a nice entry for shadows.  I like the lighting.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft but not to bad.  Might have been a nice entry for shadows.  I like the lighting.', '2003-10-29 13:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(466030, 43948, 6624, '<td valign="top">is this title not a bit racist and the content a bit exploitive, especially when the subject is grace and the position of a very beautiful woman is strained and uncomfortable</td>', 'is this title not a bit racist and the content a bit exploitive, especially when the subject is grace and the position of a very beautiful woman is strained and uncomfortable', '2003-10-29 13:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(466031, 43939, 12045, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic sky and nice reflection off the water.</td>', 'Very dramatic sky and nice reflection off the water.', '2003-10-29 13:27:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(466032, 43963, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is the third time I have returned to this entry trying my best to figure out what it is.  All I really see is hair and a pole of some kind but it is impossible for me to establish exactly what the image is or in what context I should be recognizing it as relating to grace--of any kind  (I''m afraid your title isn''t helping much).  I do like the lighting on the hair and how it brings out the highlights so beautifully.  Other than that, it''s just not all that interesting a shot.</td>', 'This is the third time I have returned to this entry trying my best to figure out what it is.  All I really see is hair and a pole of some kind but it is impossible for me to establish exactly what the image is or in what context I should be recognizing it as relating to grace--of any kind  (I''m afraid your title isn''t helping much).  I do like the lighting on the hair and how it brings out the highlights so beautifully.  Other than that, it''s just not all that interesting a shot.', '2003-10-29 13:27:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(466034, 44444, 12045, '<td valign="top">Excellent.  The focus is fabulous!!!</td>', 'Excellent.  The focus is fabulous!!!', '2003-10-29 13:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(466036, 44389, 6624, '<td valign="top">as a Scot (by descent)  I love this but it lacks enough clarity for me to put it all the way up</td>', 'as a Scot (by descent)  I love this but it lacks enough clarity for me to put it all the way up', '2003-10-29 13:33:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(466039, 44189, 13136, '<td valign="top">The grace of fratals. I wish I''d thought of it. Great composition and use of background blurring. Terrific picture.</td>', 'The grace of fratals. I wish I''d thought of it. Great composition and use of background blurring. Terrific picture.', '2003-10-29 13:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(466045, 44261, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The colors, the composition, the drop, etc. One of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The colors, the composition, the drop, etc. One of my favorites for the challenge.', '2003-10-29 13:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(466046, 44345, 9295, '<td valign="top">I have seen a lot of dogs shake off water this way but I have never once thought of it as being graceful...no matter what your title says! LOL.  Nevertheless, I will look at the photo for its technical merit.  I think this kind of blurred motion shot is something one either likes or dislikes as a matter of personal taste. I don''t usually care for it although you seem to have done a good job of it (for what I know about the it).  The thing I like best is that the blades of grass in the background are so well focused which give a nice counterbalance to the movement.</td>', 'I have seen a lot of dogs shake off water this way but I have never once thought of it as being graceful...no matter what your title says! LOL.  Nevertheless, I will look at the photo for its technical merit.  I think this kind of blurred motion shot is something one either likes or dislikes as a matter of personal taste. I don''t usually care for it although you seem to have done a good job of it (for what I know about the it).  The thing I like best is that the blades of grass in the background are so well focused which give a nice counterbalance to the movement.', '2003-10-29 13:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466048, 44195, 6845, '<td valign="top">The image seems to lack richness to the colors. Also, the focus seems a little soft. I like the composition and the subject however.</td>', 'The image seems to lack richness to the colors. Also, the focus seems a little soft. I like the composition and the subject however.', '2003-10-29 13:41:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466050, 43747, 6845, '<td valign="top">Neat idea. I have a question though. Is Grace the model or is the capture of the female body supposed to be grace?</td>', 'Neat idea. I have a question though. Is Grace the model or is the capture of the female body supposed to be grace?', '2003-10-29 13:44:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(466051, 43497, 6845, '<td valign="top">One of the most graceful creatures on the planet(imo). I like the composition and the color of the image.</td>', 'One of the most graceful creatures on the planet(imo). I like the composition and the color of the image.', '2003-10-29 13:45:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(466054, 44106, 9295, '<td valign="top">I don''t really care for the head-on approach to photographing text this way. Taking a picture of a page of a book in this way, no matter how significant the words are to the challenge them, fails to evoke any emotional reaction. It seems like little more than a photocopy of the page.  I could do that with my Xerox machine.  In this case, the fact that you can see the type on the reverse side of the page through the text clutters your photo compounding the problem. I would suggest if you wish to use these words to bring your point home, try photographing the page in a different way. Shoot the whole book or try different angles. Add foreign object such as a bookmark or feather. Work with your lighting...something to add intersest.</td>', 'I don''t really care for the head-on approach to photographing text this way. Taking a picture of a page of a book in this way, no matter how significant the words are to the challenge them, fails to evoke any emotional reaction. It seems like little more than a photocopy of the page.  I could do that with my Xerox machine.  In this case, the fact that you can see the type on the reverse side of the page through the text clutters your photo compounding the problem. I would suggest if you wish to use these words to bring your point home, try photographing the page in a different way. Shoot the whole book or try different angles. Add foreign object such as a bookmark or feather. Work with your lighting...something to add intersest.', '2003-10-29 13:46:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(466056, 44226, 6845, '<td valign="top">I don''t like that the subject is centered in the frame. Maybe move her or the camera off to one side. The surroundings also seem a bit busy. Maybe crop in tighter next time. I like the soft light falling on her in the shadows, however.</td>', 'I don''t like that the subject is centered in the frame. Maybe move her or the camera off to one side. The surroundings also seem a bit busy. Maybe crop in tighter next time. I like the soft light falling on her in the shadows, however.', '2003-10-29 13:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(466058, 43552, 9295, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect. Color, lighting and negative space all affective. Technically I don''t guess I have much to say about it except that this photo doesn''t hold much interest.  Despite the fact that it doesn''t speak of "grace" to me, even if I saw this outside the realm of the challenge there isn''t much here that excites me.  Personal preference I suppose.</td>', 'An interesting effect. Color, lighting and negative space all affective. Technically I don''t guess I have much to say about it except that this photo doesn''t hold much interest.  Despite the fact that it doesn''t speak of "grace" to me, even if I saw this outside the realm of the challenge there isn''t much here that excites me.  Personal preference I suppose.', '2003-10-29 13:50:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466076, 43962, 13547, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... Definitely a nice photo, but it is only really given grace by the title, isn''t it?</td>', 'Hmmm... Definitely a nice photo, but it is only really given grace by the title, isn''t it?', '2003-10-29 14:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(466078, 44342, 13547, '<td valign="top">Interesting... Nice contrast in the background.  Good detail as well.</td>', 'Interesting... Nice contrast in the background.  Good detail as well.', '2003-10-29 14:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(466080, 44326, 12857, '<td valign="top">STUNNING  CAPTURE.    THE COLORS ARE MAGNIFICENT.  GOOD JOB</td>', 'STUNNING  CAPTURE.    THE COLORS ARE MAGNIFICENT.  GOOD JOB', '2003-10-29 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(466081, 44110, 13547, '<td valign="top">Oooo the contrast! Like this one, white is the sign of pure grace...</td>', 'Oooo the contrast! Like this one, white is the sign of pure grace...', '2003-10-29 14:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(466083, 43451, 13547, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is beautiful!  The light catches it well, but there may be a little too much shadow towards the bottom of the picture.  Or maybe its just me.</td>', 'Wow, this is beautiful!  The light catches it well, but there may be a little too much shadow towards the bottom of the picture.  Or maybe its just me.', '2003-10-29 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466085, 44238, 13547, '<td valign="top">Love it!  Shadow is fantastic, and the light creates a lovely blue aura which works really well.</td>', 'Love it!  Shadow is fantastic, and the light creates a lovely blue aura which works really well.', '2003-10-29 14:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(466086, 44334, 13547, '<td valign="top">Oh I get it!  lol!  Good idea!  Nice photo too!</td>', 'Oh I get it!  lol!  Good idea!  Nice photo too!', '2003-10-29 14:16:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(466091, 44017, 12045, '<td valign="top">The focus on the subject is good but I think the sky is a little to bright overall.</td>', 'The focus on the subject is good but I think the sky is a little to bright overall.', '2003-10-29 14:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(466092, 44294, 13547, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic capture... the sun''s rays are caught brilliantly!  Its on my faves!</td>', 'This is a fantastic capture... the sun''s rays are caught brilliantly!  Its on my faves!', '2003-10-29 14:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(466093, 44021, 12045, '<td valign="top">Nice framing of the subject and good use of DOF.</td>', 'Nice framing of the subject and good use of DOF.', '2003-10-29 14:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(466094, 44437, 13547, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Amazing - what else can I say?  Only one thing - I think the quality of the foreground could be a little better.</td>', 'Wow.  Amazing - what else can I say?  Only one thing - I think the quality of the foreground could be a little better.', '2003-10-29 14:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(466098, 44309, 13547, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about this one - nice, but doesn''t look natural at all!  Much less blurring needed I think.</td>', 'I''m not sure about this one - nice, but doesn''t look natural at all!  Much less blurring needed I think.', '2003-10-29 14:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(466099, 44353, 13547, '<td valign="top">I think better lighting would have improved this a great deal, especially to the swan''s head.</td>', 'I think better lighting would have improved this a great deal, especially to the swan''s head.', '2003-10-29 14:23:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(466100, 43996, 12045, '<td valign="top">Cool reflections in the water unfortunately it seems to draw the eye away from the subject of the photo.  Still a very nice photo.</td>', 'Cool reflections in the water unfortunately it seems to draw the eye away from the subject of the photo.  Still a very nice photo.', '2003-10-29 14:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(466102, 44070, 13547, '<td valign="top">Ooo I like this!  The slightly out of focus monk is a great addition and reall adds something to this shot.</td>', 'Ooo I like this!  The slightly out of focus monk is a great addition and reall adds something to this shot.', '2003-10-29 14:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(466104, 44285, 13547, '<td valign="top">Interesting... but where''s the green?!</td>', 'Interesting... but where''s the green?!', '2003-10-29 14:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(466109, 43684, 13547, '<td valign="top">fantastic colours!  It''s a bit dark to see what it is in the foreground tho - or is that irrelevant?  But what ever it is this picture is one of the best for me.</td>', 'fantastic colours!  It''s a bit dark to see what it is in the foreground tho - or is that irrelevant?  But what ever it is this picture is one of the best for me.', '2003-10-29 14:26:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466111, 43576, 13547, '<td valign="top">The colours are fantastic and it''s a great shot, but it doesn''t say "Grace" to me, really.</td>', 'The colours are fantastic and it''s a great shot, but it doesn''t say "Grace" to me, really.', '2003-10-29 14:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(466115, 44303, 13547, '<td valign="top">Like it!  Not sure what effect u used on the water but it works really well.</td>', 'Like it!  Not sure what effect u used on the water but it works really well.', '2003-10-29 14:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(466120, 44318, 12327, '<td valign="top">Beautiful... interesting how the branches are curved.</td>', 'Beautiful... interesting how the branches are curved.', '2003-10-29 14:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(466123, 44106, 10858, '<td valign="top">I think the subject is too simple for me, the letters coming through from the other side of the page disturb me a bit, and the ones on the left side a bit, too - why didn\''t you crop at least those ones?</td>', 'I think the subject is too simple for me, the letters coming through from the other side of the page disturb me a bit, and the ones on the left side a bit, too - why didn\''t you crop at least those ones?', '2003-10-29 14:34:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(466125, 44389, 12857, '<td valign="top">Very  interesting shot.  Great motion and movement.</td>', 'Very  interesting shot.  Great motion and movement.', '2003-10-29 14:34:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(466129, 43637, 9027, '<td valign="top">hehe. very cute portrait. love the texture on the wall. wish her legs were not cut off.</td>', 'hehe. very cute portrait. love the texture on the wall. wish her legs were not cut off.', '2003-10-29 14:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(466131, 44340, 9027, '<td valign="top">very muted colors in this. would have liked to see more contrast. doesn''t quite say ''grace'' to me though.</td>', 'very muted colors in this. would have liked to see more contrast. doesn''t quite say ''grace'' to me though.', '2003-10-29 14:41:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(466133, 43784, 9027, '<td valign="top">oh wow. very ethereal.</td>', 'oh wow. very ethereal.', '2003-10-29 14:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(466134, 44321, 9027, '<td valign="top">hahah! funny! love the sense of humor, but wish the image was sharper. :o)</td>', 'hahah! funny! love the sense of humor, but wish the image was sharper. :o)', '2003-10-29 14:42:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466138, 44253, 9027, '<td valign="top">the harsh lighting goes against the idea of ''grace'' for me. perhaps with softer lighting this would have been more effective. the placement of the flowers seems awkward also.</td>', 'the harsh lighting goes against the idea of ''grace'' for me. perhaps with softer lighting this would have been more effective. the placement of the flowers seems awkward also.', '2003-10-29 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466139, 44189, 9027, '<td valign="top">nicely composed and great focus. would have liked to see more saturation to bring out the greens.</td>', 'nicely composed and great focus. would have liked to see more saturation to bring out the greens.', '2003-10-29 14:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(466144, 44360, 9411, '<td valign="top">Very nice IR  9</td>', 'Very nice IR  9', '2003-10-29 14:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(466146, 44132, 208, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting idea, but I''m not sure it comes off. The colors (even the greens) seem dull or muted somehow.</td>', 'This is an interesting idea, but I''m not sure it comes off. The colors (even the greens) seem dull or muted somehow.', '2003-10-29 15:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(466147, 44127, 208, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. I think the DOF is too shallow, though. Maybe have the entire top leaf in focus with the one(s) behind blurry. Good composition and nice color.</td>', 'Cool idea. I think the DOF is too shallow, though. Maybe have the entire top leaf in focus with the one(s) behind blurry. Good composition and nice color.', '2003-10-29 15:02:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(466148, 44261, 9411, '<td valign="top">This is an absolutely stunning image. I see no reason to comment further, I can reccomend no improvement. 10  (and wishing there were higher numbers)</td>', 'This is an absolutely stunning image. I see no reason to comment further, I can reccomend no improvement. 10  (and wishing there were higher numbers)', '2003-10-29 15:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(466152, 43564, 13655, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  With a more relivent challenge I''d rate it much higher then the 6 I gave it, but it dosn''t say "grace" to me.  For the "all alone" challenge I''d give it a 9</td>', 'Beautiful!  With a more relivent challenge I''d rate it much higher then the 6 I gave it, but it dosn''t say "grace" to me.  For the "all alone" challenge I''d give it a 9', '2003-10-29 15:06:30.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(466153, 44212, 208, '<td valign="top">My eyes keep getting drawn to the black in the center of the circle, but I don''t think that''s what you were going for. Maybe show more of the statue? I like the duotone and the light on the statue''s head. And now I''ll go visit a shrink and try to find out why I''m drawn to the darkness . . .</td>', 'My eyes keep getting drawn to the black in the center of the circle, but I don''t think that''s what you were going for. Maybe show more of the statue? I like the duotone and the light on the statue''s head. And now I''ll go visit a shrink and try to find out why I''m drawn to the darkness . . .', '2003-10-29 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(466157, 44449, 13655, '<td valign="top">well done</td>', 'well done', '2003-10-29 15:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(466163, 44394, 13655, '<td valign="top">Made me smile.  Hit the topic beautifuly and lightened up my day.</td>', 'Made me smile.  Hit the topic beautifuly and lightened up my day.', '2003-10-29 15:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(466171, 43948, 12733, '<td valign="top">A very attractive model, well lighted, gracefully posed. I think some amount of shadow, and possibly some background other than plain white would make the photo seem more natural.</td>', 'A very attractive model, well lighted, gracefully posed. I think some amount of shadow, and possibly some background other than plain white would make the photo seem more natural.', '2003-10-29 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(466173, 44334, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice concept, and a nice study in reds - but there''s not enough contrast between his head and the tree; his head gets completely lost.</td>', 'Nice concept, and a nice study in reds - but there''s not enough contrast between his head and the tree; his head gets completely lost.', '2003-10-29 15:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(466175, 44318, 12733, '<td valign="top">Very pretty autumn leaves shot. I especially like the lighting and the leaves strewn across the ground. And the trees are, indeed, graceful.</td>', 'Very pretty autumn leaves shot. I especially like the lighting and the leaves strewn across the ground. And the trees are, indeed, graceful.', '2003-10-29 15:22:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(466176, 44404, 13655, '<td valign="top">I passed by a similar spot on the Hudson River 2 weeks ago, I bought a camera that evening.</td>', 'I passed by a similar spot on the Hudson River 2 weeks ago, I bought a camera that evening.', '2003-10-29 15:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(466178, 43554, 13547, '<td valign="top">Lovely setting, but it''s too dark for my liking... and just to confuse u the bright bit in the top right hand corner spoils it as well, but it''s a good idea and good attempt.</td>', 'Lovely setting, but it''s too dark for my liking... and just to confuse u the bright bit in the top right hand corner spoils it as well, but it''s a good idea and good attempt.', '2003-10-29 15:24:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(466179, 44320, 12733, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty shot of a swan, with nice deatail, but I think it loses by not showing more of the reflection. I think if you had moved back or zoomed your lens to a wider angle, the swan and reflection together would have been a fantastic shot.</td>', 'This is a pretty shot of a swan, with nice deatail, but I think it loses by not showing more of the reflection. I think if you had moved back or zoomed your lens to a wider angle, the swan and reflection together would have been a fantastic shot.', '2003-10-29 15:25:03.000000', NULL, 1),
