(466359, 43684, 13390, '<td valign="top">I would really like to see the wing a little better personally. I love your dymanic contrast in colors, looks beautiful. Just some minor composition problems. I absolutely love the colors though!</td>', 'I would really like to see the wing a little better personally. I love your dymanic contrast in colors, looks beautiful. Just some minor composition problems. I absolutely love the colors though!', '2003-10-29 17:36:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(466360, 44428, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very cute, well seen and nice title too.  What I like here is that it looks very natural, as this little girl has been catched in movement (blurred hair curl and hands). Very attractive snapshot and , indeed, very gracious.</td>', 'Very cute, well seen and nice title too.  What I like here is that it looks very natural, as this little girl has been catched in movement (blurred hair curl and hands). Very attractive snapshot and , indeed, very gracious.', '2003-10-29 17:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(466363, 43554, 13390, '<td valign="top">The glare is kind of distracting on the picture to the uppper right. Overall, a pretty good shot, just feels a little bit too snap-shotty for me.</td>', 'The glare is kind of distracting on the picture to the uppper right. Overall, a pretty good shot, just feels a little bit too snap-shotty for me.', '2003-10-29 17:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(466365, 44318, 13390, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love colors here! The composition is extremely well done. Probably my favorite part of this picture is the lighting, very well done. My personal favorite so far.</td>', 'I absolutely love colors here! The composition is extremely well done. Probably my favorite part of this picture is the lighting, very well done. My personal favorite so far.', '2003-10-29 17:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(466367, 44437, 13342, '<td valign="top">Great Picture. I think it is great! I don''t see "grace" in the colors (more fire-ish?) but it deserves a 10!</td>', 'Great Picture. I think it is great! I don''t see "grace" in the colors (more fire-ish?) but it deserves a 10!', '2003-10-29 17:41:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(466368, 44286, 13390, '<td valign="top">I think this shot has a lot of potential here. Just some personal suggestions, I would narrow the depth of field a little bit more to make the horse in the background a little bit more blurred, I really think that would add to the effect here, also, the shadows in the lower right hand side are kind of distracting. Really, this is a good shot, just has a few minor composition errors. Good luck!   ;)</td>', 'I think this shot has a lot of potential here. Just some personal suggestions, I would narrow the depth of field a little bit more to make the horse in the background a little bit more blurred, I really think that would add to the effect here, also, the shadows in the lower right hand side are kind of distracting. Really, this is a good shot, just has a few minor composition errors. Good luck!   ;)', '2003-10-29 17:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(466369, 43963, 13390, '<td valign="top">Not sure I quite understand. The blurred stick in the middle of the picture is quite distracting.</td>', 'Not sure I quite understand. The blurred stick in the middle of the picture is quite distracting.', '2003-10-29 17:44:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(466370, 43717, 13390, '<td valign="top">Great DOF and focus!</td>', 'Great DOF and focus!', '2003-10-29 17:45:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(466371, 44449, 12432, '<td valign="top">IMO, swans can be more gracious. This one seems to try a take off with extra luggage, and the duck doesn''t seem to care at all. Seems underexposed. A bit more contrast and brightness could help to bring more white tones on the swan. Cloning the duck and cropping out 1/3 on top and same on the left to bring the swan forward could also be a good idea.</td>', 'IMO, swans can be more gracious. This one seems to try a take off with extra luggage, and the duck doesn''t seem to care at all. Seems underexposed. A bit more contrast and brightness could help to bring more white tones on the swan. Cloning the duck and cropping out 1/3 on top and same on the left to bring the swan forward could also be a good idea.', '2003-10-29 17:46:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(466372, 44382, 13390, '<td valign="top">Feels a little overexposed. A very nice shot with good colors.</td>', 'Feels a little overexposed. A very nice shot with good colors.', '2003-10-29 17:46:50.000000', NULL, 1),
