(466387, 44344, 13390, '<td valign="top">Way too much green. I would have cropped this in a way to fit the rule of thirds. I really don''t think that putting the subject in the middle is very effective. I really enjoy the color of the flower though.</td>', 'Way too much green. I would have cropped this in a way to fit the rule of thirds. I really don''t think that putting the subject in the middle is very effective. I really enjoy the color of the flower though.', '2003-10-29 17:53:45.000000', NULL, 1),
