(466707, 44261, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorites so far, it is beautiful IMO, it has such a richness to it, the drop hovering above, yet the ripples from a previous drop (or appearing so to me).  The colors are warm and while it is a sort of ''busy'' shot, meaning lots to look at, it maintains a focal point. Very nice work!</td>', 'This is one of my favorites so far, it is beautiful IMO, it has such a richness to it, the drop hovering above, yet the ripples from a previous drop (or appearing so to me).  The colors are warm and while it is a sort of ''busy'' shot, meaning lots to look at, it maintains a focal point. Very nice work!', '2003-10-29 22:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(466708, 44357, 12857, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lines.  I think I might have cropped just above the roofline to the right so that the vertical lines were unbroken.  Almost like they were lines straight to the heavens.  Good Job <br/></td>', 'Beautiful lines.  I think I might have cropped just above the roofline to the right so that the vertical lines were unbroken.  Almost like they were lines straight to the heavens.  Good Job ', '2003-10-29 22:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
