(466715, 44400, 10959, '<td valign="top">Wonderful still life.  I love the placement and the curves of the leaf--fits "grace" nicely.</td>', 'Wonderful still life.  I love the placement and the curves of the leaf--fits "grace" nicely.', '2003-10-29 22:40:51.000000', NULL, 1),
