(466720, 43649, 7969, '<td valign="top">My only ten so far this challenge, a truly magnificent photo as well as topical.   I love the vastness and the white sheet is a great detail.  What landscape is this is it a beach? desert? <br/>I think this subject is very convincing and that he has gotten what he seeks.  I think you must know something personally about this topic to have portrayed it so well in this shot.  Excellent work.</td>', 'My only ten so far this challenge, a truly magnificent photo as well as topical.   I love the vastness and the white sheet is a great detail.  What landscape is this is it a beach? desert? I think this subject is very convincing and that he has gotten what he seeks.  I think you must know something personally about this topic to have portrayed it so well in this shot.  Excellent work.', '2003-10-29 22:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(466721, 44373, 13498, '<td valign="top">It was a nice photo up until the building took the focus off the water and fall foliage tree''s. I dont find anything graceful about this photo.</td>', 'It was a nice photo up until the building took the focus off the water and fall foliage tree''s. I dont find anything graceful about this photo.', '2003-10-29 22:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
