(466744, 44447, 7969, '<td valign="top">As someone who has sailed in storms it is certainly is grace that gets you home under this kind of fog, good interpretation of the topic. I particularly like the position of the sail when you shot.</td>', 'As someone who has sailed in storms it is certainly is grace that gets you home under this kind of fog, good interpretation of the topic. I particularly like the position of the sail when you shot.', '2003-10-29 22:49:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(466754, 44223, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well I would have to make some philosophical jumps as to how this fits grace, if the world is a stage or a dream of the gods and he wakes up??  But despite my ability to make a clear connection I love that it makes me stop and think about one, and as a photo on its own I find it   truly delightful.  The lighting is superb and the size of the hands vs the size of the person, is great.</td>', 'Well I would have to make some philosophical jumps as to how this fits grace, if the world is a stage or a dream of the gods and he wakes up??  But despite my ability to make a clear connection I love that it makes me stop and think about one, and as a photo on its own I find it   truly delightful.  The lighting is superb and the size of the hands vs the size of the person, is great.', '2003-10-29 22:56:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(466756, 43785, 11078, '<td valign="top">amazing photo Nice work</td>', 'amazing photo Nice work', '2003-10-29 22:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
