(466758, 44122, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, I am glad that I don''t live where you do I am not ready for snow yet.  None the less I love the simplicity and beauty of this shot, the composition, lighting and the creative interpretation of the challenge make this a ''great'' in my mind.  Very well done.</td>', 'Well, I am glad that I don''t live where you do I am not ready for snow yet.  None the less I love the simplicity and beauty of this shot, the composition, lighting and the creative interpretation of the challenge make this a ''great'' in my mind.  Very well done.', '2003-10-29 23:02:19.000000', NULL, 1),
