(466876, 44303, 7687, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the theme, I like the blur of the water.  I''m not entirely sure that keeping the color in the flowers was the way to go in this shot.  I guess I''d have to see the full B&amp;W version in order to judge the benefit of keeping some color in the shot.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the theme, I like the blur of the water.  I''m not entirely sure that keeping the color in the flowers was the way to go in this shot.  I guess I''d have to see the full B&W version in order to judge the benefit of keeping some color in the shot.', '2003-10-30 03:06:08.000000', NULL, 1),
