(466929, 44373, 12432, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection. In fact, colors are nicer reflelected in the water in reality (lack of sharpness mainly). You could have played with just the trees and their reflections, shooting closer. I would crop the unesthetic building, not adding anything to the scene.</td>', 'Nice reflection. In fact, colors are nicer reflelected in the water in reality (lack of sharpness mainly). You could have played with just the trees and their reflections, shooting closer. I would crop the unesthetic building, not adding anything to the scene.', '2003-10-30 06:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(466931, 44122, 6130, '<td valign="top">This is great and beautiful.</td>', 'This is great and beautiful.', '2003-10-30 06:21:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(466932, 43902, 12432, '<td valign="top">I like the composition with the paw in foreground. Good light, but head is overexposed compared to the rest. Gracefull ? I don''t really know.</td>', 'I like the composition with the paw in foreground. Good light, but head is overexposed compared to the rest. Gracefull ? I don''t really know.', '2003-10-30 06:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466938, 44283, 4008, '<td valign="top">A pity the front flowers are just out of focus, the focus is a but to far away. Getting a bit closer would have emphasised the beauty more and would have removed some surrounding distractions.</td>', 'A pity the front flowers are just out of focus, the focus is a but to far away. Getting a bit closer would have emphasised the beauty more and would have removed some surrounding distractions.', '2003-10-30 06:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(466940, 44309, 4008, '<td valign="top">Graceful to me also means "subtle". I find the picture too loud for my taste, too much screaming colors and effects.</td>', 'Graceful to me also means "subtle". I find the picture too loud for my taste, too much screaming colors and effects.', '2003-10-30 06:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(466941, 44309, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love the dreamy effect you have created here. The colors are just great and you have established a wonderful mood.  I don''t really care for the big square piece of wood tacked to the post in the foreground and I want to take a look at this on a better monitor so I can see if there is better contrast between the horse''s front hooves and thee dirt, but other than that (which I did not dislike enough to subtract even a single point for), this is, for me, one of the best shots in the challenge. A print suitable for framing as far as I''m concerned. A 10.</td>', 'I love the dreamy effect you have created here. The colors are just great and you have established a wonderful mood.  I don''t really care for the big square piece of wood tacked to the post in the foreground and I want to take a look at this on a better monitor so I can see if there is better contrast between the horse''s front hooves and thee dirt, but other than that (which I did not dislike enough to subtract even a single point for), this is, for me, one of the best shots in the challenge. A print suitable for framing as far as I''m concerned. A 10.', '2003-10-30 06:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(466942, 44211, 4008, '<td valign="top">your background and lighting makes this into something special.</td>', 'your background and lighting makes this into something special.', '2003-10-30 06:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(466944, 44247, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the rough spots in these graceful objects, shows they are really used. Could maybe have used some light reflected from the right to lighten up the shadows just a bit.</td>', 'I like the rough spots in these graceful objects, shows they are really used. Could maybe have used some light reflected from the right to lighten up the shadows just a bit.', '2003-10-30 06:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466947, 44307, 12796, '<td valign="top">nice glacy legs!</td>', 'nice glacy legs!', '2003-10-30 06:55:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(466948, 44261, 4008, '<td valign="top">A very good drop shot, nice and smooth, and I like the addition of the leave.</td>', 'A very good drop shot, nice and smooth, and I like the addition of the leave.', '2003-10-30 06:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(466951, 44449, 4008, '<td valign="top">I would have been so frustrated with that duck swimming past at the crucial moment .... The picture is so much stronger with just the swan. For me it is not the reflection but the swan itself that makes the picture.</td>', 'I would have been so frustrated with that duck swimming past at the crucial moment .... The picture is so much stronger with just the swan. For me it is not the reflection but the swan itself that makes the picture.', '2003-10-30 06:59:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(466955, 44330, 13479, '<td valign="top">I like how this photo tells a story.  Would like to see a little more depth of field so I could see more of the story behind the candle.</td>', 'I like how this photo tells a story.  Would like to see a little more depth of field so I could see more of the story behind the candle.', '2003-10-30 07:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(466957, 44433, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame about the unsttractive shadow in the background. Not sure about your orange/brown colour tint. Some nasty glare from the table and mug. Nice idea for the challenge though. 4</td>', 'Shame about the unsttractive shadow in the background. Not sure about your orange/brown colour tint. Some nasty glare from the table and mug. Nice idea for the challenge though. 4', '2003-10-30 07:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(466958, 44340, 8522, '<td valign="top">Yikes, what is with the luminous green border on a black and white picture? The border should be subtle and unobtrusive, otherwise it is taking away from the picture. The composition is a bit messy, there seems to be too much to look at without a place for the eye to settle. I think your main subject should not be centred in the frame. Not really sure what is especially graceful in this shot. 3</td>', 'Yikes, what is with the luminous green border on a black and white picture? The border should be subtle and unobtrusive, otherwise it is taking away from the picture. The composition is a bit messy, there seems to be too much to look at without a place for the eye to settle. I think your main subject should not be centred in the frame. Not really sure what is especially graceful in this shot. 3', '2003-10-30 07:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(466959, 44289, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I can''t make anything out here. 1</td>', 'I''m afraid I can''t make anything out here. 1', '2003-10-30 07:15:47.000000', NULL, 1),
