(467132, 44336, 509, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t have thought of hockey as being graceful, though a different scene might better convey grace - maybe a breakaway, a goalie doing a split to make a save or something like that.  If this had been an open ice hit, I''d have given it a 10 just as a bit of irony to the graceful theme.  This image falls somewhere in between though, and IMHO doesn''t convey grace very well.  Also, the exposure and colors are very nice, but the image is a little oversharpened. -6- Mav</td>', 'I wouldn''t have thought of hockey as being graceful, though a different scene might better convey grace - maybe a breakaway, a goalie doing a split to make a save or something like that.  If this had been an open ice hit, I''d have given it a 10 just as a bit of irony to the graceful theme.  This image falls somewhere in between though, and IMHO doesn''t convey grace very well.  Also, the exposure and colors are very nice, but the image is a little oversharpened. -6- Mav', '2003-10-30 10:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(467133, 44305, 12428, '<td valign="top">I dunno wat to say for this.... erm.</td>', 'I dunno wat to say for this.... erm.', '2003-10-30 10:18:19.000000', NULL, 1),
