(467216, 44386, 12432, '<td valign="top">Why not, but there are many other more appealing ways to catch this cute moment. Here, it looks posed and the flash is killing the whole image. Some soft light, from different sources, a shooting point at head level, placed at 10 or 11 would already make a difference.</td>', 'Why not, but there are many other more appealing ways to catch this cute moment. Here, it looks posed and the flash is killing the whole image. Some soft light, from different sources, a shooting point at head level, placed at 10 or 11 would already make a difference.', '2003-10-30 11:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
