(467219, 44332, 12432, '<td valign="top">First nice evidence here, diagonal between cross, hands, top of roof. Good framing and b/w working well (white grace between two dark spots). It''s graceful, for sure.</td>', 'First nice evidence here, diagonal between cross, hands, top of roof. Good framing and b/w working well (white grace between two dark spots). It''s graceful, for sure.', '2003-10-30 11:10:52.000000', NULL, 1),
