(467270, 44302, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice cloud and light interest in the sky and the silhouette is pleasingly simple. The cloud at top left is letting through just a touch too much bright white light I think. Also I find this somewhat sinister image, it kind of makes me think of how the church (in the UK) is losing followers and is in a dark hour. That''s just me though. Pink light at the edge of the clouds is the nicest element.</td>', 'Nice cloud and light interest in the sky and the silhouette is pleasingly simple. The cloud at top left is letting through just a touch too much bright white light I think. Also I find this somewhat sinister image, it kind of makes me think of how the church (in the UK) is losing followers and is in a dark hour. That''s just me though. Pink light at the edge of the clouds is the nicest element.', '2003-10-30 12:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(467274, 44276, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautifully captured rose, nice water droplets, good exposure. The saturation is very nice. The crop is a bit odd though, a bit of one leaf is chopped off and I can''t understand your intention behind the composition of negative space in the frame. 6</td>', 'Beautifully captured rose, nice water droplets, good exposure. The saturation is very nice. The crop is a bit odd though, a bit of one leaf is chopped off and I can''t understand your intention behind the composition of negative space in the frame. 6', '2003-10-30 12:33:35.000000', NULL, 1),
