(467402, 44455, 11570, '<td valign="top">This I like the only thing I am indecided upon is the left hand side and whther it needs a tighter crop but well done all the same a 9</td>', 'This I like the only thing I am indecided upon is the left hand side and whther it needs a tighter crop but well done all the same a 9', '2003-10-30 15:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(467403, 44389, 9027, '<td valign="top">kilts! cool.</td>', 'kilts! cool.', '2003-10-30 15:11:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(467411, 43478, 9027, '<td valign="top">lovely catpure. i like the subtle warm glow.</td>', 'lovely catpure. i like the subtle warm glow.', '2003-10-30 15:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(467415, 44382, 9027, '<td valign="top">lighting extremely harsh and washes out a lot of the shadows in the image. background also fights with the intricate details in her gown.</td>', 'lighting extremely harsh and washes out a lot of the shadows in the image. background also fights with the intricate details in her gown.', '2003-10-30 15:17:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(467419, 44307, 9027, '<td valign="top">too much post processing gives the image a very stark feel, losing the sense of ''grace''</td>', 'too much post processing gives the image a very stark feel, losing the sense of ''grace''', '2003-10-30 15:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(467420, 44353, 9027, '<td valign="top">image could use better sharpness. seems very dull, not enough contrast or crispness.</td>', 'image could use better sharpness. seems very dull, not enough contrast or crispness.', '2003-10-30 15:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(467423, 44453, 9027, '<td valign="top">was this actually on a peacoock? if not, i would have chosen a less busy background. feather gets lost. and overall, the blurry background overwhelms the foreground. perhaps a darker background with less contrast would have helped.</td>', 'was this actually on a peacoock? if not, i would have chosen a less busy background. feather gets lost. and overall, the blurry background overwhelms the foreground. perhaps a darker background with less contrast would have helped.', '2003-10-30 15:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(467427, 43963, 9027, '<td valign="top">can''t quite make out what this is....someone napping on a desk, laying on their arms?</td>', 'can''t quite make out what this is....someone napping on a desk, laying on their arms?', '2003-10-30 15:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(467428, 44246, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the abstract nature of this and the colors, but too much smart blurring ruins it.</td>', 'i like the abstract nature of this and the colors, but too much smart blurring ruins it.', '2003-10-30 15:29:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(467430, 44195, 9027, '<td valign="top">focus off. perhaps more dof would have been good too, so the wallpaper is not so prevalent.</td>', 'focus off. perhaps more dof would have been good too, so the wallpaper is not so prevalent.', '2003-10-30 15:30:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(467431, 44122, 9027, '<td valign="top">simple, yet effective. good capture of the snow''s texture.</td>', 'simple, yet effective. good capture of the snow''s texture.', '2003-10-30 15:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(467434, 44232, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice! great capture. love the juxtaposition of the crashing waves verses the calm elegance of the seagulls. a touch more contrast/brightness to bring out more details in the lower part, but otherwise well done.</td>', 'nice! great capture. love the juxtaposition of the crashing waves verses the calm elegance of the seagulls. a touch more contrast/brightness to bring out more details in the lower part, but otherwise well done.', '2003-10-30 15:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(467438, 43436, 9027, '<td valign="top">love your title. well composed image. i like the contrast and grain.</td>', 'love your title. well composed image. i like the contrast and grain.', '2003-10-30 15:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(467441, 43784, 9906, '<td valign="top">Love the contrast between the darker interior and the bright sunlight streaming in.  The sun beams going through the dust directs your eye both upward and downward.  Unfortunately the blown out spot in the center of the skylights is really distracting IMHO!<br/>TC</td>', 'Love the contrast between the darker interior and the bright sunlight streaming in.  The sun beams going through the dust directs your eye both upward and downward.  Unfortunately the blown out spot in the center of the skylights is really distracting IMHO!TC', '2003-10-30 15:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(467442, 43872, 9906, '<td valign="top">Very serene image! Very graceful too! It''s a tad bit overexposed in the feathers on the backs and back of heads of the geese.<br/>TC</td>', 'Very serene image! Very graceful too! It''s a tad bit overexposed in the feathers on the backs and back of heads of the geese.TC', '2003-10-30 15:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(467446, 44353, 9906, '<td valign="top">Nice crop and composition!  Was this taken with a zoom?  With shots like this, it is not easy to take full advantage of the light.  In this instance the back of the swan is a touch over exposed but the face and front are in shadow making the focal point of the shot hard to determine.  A little patience and luck and you might have a perfect shot!<br/>TC</td>', 'Nice crop and composition!  Was this taken with a zoom?  With shots like this, it is not easy to take full advantage of the light.  In this instance the back of the swan is a touch over exposed but the face and front are in shadow making the focal point of the shot hard to determine.  A little patience and luck and you might have a perfect shot!TC', '2003-10-30 15:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(467450, 44309, 9906, '<td valign="top">This IMHO does not look like a photo anymore and does not do much for me.<br/>TC</td>', 'This IMHO does not look like a photo anymore and does not do much for me.TC', '2003-10-30 15:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(467451, 43451, 9906, '<td valign="top">Like the attempt at high key here!  good composition, but I would like to see the crop a little looser at the top.  The cross seems to confined within the frame.  The shadow is the only thing that detracts from the color scheme here.  Give it a little back lighting and little less glare on the hands and it would be nearly perfect!<br/>TC</td>', 'Like the attempt at high key here!  good composition, but I would like to see the crop a little looser at the top.  The cross seems to confined within the frame.  The shadow is the only thing that detracts from the color scheme here.  Give it a little back lighting and little less glare on the hands and it would be nearly perfect!TC', '2003-10-30 15:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467498, 44317, 10858, '<td valign="top">I love the subject a much! :-) Her face is very touching! Maybe lighting is a bit harsch on her hand and she could be a bit sharper. Blurring her was a really good idea, but I think a bit of difference between the sharpness of the hand and face would have also done very fine. Just my opinion.</td>', 'I love the subject a much! :-) Her face is very touching! Maybe lighting is a bit harsch on her hand and she could be a bit sharper. Blurring her was a really good idea, but I think a bit of difference between the sharpness of the hand and face would have also done very fine. Just my opinion.', '2003-10-30 16:46:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(467502, 44447, 10858, '<td valign="top">Well made, subjects, composition and B&amp;W works really good together. :-) I like the fog, too. Grats!</td>', 'Well made, subjects, composition and B&W works really good together. :-) I like the fog, too. Grats!', '2003-10-30 16:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(467504, 44224, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the simple but beautiful colours! :-) Maybe it could be a very little bit sharper behind the flower, a slower blurring would do fine.</td>', 'I like the composition and the simple but beautiful colours! :-) Maybe it could be a very little bit sharper behind the flower, a slower blurring would do fine.', '2003-10-30 16:53:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(467505, 43899, 10858, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, I like the contrast between the dark leaves and water and the white flower! :-)</td>', 'Beautiful shot, I like the contrast between the dark leaves and water and the white flower! :-)', '2003-10-30 16:55:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(467515, 43948, 10858, '<td valign="top">Brave idea, but - not only - therefor I like it very much! :-) Her smile is really charming, the scarf gives the composition a nice element of colour. I also like that there are not much colours but they are effective! :-) I like the background and the lighting as well. I could neither criticise the technics nor the subject, so 10 for this shot. :-)</td>', 'Brave idea, but - not only - therefor I like it very much! :-) Her smile is really charming, the scarf gives the composition a nice element of colour. I also like that there are not much colours but they are effective! :-) I like the background and the lighting as well. I could neither criticise the technics nor the subject, so 10 for this shot. :-)', '2003-10-30 17:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(467516, 44394, 9116, '<td valign="top">so gracefull, so funny.  Such a pitty for the missing left foot</td>', 'so gracefull, so funny.  Such a pitty for the missing left foot', '2003-10-30 17:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(467517, 43438, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like the way she holds her hand, but... This photo is very noisy...</td>', 'I like the way she holds her hand, but... This photo is very noisy...', '2003-10-30 17:10:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(467520, 44373, 12475, '<td valign="top">The location has potential--but the distinctly ungraceful building detracts a lot from this image, and colors look washed out.</td>', 'The location has potential--but the distinctly ungraceful building detracts a lot from this image, and colors look washed out.', '2003-10-30 17:15:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467522, 44422, 12475, '<td valign="top">The idea is interesting, but I''m not getting a feeling of grace.  Perhaps if I could get more of a sense of movement?</td>', 'The idea is interesting, but I''m not getting a feeling of grace.  Perhaps if I could get more of a sense of movement?', '2003-10-30 17:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(467523, 44340, 12475, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the location, but it''s hard to see any details. Also, the border is distracting.</td>', 'I like the idea and the location, but it''s hard to see any details. Also, the border is distracting.', '2003-10-30 17:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(467524, 44344, 10858, '<td valign="top">I like this one, idea and the colours. Although the pink flower could be a bit sharper and the leaves a bit blurrer. I wouldn''t have centered it, I would have composed it using the rules of thirds.</td>', 'I like this one, idea and the colours. Although the pink flower could be a bit sharper and the leaves a bit blurrer. I wouldn''t have centered it, I would have composed it using the rules of thirds.', '2003-10-30 17:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(467526, 43649, 12475, '<td valign="top">A stunning photo with a remarkable narrative quality. Love this one.</td>', 'A stunning photo with a remarkable narrative quality. Love this one.', '2003-10-30 17:22:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467528, 44066, 12475, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous, great capture.</td>', 'Gorgeous, great capture.', '2003-10-30 17:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(467529, 43436, 12475, '<td valign="top">I love the story this picture tells. Great idea, and it''s executed beautifully.</td>', 'I love the story this picture tells. Great idea, and it''s executed beautifully.', '2003-10-30 17:24:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(467531, 44432, 12475, '<td valign="top">Even if the image is not quite original, the lighting is gorgeous. Really makes the shot for me.</td>', 'Even if the image is not quite original, the lighting is gorgeous. Really makes the shot for me.', '2003-10-30 17:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(467534, 44189, 12475, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely shot.</td>', 'This is a lovely shot.', '2003-10-30 17:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(467538, 44449, 12475, '<td valign="top">Great capture! If the duck hadn''t been there, the shot might have been more pure, but I kinda like the humor of the businesslike, drab little duck next to the swan.</td>', 'Great capture! If the duck hadn''t been there, the shot might have been more pure, but I kinda like the humor of the businesslike, drab little duck next to the swan.', '2003-10-30 17:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(467542, 44223, 2667, '<td valign="top">I love the feel of this piece. My absolute favorite this challenge. 10</td>', 'I love the feel of this piece. My absolute favorite this challenge. 10', '2003-10-30 17:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(467544, 43920, 12475, '<td valign="top">The colors and contrast are a little strong for my taste, but I like the concept very much.</td>', 'The colors and contrast are a little strong for my taste, but I like the concept very much.', '2003-10-30 17:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(467545, 44122, 2667, '<td valign="top">Very simple yet effectively executed. Quite nice. 10</td>', 'Very simple yet effectively executed. Quite nice. 10', '2003-10-30 17:36:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(467548, 43649, 2667, '<td valign="top">Great, great shot. A very interpretive take on grace, but I like it a lot. 10</td>', 'Great, great shot. A very interpretive take on grace, but I like it a lot. 10', '2003-10-30 17:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(467549, 43637, 12475, '<td valign="top">She IS pretty! It''s a charming shot; maybe for this challenge, would have like to see her in motion, dancing or running perhaps?</td>', 'She IS pretty! It''s a charming shot; maybe for this challenge, would have like to see her in motion, dancing or running perhaps?', '2003-10-30 17:37:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(467552, 43436, 2667, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot. I think you captured an interesting moment that defines grace quite well. Not quite a ballet dancer, but nice nevertheless.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot. I think you captured an interesting moment that defines grace quite well. Not quite a ballet dancer, but nice nevertheless.', '2003-10-30 17:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(467554, 44437, 12475, '<td valign="top">Beautiful, painterly, almost otherworldly.</td>', 'Beautiful, painterly, almost otherworldly.', '2003-10-30 17:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(467555, 44459, 12475, '<td valign="top">Fun concept and excellent capture.</td>', 'Fun concept and excellent capture.', '2003-10-30 17:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(467558, 43490, 12475, '<td valign="top">Very pretty shot. I like the muted colors; they help emphasize the graceful shapes.</td>', 'Very pretty shot. I like the muted colors; they help emphasize the graceful shapes.', '2003-10-30 17:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(467566, 44336, 11895, '<td valign="top">overexposed, top of the white helmut has too little separation from the ice</td>', 'overexposed, top of the white helmut has too little separation from the ice', '2003-10-30 18:04:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(467580, 44242, 13336, '<td valign="top">there is an esthetic going on here that really appeals to me.  it looks like the shutter was left open for a very long time.  its like it looks uber real and totally fake at the same time.  thanks...</td>', 'there is an esthetic going on here that really appeals to me.  it looks like the shutter was left open for a very long time.  its like it looks uber real and totally fake at the same time.  thanks...', '2003-10-30 18:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(467583, 43649, 13336, '<td valign="top">for such a sparsely populate image, it is bursting with action.  i can almost here the sky as it is filled with the torment of this mans spirit.  nicely done</td>', 'for such a sparsely populate image, it is bursting with action.  i can almost here the sky as it is filled with the torment of this mans spirit.  nicely done', '2003-10-30 18:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(467584, 44419, 13336, '<td valign="top">wow.  nice composition and framing, and amazing use of the light.</td>', 'wow.  nice composition and framing, and amazing use of the light.', '2003-10-30 18:33:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(467593, 44349, 10625, '<td valign="top">would have preferred some colour saturation in the sky</td>', 'would have preferred some colour saturation in the sky', '2003-10-30 18:55:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(467595, 44104, 10625, '<td valign="top">i hope that no one tells you that your photo is out of focus, i''m sure this is what you''ve intended, nice shot. 8</td>', 'i hope that no one tells you that your photo is out of focus, i''m sure this is what you''ve intended, nice shot. 8', '2003-10-30 18:56:31.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(467596, 44459, 10625, '<td valign="top">i like the border</td>', 'i like the border', '2003-10-30 18:57:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(467599, 43795, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good contrast with her being old and spraying on some perfume. There''s a card and the box so I''d guess it''s her birthday too?  I like it. Nitpick, a little overexposed.</td>', 'Good contrast with her being old and spraying on some perfume. There''s a card and the box so I''d guess it''s her birthday too?  I like it. Nitpick, a little overexposed.', '2003-10-30 18:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(467600, 44346, 10625, '<td valign="top">shadows are fitting. 7</td>', 'shadows are fitting. 7', '2003-10-30 19:00:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(467603, 44166, 10625, '<td valign="top">great colours as i''m sure everyone has already told you, the runner draws my eyes along the bank. i like your choice of dimensions. 8</td>', 'great colours as i''m sure everyone has already told you, the runner draws my eyes along the bank. i like your choice of dimensions. 8', '2003-10-30 19:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467604, 44319, 11800, '<td valign="top">The exposure on the statue ia very dramatic, the shaodows a little too hard, but this is a good study. I don''t know if the background is real or fake and that bothers me. I gues it''s because of the vertical highlight on the left with the rays going vertically also. It makes it look like a fold in the paper. Good job.</td>', 'The exposure on the statue ia very dramatic, the shaodows a little too hard, but this is a good study. I don''t know if the background is real or fake and that bothers me. I gues it''s because of the vertical highlight on the left with the rays going vertically also. It makes it look like a fold in the paper. Good job.', '2003-10-30 19:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(467605, 44357, 10625, '<td valign="top">powerful.</td>', 'powerful.', '2003-10-30 19:06:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(467608, 44318, 10625, '<td valign="top">gods land? fall colours and tree overhang look very calming. 8</td>', 'gods land? fall colours and tree overhang look very calming. 8', '2003-10-30 19:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(467610, 44454, 11800, '<td valign="top">The idea of a light on him is an excellent idea as is the darkness all around. Really focuses on the important part of the statue. Did you try placing a light behind his head. I think you might be able to get a halo effect that way. I''m sorry, but there is something on Mary''s face and it makes it look like she has a mustache.</td>', 'The idea of a light on him is an excellent idea as is the darkness all around. Really focuses on the important part of the statue. Did you try placing a light behind his head. I think you might be able to get a halo effect that way. I''m sorry, but there is something on Mary''s face and it makes it look like she has a mustache.', '2003-10-30 19:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(467616, 44400, 11800, '<td valign="top">It does have graceful lines.  The way that the leading point touches the surface and the other touch points are less obvious gives this a good floating feeling.</td>', 'It does have graceful lines.  The way that the leading point touches the surface and the other touch points are less obvious gives this a good floating feeling.', '2003-10-30 19:15:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(467618, 44261, 10625, '<td valign="top">wow, expecting a ribbon?  this is a top contender.  i''m sure this took a few hundred tries. 10</td>', 'wow, expecting a ribbon?  this is a top contender.  i''m sure this took a few hundred tries. 10', '2003-10-30 19:17:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(467619, 43649, 10625, '<td valign="top">looking forward to finding out where this was taken.  black and white working well here, and the posture of your subject is fitting.  i''m sure you''ll have people telling you they would prefer the placement of your subject towards a corner rather than centered, but i disagree, you''ve placed him perfectly!  good luck 10</td>', 'looking forward to finding out where this was taken.  black and white working well here, and the posture of your subject is fitting.  i''m sure you''ll have people telling you they would prefer the placement of your subject towards a corner rather than centered, but i disagree, you''ve placed him perfectly!  good luck 10', '2003-10-30 19:17:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(467621, 44285, 11800, '<td valign="top">The color is pleasing as is the composition. It might have been better to have the focus on the top drops, or at least, that''s my opinion.</td>', 'The color is pleasing as is the composition. It might have been better to have the focus on the top drops, or at least, that''s my opinion.', '2003-10-30 19:18:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(467622, 44127, 10625, '<td valign="top">i gave this a 9, but i think that a border may have helped the appearance of the image</td>', 'i gave this a 9, but i think that a border may have helped the appearance of the image', '2003-10-30 19:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(467625, 44455, 10625, '<td valign="top">this would have worked well for the lighting or shadows challenges but..........................................  it works great here too.</td>', 'this would have worked well for the lighting or shadows challenges but..........................................  it works great here too.', '2003-10-30 19:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(467630, 44286, 11800, '<td valign="top">The repetition works to add more grace to the picture. The difference in the color of the horses and halters also adds interest. There are a couple of things that you might consider improving. The nose of the horse futherest away is a little close to the outside border and the shadows are a bit distracting and they lead the eyes up to the umm.. brown patch, in the grass.</td>', 'The repetition works to add more grace to the picture. The difference in the color of the horses and halters also adds interest. There are a couple of things that you might consider improving. The nose of the horse futherest away is a little close to the outside border and the shadows are a bit distracting and they lead the eyes up to the umm.. brown patch, in the grass.', '2003-10-30 19:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(467640, 44385, 11800, '<td valign="top">Cute slice of life.</td>', 'Cute slice of life.', '2003-10-30 19:47:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(467650, 44328, 11096, '<td valign="top">Beautiful baby, great composition.  Meets the challenge.  All round great picture.</td>', 'Beautiful baby, great composition.  Meets the challenge.  All round great picture.', '2003-10-30 20:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(467655, 44457, 11096, '<td valign="top">I love this picture.  I think it meets the challenge and has a good composition.  I wish the hot spots on her hands weren''t there but it is an all around good picture.  One of the better ones in the challenge.</td>', 'I love this picture.  I think it meets the challenge and has a good composition.  I wish the hot spots on her hands weren''t there but it is an all around good picture.  One of the better ones in the challenge.', '2003-10-30 20:07:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(467658, 44224, 11096, '<td valign="top">Excellent colors and composition.  Meets the challenge<br/></td>', 'Excellent colors and composition.  Meets the challenge', '2003-10-30 20:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(467660, 43637, 11096, '<td valign="top">A little lady in pink.  She has such an interesting expression on her face.  She must be a sweet little one.  I like the her placement in the picture.</td>', 'A little lady in pink.  She has such an interesting expression on her face.  She must be a sweet little one.  I like the her placement in the picture.', '2003-10-30 20:09:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(467665, 43963, 11096, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand what this picture is so I can''t judge whether it fits the challenge or not.  I think I understand from the title what you were trying to do but it is too confusing for my taste.</td>', 'I don''t understand what this picture is so I can''t judge whether it fits the challenge or not.  I think I understand from the title what you were trying to do but it is too confusing for my taste.', '2003-10-30 20:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(467666, 43636, 11096, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what it is a picture of.  It all sort of blends together.</td>', 'I can''t tell what it is a picture of.  It all sort of blends together.', '2003-10-30 20:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(467667, 43438, 11800, '<td valign="top">Arms and hands are very graceful. These have a lovely bend, creating a semicircle. So you did hit the challenge right on. If I could offer some suggestions as to how to improve this image. The first thing is to get rid of the distracting blocks of darkness at the top.  When you have a lovely subject, sometimes less is more. If you used digital zoom, don''t. It introduces too much noise and that makes the image look soft. See all those squigly patterns? It''s your camera trying to create details it can''t actually see. <br/>I hope I didn''t offend you. Your eye is good, just need a little more experience.</td>', 'Arms and hands are very graceful. These have a lovely bend, creating a semicircle. So you did hit the challenge right on. If I could offer some suggestions as to how to improve this image. The first thing is to get rid of the distracting blocks of darkness at the top.  When you have a lovely subject, sometimes less is more. If you used digital zoom, don''t. It introduces too much noise and that makes the image look soft. See all those squigly patterns? It''s your camera trying to create details it can''t actually see. I hope I didn''t offend you. Your eye is good, just need a little more experience.', '2003-10-30 20:15:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(467668, 43556, 11096, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure how this meets the challenge but I sure do like the picture.  The baby is beautiful.</td>', 'I''m not sure how this meets the challenge but I sure do like the picture.  The baby is beautiful.', '2003-10-30 20:16:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(467669, 44453, 11508, '<td valign="top">Brilliant colors and great shadows on the feather! I love the blurry trees and the rich blueness of the sky showing through. This photo is SO alive.   The red in the upper left corner is  a tad distracting. . . it might be interesting to show the hand/thing that is holding the feather, it would give a centeredness to the photo, i don''t know if you cropped this out. Great job, 8.</td>', 'Brilliant colors and great shadows on the feather! I love the blurry trees and the rich blueness of the sky showing through. This photo is SO alive.   The red in the upper left corner is  a tad distracting. . . it might be interesting to show the hand/thing that is holding the feather, it would give a centeredness to the photo, i don''t know if you cropped this out. Great job, 8.', '2003-10-30 20:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(467670, 44286, 11508, '<td valign="top">horses, always graceful, i  almost submitted a photo of just a horse doing dressage, just his head and neck though. The lighting in your photo is great, and I like the shadows very much. Cute horses, it would have been good to brush the one in the background for the photo at least. I like their ears.</td>', 'horses, always graceful, i  almost submitted a photo of just a horse doing dressage, just his head and neck though. The lighting in your photo is great, and I like the shadows very much. Cute horses, it would have been good to brush the one in the background for the photo at least. I like their ears.', '2003-10-30 20:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
