(467765, 44457, 11800, '<td valign="top">When the challenge is over, this would look nice as a desaturated image. Good framing and placement of all the pieces. Nitpick, if you don''t mind, would be the shadows. I would like to see them softer. Just a suggestion, try a black piece of cloth behind and under her hands next time.  Those red beads should really pop then!</td>', 'When the challenge is over, this would look nice as a desaturated image. Good framing and placement of all the pieces. Nitpick, if you don''t mind, would be the shadows. I would like to see them softer. Just a suggestion, try a black piece of cloth behind and under her hands next time.  Those red beads should really pop then!', '2003-10-30 22:38:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(467781, 44343, 11800, '<td valign="top">My, he looks like he is having a good time. I can almost hear him purring.  I like how you got down to the cat''s level. Good timing. If you don''t mind my saying so, I think it could have been focused just a little bit better.</td>', 'My, he looks like he is having a good time. I can almost hear him purring.  I like how you got down to the cat''s level. Good timing. If you don''t mind my saying so, I think it could have been focused just a little bit better.', '2003-10-30 22:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(467788, 43733, 12902, '<td valign="top">I still don''t know what I am looking at but I must admit it is a gracious curve. I like the metalic shines and the grey tones with just a few sparkles of colour. 8</td>', 'I still don''t know what I am looking at but I must admit it is a gracious curve. I like the metalic shines and the grey tones with just a few sparkles of colour. 8', '2003-10-30 22:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(467789, 44207, 12902, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Nature creates so many beauties...  You caught a perfect beauty in a perfect picture. 10</td>', 'Lovely! Nature creates so many beauties...  You caught a perfect beauty in a perfect picture. 10', '2003-10-30 22:59:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(467791, 44357, 11800, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to find the words to describe this photo. I like the flatness and geometry, the colors, the composition, well everything really. I can not find any flaws. Guess I''ll have to give you a perfect score.</td>', 'I''m trying to find the words to describe this photo. I like the flatness and geometry, the colors, the composition, well everything really. I can not find any flaws. Guess I''ll have to give you a perfect score.', '2003-10-30 23:01:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(467792, 44318, 12902, '<td valign="top">I like the fairytale-like atmosphere you caught here.</td>', 'I like the fairytale-like atmosphere you caught here.', '2003-10-30 23:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467804, 44223, 11800, '<td valign="top">Really nice. Where is the display? The lack of details enhances the feeling of being in an alternate universe. The colors work well. I also like the composition. The best thing is how normal the person seems, doing his work, within the scene.</td>', 'Really nice. Where is the display? The lack of details enhances the feeling of being in an alternate universe. The colors work well. I also like the composition. The best thing is how normal the person seems, doing his work, within the scene.', '2003-10-30 23:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(467812, 43962, 6870, '<td valign="top">You''ve captured the stateliness of this tree very well! The contrast of colors from the tree and the hazy background are very nice. Now note the little grid pattern that can be found all over your image, especially the tree leaves and shrubs. See the little squares? This is caused by either oversharpening or from taking a small photo and making it too large. I''m not sure there is much you can do to get rid of it, except get closer to the tree and/or don''t use unsharp mask. Anyway, it''s too bad because this shot really works for me. The tree seems to deserve its centered position. Keep up the good work!</td>', 'You''ve captured the stateliness of this tree very well! The contrast of colors from the tree and the hazy background are very nice. Now note the little grid pattern that can be found all over your image, especially the tree leaves and shrubs. See the little squares? This is caused by either oversharpening or from taking a small photo and making it too large. I''m not sure there is much you can do to get rid of it, except get closer to the tree and/or don''t use unsharp mask. Anyway, it''s too bad because this shot really works for me. The tree seems to deserve its centered position. Keep up the good work!', '2003-10-30 23:40:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(467813, 44328, 6870, '<td valign="top">A very special moment captured here. WOnderful depth of tonal range!</td>', 'A very special moment captured here. WOnderful depth of tonal range!', '2003-10-30 23:41:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(467815, 44404, 6870, '<td valign="top">Lovely colors! Composition is marvelous with that reflection in the water. Looks a bit oversharpened or overprocessed, but a very peaceful, lovely image.</td>', 'Lovely colors! Composition is marvelous with that reflection in the water. Looks a bit oversharpened or overprocessed, but a very peaceful, lovely image.', '2003-10-30 23:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(467816, 44223, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is really bizarre and delightful! I''m not sure what it has to do with Grace, but I''ll assume I''m stupid and give it a 10!</td>', 'This is really bizarre and delightful! I''m not sure what it has to do with Grace, but I''ll assume I''m stupid and give it a 10!', '2003-10-30 23:45:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(467817, 44243, 10768, '<td valign="top">Very nice lighting.  Love the pose, expression and composition of this piece.  The lips on her shirt are a bit distracting, but otherwise a beautiful photo.  9</td>', 'Very nice lighting.  Love the pose, expression and composition of this piece.  The lips on her shirt are a bit distracting, but otherwise a beautiful photo.  9', '2003-10-30 23:45:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(467818, 44333, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very engaging and intriguing image. The broken wall and curtain hanging down over her shoulder are really interesting clues to a puzzle I''m delighted to scrutinize.</td>', 'Very engaging and intriguing image. The broken wall and curtain hanging down over her shoulder are really interesting clues to a puzzle I''m delighted to scrutinize.', '2003-10-30 23:46:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(467819, 44447, 6870, '<td valign="top">Marvelous capture. Composition is fantastic. Nice use of tones.</td>', 'Marvelous capture. Composition is fantastic. Nice use of tones.', '2003-10-30 23:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(467821, 44339, 6870, '<td valign="top">The bright light does indeed make it look like this rocker is seeing deity! The many details kind of upstage the singer, but I still find the image very engaging.</td>', 'The bright light does indeed make it look like this rocker is seeing deity! The many details kind of upstage the singer, but I still find the image very engaging.', '2003-10-30 23:49:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467823, 44195, 6870, '<td valign="top">Well seen. This is graceful, alright. It could use some sharpening to provide a little clarity, but the curve really steals the show in this image.</td>', 'Well seen. This is graceful, alright. It could use some sharpening to provide a little clarity, but the curve really steals the show in this image.', '2003-10-30 23:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(467824, 43939, 6870, '<td valign="top">Who''d a thunk that industrial machines could look graceful. Heck, I would even look graceful with that sky behind me! Well seen!</td>', 'Who''d a thunk that industrial machines could look graceful. Heck, I would even look graceful with that sky behind me! Well seen!', '2003-10-30 23:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(467825, 43962, 11800, '<td valign="top">What''s good about this is the colors and the light. Outstanding.  They really give a good feel for the distance between the tree and the background. What could be improved is the post processing, a lot of artifacts were created for whatever reason. I sorta like the centered composition for this one.</td>', 'What''s good about this is the colors and the light. Outstanding.  They really give a good feel for the distance between the tree and the background. What could be improved is the post processing, a lot of artifacts were created for whatever reason. I sorta like the centered composition for this one.', '2003-10-30 23:54:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467826, 44454, 6870, '<td valign="top">Le Pieta? I think Boticelli does indeed make Mary look graceful here. And you capture that grace quite well. I''m not sure what those ghostly figures are above Jesus'' face, but I like your lighting here a lot.</td>', 'Le Pieta? I think Boticelli does indeed make Mary look graceful here. And you capture that grace quite well. I''m not sure what those ghostly figures are above Jesus'' face, but I like your lighting here a lot.', '2003-10-30 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(467827, 43795, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m sure she''s full of grace, but in this shot, you''re going for irony. I like it a lot.</td>', 'I''m sure she''s full of grace, but in this shot, you''re going for irony. I like it a lot.', '2003-10-30 23:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(467828, 44349, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very subtle sunset colors. The dark baloon really gets our attention here.</td>', 'Very subtle sunset colors. The dark baloon really gets our attention here.', '2003-10-30 23:56:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(467829, 43637, 6870, '<td valign="top">I LOVE the negative space here, though some may not. To me, it implies that this little gal is far deeper than we can see here, and that''s one of the things that negative space does for me. NIce work! 9</td>', 'I LOVE the negative space here, though some may not. To me, it implies that this little gal is far deeper than we can see here, and that''s one of the things that negative space does for me. NIce work! 9', '2003-10-30 23:57:39.000000', NULL, 1),
