(467902, 44389, 11800, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of energy going for it. The tartans and hose give a sense of location. I admire your willingness to try something different. The main problem, as I see it, is the almost totally transparent front dancer''s feet.  I''d like to see more detail. This is only my opinion, I apologize if you did this on purpose.</td>', 'This has a lot of energy going for it. The tartans and hose give a sense of location. I admire your willingness to try something different. The main problem, as I see it, is the almost totally transparent front dancer''s feet.  I''d like to see more detail. This is only my opinion, I apologize if you did this on purpose.', '2003-10-31 02:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
