(467912, 43649, 11800, '<td valign="top">So desolate. I wonder if he''ll ever find it there. Good shot.</td>', 'So desolate. I wonder if he''ll ever find it there. Good shot.', '2003-10-31 03:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(467914, 44286, 12802, '<td valign="top">The wee pile of horse poop in the background is a bit off putting, good photo though.</td>', 'The wee pile of horse poop in the background is a bit off putting, good photo though.', '2003-10-31 03:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(467915, 44276, 8643, '<td valign="top">This is stunning, it leaps off the page/out of the screen - my compliments.</td>', 'This is stunning, it leaps off the page/out of the screen - my compliments.', '2003-10-31 03:51:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(467921, 44394, 8522, '<td valign="top">Well taken photo, good technique. Now, I''m as much of a cat lover as the next person, but this is just so unbelievably kitsh it''s not true. Great textures, the composition doesn''t quite work for me. I think it looks like the photographer centred the whole cat in the shot, implying that the centre of focus is in the middle of the frame, whereas it''s really the head. I think you have a good career ahead of you making greetings cards for old grandmothers! ;-) 7</td>', 'Well taken photo, good technique. Now, I''m as much of a cat lover as the next person, but this is just so unbelievably kitsh it''s not true. Great textures, the composition doesn''t quite work for me. I think it looks like the photographer centred the whole cat in the shot, implying that the centre of focus is in the middle of the frame, whereas it''s really the head. I think you have a good career ahead of you making greetings cards for old grandmothers! ;-) 7', '2003-10-31 05:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(467923, 43785, 8522, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot, I''ll be amazed if this doesn''t get a blue ribbon. The composition doesn''t quite work for me, but I think this is a personal issue and this is still my favourite shot this challenge. It''s the moon that really makes this shot special. Wonderful timing to capture this shot under just the right light conditions. I love the (NeatImaged?) graduated blues and reds in the sky. Well done for taking a well known landmark and making something a little different with it. 10</td>', 'Fantastic shot, I''ll be amazed if this doesn''t get a blue ribbon. The composition doesn''t quite work for me, but I think this is a personal issue and this is still my favourite shot this challenge. It''s the moon that really makes this shot special. Wonderful timing to capture this shot under just the right light conditions. I love the (NeatImaged?) graduated blues and reds in the sky. Well done for taking a well known landmark and making something a little different with it. 10', '2003-10-31 05:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(467925, 44166, 13547, '<td valign="top">Nice, but I''d like to see more of it!</td>', 'Nice, but I''d like to see more of it!', '2003-10-31 05:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(467926, 44400, 8522, '<td valign="top">I had this shot sitting on 9 for a few days, but I had to bump it up to 10 after taking another look. One of the best and most imaginative autumn pics I''ve seen. Great minimalist feel. Lovely use of light and shadows. Perfect dof. I love the composition. The saturation is spot-on. Only the title doesn''t do the photo justice. 10</td>', 'I had this shot sitting on 9 for a few days, but I had to bump it up to 10 after taking another look. One of the best and most imaginative autumn pics I''ve seen. Great minimalist feel. Lovely use of light and shadows. Perfect dof. I love the composition. The saturation is spot-on. Only the title doesn''t do the photo justice. 10', '2003-10-31 06:02:01.000000', NULL, 1),
