(467936, 43917, 7687, '<td valign="top">I definitely see the grace in this image, interesting subject. <br/> <br/>I like the composition and the contrast you have going on here, although it might be a bit too contrasty for most people''s taste.</td>', 'I definitely see the grace in this image, interesting subject.  I like the composition and the contrast you have going on here, although it might be a bit too contrasty for most people''s taste.', '2003-10-31 06:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(467939, 44335, 7687, '<td valign="top">Excellent subject matter and a superb setting, especially with the fog coming off the lake.  The only thing I would have criticize about this shot is the fact that the birds (not sure what they are) are much too small in the image.  Of course I''m sure you were probably limited to the lens you were using, which makes things tough.  Overall nice shot, I like it!<br/> <br/>I hope this helps,<br/>Quadrajet</td>', 'Excellent subject matter and a superb setting, especially with the fog coming off the lake.  The only thing I would have criticize about this shot is the fact that the birds (not sure what they are) are much too small in the image.  Of course I''m sure you were probably limited to the lens you were using, which makes things tough.  Overall nice shot, I like it! I hope this helps,Quadrajet', '2003-10-31 06:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(467940, 44450, 7687, '<td valign="top">The first thing I noticed about this image was how different it is from other waterfowl shots.  I like the composition, how the duck is positioned on the left 3rd line with the dark ripples fanning out from it in the upper corners.  I''m especially glad you captured it turning its head, that adds a great dynamic to the image.  Nice work!</td>', 'The first thing I noticed about this image was how different it is from other waterfowl shots.  I like the composition, how the duck is positioned on the left 3rd line with the dark ripples fanning out from it in the upper corners.  I''m especially glad you captured it turning its head, that adds a great dynamic to the image.  Nice work!', '2003-10-31 06:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(467944, 44404, 7687, '<td valign="top">Beautiful countryside and reflection!  I guess I''m not too sure what this image has to do with grace, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and vote without that stipulation.  <br/> <br/>It appears as if this image is quite pixelated, I wonder if the sharpening tool may have been used on it a little too strongly?</td>', 'Beautiful countryside and reflection!  I guess I''m not too sure what this image has to do with grace, but I''ll give you the benefit of the doubt and vote without that stipulation.   It appears as if this image is quite pixelated, I wonder if the sharpening tool may have been used on it a little too strongly?', '2003-10-31 06:45:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(467947, 44207, 12432, '<td valign="top">Perfect framing and forepart equilibrating very well the image. Sharp and well exposed, but I would have left the natural colors, where,I suppose, pearl shades would have been apparent.</td>', 'Perfect framing and forepart equilibrating very well the image. Sharp and well exposed, but I would have left the natural colors, where,I suppose, pearl shades would have been apparent.', '2003-10-31 06:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(467950, 43869, 12432, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, good exposure, sharp and focus spot on the mallards. The little branch just over them is distracting. It would have been better with the twins closer to you. Left side is not very esthetic.</td>', 'Nice shot, good exposure, sharp and focus spot on the mallards. The little branch just over them is distracting. It would have been better with the twins closer to you. Left side is not very esthetic.', '2003-10-31 07:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(467951, 44364, 12432, '<td valign="top">Cute, very cute and well executed close framing. Here, the fill-in flash is doing very well,  except for tje background. Sleeve end is overexposed, but could be arranged with PS. Very pleasant image.</td>', 'Cute, very cute and well executed close framing. Here, the fill-in flash is doing very well,  except for tje background. Sleeve end is overexposed, but could be arranged with PS. Very pleasant image.', '2003-10-31 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
