(467953, 44374, 12432, '<td valign="top">It catches the eye due to the diagonal separating darkness/land an brightness/sky. Reeds (I suppose that''s what it is) are always elegant and are a good subject to photography, whatever the season. Well done.</td>', 'It catches the eye due to the diagonal separating darkness/land an brightness/sky. Reeds (I suppose that''s what it is) are always elegant and are a good subject to photography, whatever the season. Well done.', '2003-10-31 07:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
