(468408, 44347, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like it! The curve of the neck coming out of the shadows and the angle of the head is very graceful. The lighting is spot on, highlighting the contours well. I just keep getting the feeling I have to pull that piece of hair under the necklace out......</td>', 'I like it! The curve of the neck coming out of the shadows and the angle of the head is very graceful. The lighting is spot on, highlighting the contours well. I just keep getting the feeling I have to pull that piece of hair under the necklace out......', '2003-10-31 18:18:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(468412, 44419, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. The blueish/purple hue of the background helps to bring out the three flowers. The lighting in the background upon the top flower gives it a great halo that highlights the petal. "8"<br/> <br/>Edit: Looked through all the entries and came back to yours . I think I''m going to up it to a "10" .</td>', 'Interesting composition. The blueish/purple hue of the background helps to bring out the three flowers. The lighting in the background upon the top flower gives it a great halo that highlights the petal. "8" Edit: Looked through all the entries and came back to yours . I think I''m going to up it to a "10" .', '2003-10-31 18:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(468420, 43785, 3102, '<td valign="top">Simply stunning!  The blue ribbon will go nicely with the blues in this shot!</td>', 'Simply stunning!  The blue ribbon will go nicely with the blues in this shot!', '2003-10-31 18:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
