(468741, 44444, 12432, '<td valign="top">This is changing from white swans. It makes an original image. These birds are naturally gracious, and you''ve catched that very well.  It''s sharp, with very nice details on the feathers. Not sure, though, that b/w was a good choice, because we miss beaks yellow/red color and yellow eyes contour. Now, if the water color was not that attractive, I understand. A less closer view would have avoided the not so nice bottom left part.</td>', 'This is changing from white swans. It makes an original image. These birds are naturally gracious, and you''ve catched that very well.  It''s sharp, with very nice details on the feathers. Not sure, though, that b/w was a good choice, because we miss beaks yellow/red color and yellow eyes contour. Now, if the water color was not that attractive, I understand. A less closer view would have avoided the not so nice bottom left part.', '2003-11-01 04:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(468743, 44447, 11486, '<td valign="top">Captured an feeling in this one. I like the photo, but would have given it one point more in the "all alone" challange... Now its an 8</td>', 'Captured an feeling in this one. I like the photo, but would have given it one point more in the "all alone" challange... Now its an 8', '2003-11-01 04:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
