(468745, 43489, 11486, '<td valign="top">A bit unsharp, but i realy like the feeling anyway.</td>', 'A bit unsharp, but i realy like the feeling anyway.', '2003-11-01 04:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(468749, 43747, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very good title for an original idea, but this white sheet doesn''t give a very esthetic separation of the image (too geometric and unbalanced). The drawing is nice and well presented with hand and pencil. I would have put the model more in the background. Cropping just above the shoulders would give IMO a better balanced image, and enough to understand what you want to express.</td>', 'Very good title for an original idea, but this white sheet doesn''t give a very esthetic separation of the image (too geometric and unbalanced). The drawing is nice and well presented with hand and pencil. I would have put the model more in the background. Cropping just above the shoulders would give IMO a better balanced image, and enough to understand what you want to express.', '2003-11-01 04:16:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(468751, 44451, 12432, '<td valign="top">Original idea, but I would have preferred a biblic text more related to grace, including this word.  Well realized.</td>', 'Original idea, but I would have preferred a biblic text more related to grace, including this word.  Well realized.', '2003-11-01 04:22:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(468753, 44317, 12902, '<td valign="top">I tried to let this one for the last. I didn''t know what to think about it. But every time I came here to vote... I keep coming back to it. If it does this to me... then it must be a good photo.... it has something to say. I don''t know if it should a ten or a nine... so I''ll give it a nine for now and then I can adjust from thumbnail when I''m done with all. If will continue to haunt me... I will just turn it into a ten and be done with it.</td>', 'I tried to let this one for the last. I didn''t know what to think about it. But every time I came here to vote... I keep coming back to it. If it does this to me... then it must be a good photo.... it has something to say. I don''t know if it should a ten or a nine... so I''ll give it a nine for now and then I can adjust from thumbnail when I''m done with all. If will continue to haunt me... I will just turn it into a ten and be done with it.', '2003-11-01 04:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
