(468987, 44224, 10402, '<td valign="top">The delicate tones and colors of the rose are captured very nicely and the piano makes a great background. A black piano would have been a lot more dramatic, but the white piano keeps the image high key and better fits the challenge.</td>', 'The delicate tones and colors of the rose are captured very nicely and the piano makes a great background. A black piano would have been a lot more dramatic, but the white piano keeps the image high key and better fits the challenge.', '2003-11-01 09:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(468999, 44428, 10402, '<td valign="top">My daughter loves twirling in her pretty dress too. The position of the feet hair, and dress shows that''s what she''s doing, and you''ve frozen her motion at the perfect instant. The grass makes a nice background. Great soft focus.</td>', 'My daughter loves twirling in her pretty dress too. The position of the feet hair, and dress shows that''s what she''s doing, and you''ve frozen her motion at the perfect instant. The grass makes a nice background. Great soft focus.', '2003-11-01 09:48:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(469006, 43637, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very pretty model in a nice pose. The negative space on the left helps the composition, but there is so much the image seems unbalanced; I think about half that much would have been better.</td>', 'Very pretty model in a nice pose. The negative space on the left helps the composition, but there is so much the image seems unbalanced; I think about half that much would have been better.', '2003-11-01 09:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(469023, 43795, 1531, '<td valign="top">There is something about this photo that makes me smile =)</td>', 'There is something about this photo that makes me smile =)', '2003-11-01 10:04:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(469025, 43615, 10402, '<td valign="top">The elements of this image are arranged nicely and the existing lighting works well. The low contrast, reddish color cast, and overall softness are appropriate for the setting. I don''t care for the noise here, although it does help with the overall quiet feeling and doesn''t distract too much.</td>', 'The elements of this image are arranged nicely and the existing lighting works well. The low contrast, reddish color cast, and overall softness are appropriate for the setting. I don''t care for the noise here, although it does help with the overall quiet feeling and doesn''t distract too much.', '2003-11-01 10:06:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(469028, 43684, 1531, '<td valign="top">Wow, what in the world is this vertical thingy? Great colors</td>', 'Wow, what in the world is this vertical thingy? Great colors', '2003-11-01 10:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(469032, 44232, 1531, '<td valign="top">Powerful shot, good job</td>', 'Powerful shot, good job', '2003-11-01 10:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(469034, 44335, 10402, '<td valign="top">The swans aren''t large enough to convey grace by themselves, but the rippling water and swirling mist gives a nice feeling of grace which is complemented by the unobtrusive swans. The great fall colors are a nice bonus.</td>', 'The swans aren''t large enough to convey grace by themselves, but the rippling water and swirling mist gives a nice feeling of grace which is complemented by the unobtrusive swans. The great fall colors are a nice bonus.', '2003-11-01 10:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(469042, 44394, 1531, '<td valign="top">Lol, the cat doesn''t seem too happy... Well, I wouldn''t be either =)</td>', 'Lol, the cat doesn''t seem too happy... Well, I wouldn''t be either =)', '2003-11-01 10:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(469050, 44385, 10402, '<td valign="top">The girl is catching the boy''s attention! And she manages to be the center of interest in this image despite the cluttered background. But the cut-off heads are distracting and I wish the girl''s eyes were more apparent. Stooping down to get the camera on her level might have helped. But despite her graceful costume, she isn''t in a very graceful pose.</td>', 'The girl is catching the boy''s attention! And she manages to be the center of interest in this image despite the cluttered background. But the cut-off heads are distracting and I wish the girl''s eyes were more apparent. Stooping down to get the camera on her level might have helped. But despite her graceful costume, she isn''t in a very graceful pose.', '2003-11-01 10:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(469052, 44066, 1531, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see more of the smoke in the U turn. You could also easily make it much better by cropping the empty space on the right side away... Anyway, good shot</td>', 'Would have liked to see more of the smoke in the U turn. You could also easily make it much better by cropping the empty space on the right side away... Anyway, good shot', '2003-11-01 10:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(469064, 43670, 10402, '<td valign="top">The calligraphy is very graceful, as are the edges of the handmade paper. I like your photographic depiction of this art; putting the english word slightly out of focus puts the center of interest on the chinese glyph.</td>', 'The calligraphy is very graceful, as are the edges of the handmade paper. I like your photographic depiction of this art; putting the english word slightly out of focus puts the center of interest on the chinese glyph.', '2003-11-01 10:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469068, 43817, 10402, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice. The sculpture has a very graceful form itself, and also suggests grace in the religious sense. And it is photographed very well. The viewing angle you chose works well and the lighting shows off the subject''s beautiful lines and form.</td>', 'Good subject choice. The sculpture has a very graceful form itself, and also suggests grace in the religious sense. And it is photographed very well. The viewing angle you chose works well and the lighting shows off the subject''s beautiful lines and form.', '2003-11-01 10:54:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(469078, 44173, 12611, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting could be better, as well as the color, perhaps black and white</td>', 'I think the lighting could be better, as well as the color, perhaps black and white', '2003-11-01 11:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(469084, 43809, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting and viewpoint do a good job of showing off the flower''s graceful shape.</td>', 'The lighting and viewpoint do a good job of showing off the flower''s graceful shape.', '2003-11-01 11:20:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(469087, 44289, 1531, '<td valign="top">Your face up side down and christmas is coming... Can you fly as well?</td>', 'Your face up side down and christmas is coming... Can you fly as well?', '2003-11-01 11:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(469090, 44326, 1531, '<td valign="top">Incredible sky!</td>', 'Incredible sky!', '2003-11-01 11:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469101, 44285, 10402, '<td valign="top">Wow! Artistically stunning and technically perfect. Beautiful expression of grace; even the lines apparent in the nicely blurred background are graceful.</td>', 'Wow! Artistically stunning and technically perfect. Beautiful expression of grace; even the lines apparent in the nicely blurred background are graceful.', '2003-11-01 11:37:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(469103, 44207, 10402, '<td valign="top">The lighting shows off the graceful lines, three dimensional shape, and wonderful texture of this shell. The black background is perfect.</td>', 'The lighting shows off the graceful lines, three dimensional shape, and wonderful texture of this shell. The black background is perfect.', '2003-11-01 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(469175, 44328, 10275, '<td valign="top">This is one of the very best shots in this challenge. The composition is very good, love the sepia tone as it ads warmth. The baby''s expression is priceless - it''s as if the baby was looking up at God. Definitely fits the challenge. The only thing that I think distracts is the thick quadruple border. Why not use a simple line or double line at most. It really takes away from the powerful message of the photo. Still one of my top picks.</td>', 'This is one of the very best shots in this challenge. The composition is very good, love the sepia tone as it ads warmth. The baby''s expression is priceless - it''s as if the baby was looking up at God. Definitely fits the challenge. The only thing that I think distracts is the thick quadruple border. Why not use a simple line or double line at most. It really takes away from the powerful message of the photo. Still one of my top picks.', '2003-11-01 12:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(469191, 43579, 7487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but the abstract over to the left is very distracting for me.  You gotta take your shots, when you can get them though.  Great pic.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but the abstract over to the left is very distracting for me.  You gotta take your shots, when you can get them though.  Great pic.', '2003-11-01 12:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(469192, 44352, 7487, '<td valign="top">Great pic!!!!</td>', 'Great pic!!!!', '2003-11-01 12:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(469194, 44318, 7487, '<td valign="top">Wow!!!!  Excellent shot!!!!  Crisp, clean, and breath taking!!!!!  I love the colors.<br/>In a perfect world, I''d love to see the leaves in the top half of the pic in gold as well.  But that''s just me being picky!  Beautiful shot.... seriously!</td>', 'Wow!!!!  Excellent shot!!!!  Crisp, clean, and breath taking!!!!!  I love the colors.In a perfect world, I''d love to see the leaves in the top half of the pic in gold as well.  But that''s just me being picky!  Beautiful shot.... seriously!', '2003-11-01 13:00:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(469195, 44353, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-11-01 13:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(469200, 43684, 7487, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped more from the bottom.</td>', 'I would have cropped more from the bottom.', '2003-11-01 13:16:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(469202, 44280, 7487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I love the way you offset it. That really brought it out.</td>', 'Beautiful!  I love the way you offset it. That really brought it out.', '2003-11-01 13:17:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469203, 44110, 7369, '<td valign="top">The composition is good but I think the focus is very soft (perhaps too soft for my liking). This image could also use some more light (just a little to increase the ''whiteness'' of the white).</td>', 'The composition is good but I think the focus is very soft (perhaps too soft for my liking). This image could also use some more light (just a little to increase the ''whiteness'' of the white).', '2003-11-01 13:20:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469204, 43794, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent pic.  I would have taken the shine away though, before submitting it.  Great pic though!</td>', 'Excellent pic.  I would have taken the shine away though, before submitting it.  Great pic though!', '2003-11-01 13:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(469205, 44261, 7487, '<td valign="top">Excellent!</td>', 'Excellent!', '2003-11-01 13:20:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(469206, 43898, 7369, '<td valign="top">It is not considered polite to stare (for too long) at a ladies behind ;). I think you are too far away from the lady. The foreground shouldn''t be in the picture.</td>', 'It is not considered polite to stare (for too long) at a ladies behind ;). I think you are too far away from the lady. The foreground shouldn''t be in the picture.', '2003-11-01 13:22:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(469207, 43747, 7369, '<td valign="top">You sure have a good imagination :). This is one of my favourites of the week. Excellent colours, funny, good composition and focus. Well done (9).</td>', 'You sure have a good imagination :). This is one of my favourites of the week. Excellent colours, funny, good composition and focus. Well done (9).', '2003-11-01 13:25:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(469208, 44428, 13432, '<td valign="top">Very sweet...I love it.</td>', 'Very sweet...I love it.', '2003-11-01 13:26:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(469209, 44207, 13432, '<td valign="top">I love it....very, very good I''d say. 9</td>', 'I love it....very, very good I''d say. 9', '2003-11-01 13:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(469210, 44066, 13432, '<td valign="top">I love the idea....very good shot too, one of my favorites.  9</td>', 'I love the idea....very good shot too, one of my favorites.  9', '2003-11-01 13:28:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(469227, 43948, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great pic Nasti!<br/>I saw your serie of this model about thirtheen minutes after uploading to pbase, when I was browsing new galleries. I think this is definitely the best one of the lot. I love the pose, its a bit like classic pinup paintings. Seducing, styleful, positive. The red boa leads the eye along the body, but it is the seductive smile that really draws me into it.<br/>The shadowless lighting, without edge overexposure is very well done.<br/> <br/>One of my favourites.</td>', 'Great pic Nasti!I saw your serie of this model about thirtheen minutes after uploading to pbase, when I was browsing new galleries. I think this is definitely the best one of the lot. I love the pose, its a bit like classic pinup paintings. Seducing, styleful, positive. The red boa leads the eye along the body, but it is the seductive smile that really draws me into it.The shadowless lighting, without edge overexposure is very well done. One of my favourites.', '2003-11-01 13:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(469239, 44431, 9027, '<td valign="top">hahaha. funny shot. i know it can''t be helped, but wish the background was less busy. perhaps cropping in closer would have helped. the quirky elegance of the flamingo gets lost in all that brush. another possibility, maybe selective desaturation. :o)</td>', 'hahaha. funny shot. i know it can''t be helped, but wish the background was less busy. perhaps cropping in closer would have helped. the quirky elegance of the flamingo gets lost in all that brush. another possibility, maybe selective desaturation. :o)', '2003-11-01 13:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(469240, 44160, 9027, '<td valign="top">very nice, quiet shot. well composed. maybe a dab more contrast/saturation to bring out the clouds and trees more.</td>', 'very nice, quiet shot. well composed. maybe a dab more contrast/saturation to bring out the clouds and trees more.', '2003-11-01 14:00:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(469243, 44247, 9027, '<td valign="top">i feel the stark background and harsh lighting really takes away from the idea of grace. would have been more effective with softer lighting and a more natural background.</td>', 'i feel the stark background and harsh lighting really takes away from the idea of grace. would have been more effective with softer lighting and a more natural background.', '2003-11-01 14:01:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(469246, 43987, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice set up. great color choices, and love the shadows.</td>', 'nice set up. great color choices, and love the shadows.', '2003-11-01 14:02:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(469248, 43738, 9027, '<td valign="top">very nice reflection. focus a bit off.</td>', 'very nice reflection. focus a bit off.', '2003-11-01 14:03:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(469250, 44400, 9027, '<td valign="top">love the dancer-like quality the leaf evokes. simple, and great detail. :o)</td>', 'love the dancer-like quality the leaf evokes. simple, and great detail. :o)', '2003-11-01 14:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(469253, 43899, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautiful flower. could use a bit more contrast. zooming in may have added more drama.</td>', 'beautiful flower. could use a bit more contrast. zooming in may have added more drama.', '2003-11-01 14:06:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(469256, 43948, 9027, '<td valign="top">i think another pose would have said ''grace'' better. nice shoes though! haha.</td>', 'i think another pose would have said ''grace'' better. nice shoes though! haha.', '2003-11-01 14:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(469261, 44333, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the yellow cast to this. wish her feet were not cut off. looks like she''s falling asleep!</td>', 'i like the yellow cast to this. wish her feet were not cut off. looks like she''s falling asleep!', '2003-11-01 14:10:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469264, 44249, 9027, '<td valign="top">hehehe. cute statue. i think adjustments in contrast and saturation would have strenghtened this. also, bigger!!</td>', 'hehehe. cute statue. i think adjustments in contrast and saturation would have strenghtened this. also, bigger!!', '2003-11-01 14:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(469280, 44309, 11241, '<td valign="top">This photo looks more like digital art than photography....</td>', 'This photo looks more like digital art than photography....', '2003-11-01 14:40:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(469292, 43636, 11241, '<td valign="top">Photo is too small try 640 x 480</td>', 'Photo is too small try 640 x 480', '2003-11-01 15:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(469303, 44334, 13722, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea...</td>', 'Interesting idea...', '2003-11-01 15:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(469305, 43920, 13722, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.', '2003-11-01 15:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(469306, 44437, 13722, '<td valign="top">Absolutely breathtaking!</td>', 'Absolutely breathtaking!', '2003-11-01 15:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(469327, 43959, 9437, '<td valign="top">Being the owner of an equally enthusiastic canine, I know how hard this shot was to get. The focus is superb for the light you had available. 9</td>', 'Being the owner of an equally enthusiastic canine, I know how hard this shot was to get. The focus is superb for the light you had available. 9', '2003-11-01 16:05:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469329, 44346, 9437, '<td valign="top">The sepia tone really works here. So does the flowing robed angel. Unfortunately the bright background shape competes with the subject.</td>', 'The sepia tone really works here. So does the flowing robed angel. Unfortunately the bright background shape competes with the subject.', '2003-11-01 16:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(469331, 43489, 9437, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunrise or sunset shot. I like the colors and the luminence of the sky.</td>', 'Beautiful sunrise or sunset shot. I like the colors and the luminence of the sky.', '2003-11-01 16:10:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(469333, 44253, 9437, '<td valign="top">Very good high key portrait. I noticed the subtle framing of the subject. Well done. --10</td>', 'Very good high key portrait. I noticed the subtle framing of the subject. Well done. --10', '2003-11-01 16:15:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469334, 43497, 11570, '<td valign="top">Swimming with the dolphins wow!!!!!!!!!!!!!<br/> <br/>These sort of shots must be so difficult but as I have nothing or the knowledge  to compare it against together with the challenge meeting I will give you a 7</td>', 'Swimming with the dolphins wow!!!!!!!!!!!!! These sort of shots must be so difficult but as I have nothing or the knowledge  to compare it against together with the challenge meeting I will give you a 7', '2003-11-01 16:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(469336, 43564, 11570, '<td valign="top">Hmmmmmmmm!!! Grace in a landscape.<br/> <br/>I very much like what you have achieved here and the light and cloud formation are very nice.  If you did not have such a good use of flare I would have suggested cropping the dark foreground but overall very well done 8</td>', 'Hmmmmmmmm!!! Grace in a landscape. I very much like what you have achieved here and the light and cloud formation are very nice.  If you did not have such a good use of flare I would have suggested cropping the dark foreground but overall very well done 8', '2003-11-01 16:18:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(469337, 44422, 11570, '<td valign="top">An interesting subject to photograph - IMO such moving objects need to have blades just showing to give the feeling of movement then in this case Grace would have been better met.</td>', 'An interesting subject to photograph - IMO such moving objects need to have blades just showing to give the feeling of movement then in this case Grace would have been better met.', '2003-11-01 16:20:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(469338, 43991, 9437, '<td valign="top">One of the very few times a photo gets a 10 before it finishes downloading. Especially good: orange against black and difficulty of timing and focus.</td>', 'One of the very few times a photo gets a 10 before it finishes downloading. Especially good: orange against black and difficulty of timing and focus.', '2003-11-01 16:20:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(469340, 44318, 11570, '<td valign="top">Lovely soft colours - IMO the Grace would have been stronger if the foreground was cropped close to the base of the first tree.  As it is my eye keeps falling off the branches. 7</td>', 'Lovely soft colours - IMO the Grace would have been stronger if the foreground was cropped close to the base of the first tree.  As it is my eye keeps falling off the branches. 7', '2003-11-01 16:23:33.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(469342, 44444, 11570, '<td valign="top">Very nice treatment of the subject.  It is a pity about the lower left corner foreground. 7</td>', 'Very nice treatment of the subject.  It is a pity about the lower left corner foreground. 7', '2003-11-01 16:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(469343, 44416, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the impressionist look of this photo.</td>', 'I like the impressionist look of this photo.', '2003-11-01 16:25:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(469344, 43637, 9437, '<td valign="top">Nice even light on the subject. Cute child. Well done.</td>', 'Nice even light on the subject. Cute child. Well done.', '2003-11-01 16:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(469345, 43717, 11570, '<td valign="top">A real test of control of DOF unfortunately the eye and the small crest are just a little OOF but otherwise a great shot 7</td>', 'A real test of control of DOF unfortunately the eye and the small crest are just a little OOF but otherwise a great shot 7', '2003-11-01 16:27:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(469346, 44374, 9437, '<td valign="top">My instructor once said that a good photographer can get an interesting photo almost anywhere under any conditions. This qualifies. 8</td>', 'My instructor once said that a good photographer can get an interesting photo almost anywhere under any conditions. This qualifies. 8', '2003-11-01 16:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(469347, 44281, 11570, '<td valign="top">Now that takes me back but I used to climb regularly 30 years ago women climbers were very, very rare.<br/> <br/>As an image - IMO this needs to be tighter cropped on her she seems isolated in the overall area.</td>', 'Now that takes me back but I used to climb regularly 30 years ago women climbers were very, very rare. As an image - IMO this needs to be tighter cropped on her she seems isolated in the overall area.', '2003-11-01 16:29:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(469348, 43996, 9437, '<td valign="top">Monet would be proud.</td>', 'Monet would be proud.', '2003-11-01 16:31:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469349, 43436, 11570, '<td valign="top">What an unusual subject and shot.<br/> <br/>Image wise very strong composition and the B&amp;W treatment gives it a certain something. 7 I think.<br/> <br/>But where is his skatboard??????</td>', 'What an unusual subject and shot. Image wise very strong composition and the B&W treatment gives it a certain something. 7 I think. But where is his skatboard??????', '2003-11-01 16:31:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(469350, 44320, 9437, '<td valign="top">The swan''s beak could have easily gotten lost in the background. You kept it from doing that. Well done.</td>', 'The swan''s beak could have easily gotten lost in the background. You kept it from doing that. Well done.', '2003-11-01 16:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(469351, 43684, 9437, '<td valign="top">Love the super saturated colors. Good job.</td>', 'Love the super saturated colors. Good job.', '2003-11-01 16:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(469352, 43849, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good action shot. The red parachute makes this shot lively.  Were you along for the dive?</td>', 'Good action shot. The red parachute makes this shot lively.  Were you along for the dive?', '2003-11-01 16:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(469354, 44361, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good portrayal of contest theme. Difficult lighting situation handled well.</td>', 'Good portrayal of contest theme. Difficult lighting situation handled well.', '2003-11-01 16:38:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(469356, 44428, 9437, '<td valign="top">If Grace was a child, this would be her portrait. Well done.</td>', 'If Grace was a child, this would be her portrait. Well done.', '2003-11-01 16:39:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(469361, 43994, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the crisp look of this BW photo.</td>', 'I like the composition and the crisp look of this BW photo.', '2003-11-01 16:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469363, 44452, 9437, '<td valign="top">I like the color in this difficult-to-take action shot. Well done.</td>', 'I like the color in this difficult-to-take action shot. Well done.', '2003-11-01 16:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(469365, 44348, 9437, '<td valign="top">Good repeating pattern shot.</td>', 'Good repeating pattern shot.', '2003-11-01 16:47:35.000000', NULL, 1),
