(469494, 44247, 12809, '<td valign="top">I love this shot and gave it a 10.  I like the crisp white background and the simplicity of the image overall.  I also like how the shoes are off-centered.  The ballet shoes fit the theme so nicely because ballet is so graceful.  Super job.</td>', 'I love this shot and gave it a 10.  I like the crisp white background and the simplicity of the image overall.  I also like how the shoes are off-centered.  The ballet shoes fit the theme so nicely because ballet is so graceful.  Super job.', '2003-11-01 19:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(469515, 43785, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is so beautiful.  The curves in the Opera House and the curve of the bridge help this image fit the challenge.  The colors are great - nice blue water, pink sunrise (?) and blue sky.  The moon is a great addition.  I gave this a 10.  Great job!</td>', 'This is so beautiful.  The curves in the Opera House and the curve of the bridge help this image fit the challenge.  The colors are great - nice blue water, pink sunrise (?) and blue sky.  The moon is a great addition.  I gave this a 10.  Great job!', '2003-11-01 19:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(469525, 43785, 1531, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen many good photos of this building, but this one is probably the best of them (10)</td>', 'I''ve seen many good photos of this building, but this one is probably the best of them (10)', '2003-11-01 19:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469538, 44223, 12809, '<td valign="top">This image is SO cool!  I love it.  At first glance it''s like an illusion; the hands appear as though they could be real, but then you see the little person sweeping and you realize something is messing with you.    I love the sepia tint and the silhouetted hands.  Ten, very nice job.</td>', 'This image is SO cool!  I love it.  At first glance it''s like an illusion; the hands appear as though they could be real, but then you see the little person sweeping and you realize something is messing with you.    I love the sepia tint and the silhouetted hands.  Ten, very nice job.', '2003-11-01 19:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(469548, 44285, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like the soft, blurry colors.  It gives it a nice, warm feeling.  The lined up beads of water are great.  Nice job.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like the soft, blurry colors.  It gives it a nice, warm feeling.  The lined up beads of water are great.  Nice job.', '2003-11-01 19:42:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(469557, 44173, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Love the color you chose.  I think this could use just a slight CCW rotation to straighten it up a bit.  Otherwise, great job.</td>', 'Very nice.  Love the color you chose.  I think this could use just a slight CCW rotation to straighten it up a bit.  Otherwise, great job.', '2003-11-01 19:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(469564, 44328, 12809, '<td valign="top">Awwwwwww, how cute is she?!<br/> <br/>Beautiful job.  Original idea.  Love the sepia and everything about this.  Nice work!</td>', 'Awwwwwww, how cute is she?! Beautiful job.  Original idea.  Love the sepia and everything about this.  Nice work!', '2003-11-01 19:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
