(469570, 44232, 12809, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I love how all of their wings are super-extended and how none of the birds are really overlapping.  One minor thing I would suggest is to crop a bit off from the left where there''s just a tiny piece of rock (?) showing.  Nice job.</td>', 'Great shot!  I love how all of their wings are super-extended and how none of the birds are really overlapping.  One minor thing I would suggest is to crop a bit off from the left where there''s just a tiny piece of rock (?) showing.  Nice job.', '2003-11-01 19:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
