(469573, 44459, 12809, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the challenge.  The only thing I''m not sure about is the placement of the subject, I think I might like it a little bit lower in the shot.  Otherwise, great job.</td>', 'Interesting take on the challenge.  The only thing I''m not sure about is the placement of the subject, I think I might like it a little bit lower in the shot.  Otherwise, great job.', '2003-11-01 20:04:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(469574, 44261, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  I love how everything is stopped.  The ripples look so cool.  You can actually see the reflection in the drop.  The color of the leaf is very nice, but the folded up part on the right seem to be a bit too red..?<br/> <br/>Great job.</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  I love how everything is stopped.  The ripples look so cool.  You can actually see the reflection in the drop.  The color of the leaf is very nice, but the folded up part on the right seem to be a bit too red..? Great job.', '2003-11-01 20:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(469578, 44211, 12809, '<td valign="top">Just bumped this up from an 8 to a 9.  I really like this shot.  I like the dof with the dancers silhouetted in the background.  Nice placement of the porcelain girl and great color, too.  Nice job!</td>', 'Just bumped this up from an 8 to a 9.  I really like this shot.  I like the dof with the dancers silhouetted in the background.  Nice placement of the porcelain girl and great color, too.  Nice job!', '2003-11-01 20:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469579, 44400, 12809, '<td valign="top">So simple.  I like it.  Nice curvature in the leaf.  Looks nice in sepia.</td>', 'So simple.  I like it.  Nice curvature in the leaf.  Looks nice in sepia.', '2003-11-01 20:10:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(469582, 44394, 12809, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image.  The perturbed look on the kitty''s face makes it that much funnier!  Original idea.  <br/> <br/>Some things I see...<br/> <br/>It looks like you made some color adjustments because I can see some blue and green speckles on his legs and on his shadow.  I think I see some green on his face, too.  Also, I think a colored background would''ve helped the kitty, and particularly the tutu, stand out a little more.<br/> <br/>Nice job.</td>', 'This is a fun image.  The perturbed look on the kitty''s face makes it that much funnier!  Original idea.   Some things I see... It looks like you made some color adjustments because I can see some blue and green speckles on his legs and on his shadow.  I think I see some green on his face, too.  Also, I think a colored background would''ve helped the kitty, and particularly the tutu, stand out a little more. Nice job.', '2003-11-01 20:26:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(469585, 43649, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great capture of human culture and emiotion. Great clarity and toning. Nice setting and pose.</td>', 'Great capture of human culture and emiotion. Great clarity and toning. Nice setting and pose.', '2003-11-01 20:30:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(469586, 44227, 12809, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  The stark white background is very nice.  I may have cropped the left off a little to get ride of that tree.  It''s a bit distracting for me.  Nice job.</td>', 'I like this shot.  The stark white background is very nice.  I may have cropped the left off a little to get ride of that tree.  It''s a bit distracting for me.  Nice job.', '2003-11-01 20:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
