(469591, 44360, 3032, '<td valign="top">Cool infrared, with the emphasis on "cool". :)<br/>Nice toning, reflection adds a great bit to the photo. Like it how the branches form an arch over the creek.</td>', 'Cool infrared, with the emphasis on "cool". :)Nice toning, reflection adds a great bit to the photo. Like it how the branches form an arch over the creek.', '2003-11-01 20:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
