(469594, 44457, 12809, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, fits the theme well.  I think this would look nice in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice shot, fits the theme well.  I think this would look nice in b&w.', '2003-11-01 20:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(469599, 44318, 3032, '<td valign="top">Great scene and composition of it.<br/>Would do great as wallpaper on a real live wall. :)<br/>Good exposure and colors, saturation is nice, wonder about how it looks when the saturation is pushed a bit further.</td>', 'Great scene and composition of it.Would do great as wallpaper on a real live wall. :)Good exposure and colors, saturation is nice, wonder about how it looks when the saturation is pushed a bit further.', '2003-11-01 20:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
