(469610, 43963, 12809, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what I''m looking at here, sorry.</td>', 'I''m not really sure what I''m looking at here, sorry.', '2003-11-01 20:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(469611, 43636, 12809, '<td valign="top">I think a praying mantis would be a good subject for this challenge.  However, this shot is very blurry and the lighting is not very good.  I wish the image itself was larger so I could see the details better.</td>', 'I think a praying mantis would be a good subject for this challenge.  However, this shot is very blurry and the lighting is not very good.  I wish the image itself was larger so I could see the details better.', '2003-11-01 20:55:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(469614, 44106, 12809, '<td valign="top">While the image is nice and sharp, I don''t think text goes over too well here.  I myself rate these types of images lower because I don''t feel the shots are very challenging.</td>', 'While the image is nice and sharp, I don''t think text goes over too well here.  I myself rate these types of images lower because I don''t feel the shots are very challenging.', '2003-11-01 20:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(469616, 44451, 12809, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, I don''t find this image too outstanding.  I don''t think text, in general, goes over too well here.  I myself rate these types of images lower because I don''t feel the shots are very challenging.</td>', 'Unfortunately, I don''t find this image too outstanding.  I don''t think text, in general, goes over too well here.  I myself rate these types of images lower because I don''t feel the shots are very challenging.', '2003-11-01 20:58:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(469638, 43706, 6870, '<td valign="top">It''s amazing how the most awkward creatures can be so graceful at times. The curve of the wing here suggests grace, and every creature, I suppose, has some graceful features. If you  could possibly get closer and just show us the wing, the awkward head wouldn''t distract us from it. I like your composition here, with the animal in the upper part of the frame and the sky behind.</td>', 'It''s amazing how the most awkward creatures can be so graceful at times. The curve of the wing here suggests grace, and every creature, I suppose, has some graceful features. If you  could possibly get closer and just show us the wing, the awkward head wouldn''t distract us from it. I like your composition here, with the animal in the upper part of the frame and the sky behind.', '2003-11-01 22:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(469640, 43963, 6870, '<td valign="top">Ironic title. I like the leading line of the stick, and the point of view from above the head. I''m still just a bit puzzled, however, as to what it is I''m looking at or what you''re communicating here.</td>', 'Ironic title. I like the leading line of the stick, and the point of view from above the head. I''m still just a bit puzzled, however, as to what it is I''m looking at or what you''re communicating here.', '2003-11-01 22:25:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(469642, 44289, 6870, '<td valign="top">Interesting, gritty, grainy image. The point of view and focus instantly keeps me on the edge and wondering. I do admit to being a bit puzzled at what you''re communicating here, especially with the enigmatic title and Grace challenge.</td>', 'Interesting, gritty, grainy image. The point of view and focus instantly keeps me on the edge and wondering. I do admit to being a bit puzzled at what you''re communicating here, especially with the enigmatic title and Grace challenge.', '2003-11-01 22:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(469647, 43794, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is such a nice concept to communicate! Bravo! Your close-up point of view works here. I strongly suspect that had you used natural light, the image''s tonal range would have more depth, and this marvelously graceful couple would look a bit more natural. Try shooting them again (they''re worth it!) on a bright day, but in the shade.</td>', 'This is such a nice concept to communicate! Bravo! Your close-up point of view works here. I strongly suspect that had you used natural light, the image''s tonal range would have more depth, and this marvelously graceful couple would look a bit more natural. Try shooting them again (they''re worth it!) on a bright day, but in the shade.', '2003-11-01 22:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(469651, 43451, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very lovely concept to communicate! Your white background is very appropriate here, and the centered composition works well. You used a flash, and that caused some harsh highlights and shadows, so next time, try just going outside and shooting such an object in the shade on a bright day (I do most of my shots on my porch). Your colors and tones will be more natural and more inviting.</td>', 'Very lovely concept to communicate! Your white background is very appropriate here, and the centered composition works well. You used a flash, and that caused some harsh highlights and shadows, so next time, try just going outside and shooting such an object in the shade on a bright day (I do most of my shots on my porch). Your colors and tones will be more natural and more inviting.', '2003-11-01 22:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(469653, 44305, 6870, '<td valign="top">This is a really super idea! The idea that a child''s foot can be graceful is so lovely. I also like the natural pose here, and the colors of the jeans and pants. This shot might have worked better had the foot been more defined. We often think of graceful things as curvy, so working with that generalization, it would be nice to see the curve of the insole lit nicely. This eliminates your nice candid here, and you''d have to move your subject a little, but it might be worth experimenting with.</td>', 'This is a really super idea! The idea that a child''s foot can be graceful is so lovely. I also like the natural pose here, and the colors of the jeans and pants. This shot might have worked better had the foot been more defined. We often think of graceful things as curvy, so working with that generalization, it would be nice to see the curve of the insole lit nicely. This eliminates your nice candid here, and you''d have to move your subject a little, but it might be worth experimenting with.', '2003-11-01 22:38:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(469654, 44247, 6870, '<td valign="top">The simple idea that ballet shoes can be graceful is good, and it also evokes thoughts of ballet itself--the most graceful of dances, many would say. The light here seems a little harsh, taking away from the grace of the shoes and your communication. With harsh light comes harsh shadows and an unnatural feel. You might try just going outside on a bright day and shooting these objects in the shade. I like your white background, so go ahead and bring a white background. I shoot most of my images on my porch. Anyway, nice composition with the shoes on a strong node in the lower left, and again, I really enjoy the simplicity of this shot.</td>', 'The simple idea that ballet shoes can be graceful is good, and it also evokes thoughts of ballet itself--the most graceful of dances, many would say. The light here seems a little harsh, taking away from the grace of the shoes and your communication. With harsh light comes harsh shadows and an unnatural feel. You might try just going outside on a bright day and shooting these objects in the shade. I like your white background, so go ahead and bring a white background. I shoot most of my images on my porch. Anyway, nice composition with the shoes on a strong node in the lower left, and again, I really enjoy the simplicity of this shot.', '2003-11-01 22:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(469655, 44433, 6870, '<td valign="top">The sepia here works nicely to evoke nostalgic feeling, perhaps of when prayer was a more respected form of communication. You might try to experiment with just a bit more contrast to have darker darks and lighter lights. I would also recommend using natural light instead of a flash whenever possible. Nice, balanced composition.</td>', 'The sepia here works nicely to evoke nostalgic feeling, perhaps of when prayer was a more respected form of communication. You might try to experiment with just a bit more contrast to have darker darks and lighter lights. I would also recommend using natural light instead of a flash whenever possible. Nice, balanced composition.', '2003-11-01 22:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(469657, 44207, 6870, '<td valign="top">It''s almost like this shell has a motion blur to it in a circular motion. I love the lighting and tones here. 9</td>', 'It''s almost like this shell has a motion blur to it in a circular motion. I love the lighting and tones here. 9', '2003-11-01 22:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(469670, 44343, 12809, '<td valign="top">Cute cat.  The image is quite dark.  Some curves could have lightened it up a bit.  A little USM would''ve helped too.</td>', 'Cute cat.  The image is quite dark.  Some curves could have lightened it up a bit.  A little USM would''ve helped too.', '2003-11-01 23:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469673, 44453, 12809, '<td valign="top">Peacock feathers are beautiul and I think it could work for this challenge.  However, the background is so busy that the feather barely stands out.  I think the feather would look great on a solid (black?) background.</td>', 'Peacock feathers are beautiul and I think it could work for this challenge.  However, the background is so busy that the feather barely stands out.  I think the feather would look great on a solid (black?) background.', '2003-11-01 23:29:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(469675, 44143, 12809, '<td valign="top">Very pretty flowers.  At first I thought the background was solid, but taking a closer look I can see the doily/tablecloth.  I''m not sure if you could''ve removed it entirely without losing some of the coloring in the flowers.</td>', 'Very pretty flowers.  At first I thought the background was solid, but taking a closer look I can see the doily/tablecloth.  I''m not sure if you could''ve removed it entirely without losing some of the coloring in the flowers.', '2003-11-01 23:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(469743, 43996, 4767, '<td valign="top">NICE shot!  PLease show some out takes as well when this is over...</td>', 'NICE shot!  PLease show some out takes as well when this is over...', '2003-11-02 01:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(469745, 44302, 4767, '<td valign="top">WOW - what a sky!</td>', 'WOW - what a sky!', '2003-11-02 01:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(469746, 43794, 4767, '<td valign="top">A sweet picture.  Wish it had been natural light...</td>', 'A sweet picture.  Wish it had been natural light...', '2003-11-02 01:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(469750, 43636, 9027, '<td valign="top">image is blurred. the busy background causes the mantis to get lost. perhaps cropping closer, as well as having a sharper image. details get lost.</td>', 'image is blurred. the busy background causes the mantis to get lost. perhaps cropping closer, as well as having a sharper image. details get lost.', '2003-11-02 02:34:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(469751, 43717, 9027, '<td valign="top">great detail. especially in the feathers.</td>', 'great detail. especially in the feathers.', '2003-11-02 02:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469754, 44280, 9027, '<td valign="top">lovely lighting. really makes the rose glow. don\''t feel the horizontal crop really adds to the image. i think a centered crop would have been another option.</td>', 'lovely lighting. really makes the rose glow. don\''t feel the horizontal crop really adds to the image. i think a centered crop would have been another option.', '2003-11-02 02:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(469755, 44437, 9027, '<td valign="top">yikes, is this in cali where the fires are? anyway, the intense glow of the sun''s reflection makes the image look like its burning. interesting.</td>', 'yikes, is this in cali where the fires are? anyway, the intense glow of the sun''s reflection makes the image look like its burning. interesting.', '2003-11-02 02:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(469756, 44428, 9027, '<td valign="top">sweet picture, but lacks luster. could use more contrast/brightness. also saturation may help to bring out the colors more, esp the grass.</td>', 'sweet picture, but lacks luster. could use more contrast/brightness. also saturation may help to bring out the colors more, esp the grass.', '2003-11-02 02:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(469758, 43849, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice capture, but colors are very dull. might try some adjustments in the saturation to bring out the red and blues. also tweek the contrast/sharpness a bit to bring out definition.</td>', 'nice capture, but colors are very dull. might try some adjustments in the saturation to bring out the red and blues. also tweek the contrast/sharpness a bit to bring out definition.', '2003-11-02 02:41:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(469765, 43670, 13511, '<td valign="top">You should try to use alternative lighting to avoid the brightness of the flash when taking these close-up photos. I have found that a normal 100W globe works well when suspended above the subject (especially if it is a still)<br/></td>', 'You should try to use alternative lighting to avoid the brightness of the flash when taking these close-up photos. I have found that a normal 100W globe works well when suspended above the subject (especially if it is a still)', '2003-11-02 03:38:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(469773, 43926, 12432, '<td valign="top">The horse mane is well gracious and seems to be the only part really sharp. You could have focused on it by just cropping out about 1/5 on the right, as well as the first pole on the left, to get a square image, going well with this portrait.  DOF works well in the background. Nice soft colors but nose a bit overexposed in the whites.</td>', 'The horse mane is well gracious and seems to be the only part really sharp. You could have focused on it by just cropping out about 1/5 on the right, as well as the first pole on the left, to get a square image, going well with this portrait.  DOF works well in the background. Nice soft colors but nose a bit overexposed in the whites.', '2003-11-02 04:33:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469775, 44423, 12432, '<td valign="top">Not a bad idea, but the flash is not helping to convey the hands grace. It flattens the image. Whenever possible, when you have the possibility to arrange the lighting of a subject (which is the case of almost indoor shots), it''s better to try several lighting possibilities, including backlighting. It always gives a more artistic presentation of the subject.</td>', 'Not a bad idea, but the flash is not helping to convey the hands grace. It flattens the image. Whenever possible, when you have the possibility to arrange the lighting of a subject (which is the case of almost indoor shots), it''s better to try several lighting possibilities, including backlighting. It always gives a more artistic presentation of the subject.', '2003-11-02 04:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469776, 43649, 12432, '<td valign="top">This is a very good idea and the feeling of grace is well expressed. I really like your idea, would perhaps have moved the man a bit out of center, but that''s all. I was thinking of shooting from a lower point of view, but the horizon would have been disturbing on the body. Did you tried? Very nice and well realized shot (and good b/w choice)</td>', 'This is a very good idea and the feeling of grace is well expressed. I really like your idea, would perhaps have moved the man a bit out of center, but that''s all. I was thinking of shooting from a lower point of view, but the horizon would have been disturbing on the body. Did you tried? Very nice and well realized shot (and good b/w choice)', '2003-11-02 04:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(469782, 43872, 12432, '<td valign="top">Gracious indeed, nice symmetry of those necks works well. I would have placed the swanns off center. Not really sharp, and whites overexposed (lack of feathers deatails)</td>', 'Gracious indeed, nice symmetry of those necks works well. I would have placed the swanns off center. Not really sharp, and whites overexposed (lack of feathers deatails)', '2003-11-02 05:04:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(469783, 44294, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very original and certainly not an easy shot. The overall impression is really good, except for the blue flares bottom left. Nice and detailed sky. Needs some sharpness.</td>', 'Very original and certainly not an easy shot. The overall impression is really good, except for the blue flares bottom left. Nice and detailed sky. Needs some sharpness.', '2003-11-02 05:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(469784, 43785, 12432, '<td valign="top">Besides this stunning architecture, the moon is also a star here. Beautiful sky colors. All details are sharp, but also soft. Complementary curves of building and bridge are beautiful. Very well exposed and framed. Image is pure and high quality (Neatimage?). Nothing to regret. It''s very well done!</td>', 'Besides this stunning architecture, the moon is also a star here. Beautiful sky colors. All details are sharp, but also soft. Complementary curves of building and bridge are beautiful. Very well exposed and framed. Image is pure and high quality (Neatimage?). Nothing to regret. It''s very well done!', '2003-11-02 05:14:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(469785, 44035, 13611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but doesn''t really say grace,6.</td>', 'Nice shot, but doesn''t really say grace,6.', '2003-11-02 05:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(469786, 44132, 13611, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Says grace to me, composition might have been improved, 9.</td>', 'Nice shot. Says grace to me, composition might have been improved, 9.', '2003-11-02 05:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(469789, 44211, 10858, '<td valign="top">Maybe her hair is too close to the top frame, but I love the contrast between the warm browns and the cold blues, and I also like the silouette in the background a much! :-) Good job!</td>', 'Maybe her hair is too close to the top frame, but I love the contrast between the warm browns and the cold blues, and I also like the silouette in the background a much! :-) Good job!', '2003-11-02 07:07:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(469790, 43920, 10858, '<td valign="top">Maybe the second woman''s a bit dark for my taste, but except this, I love everything about the shot! The lighting, the colours, the movement, the composition, congrats! :-)</td>', 'Maybe the second woman''s a bit dark for my taste, but except this, I love everything about the shot! The lighting, the colours, the movement, the composition, congrats! :-)', '2003-11-02 07:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(469791, 43478, 10858, '<td valign="top">Another shot I really love, the beuatiful pastel-colours, composition, lighting and the effortless beauty and all! :-) One of the rare tens I gave during this challenge! :-)</td>', 'Another shot I really love, the beuatiful pastel-colours, composition, lighting and the effortless beauty and all! :-) One of the rare tens I gave during this challenge! :-)', '2003-11-02 07:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(469792, 44423, 10858, '<td valign="top">Interesting one, I like the subject because it''s unique on this challenge! :-)</td>', 'Interesting one, I like the subject because it''s unique on this challenge! :-)', '2003-11-02 07:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(469841, 43992, 6624, '<td valign="top">the strength of her hands is wonderful, nice job of reminding us that so often grace needs strength 8</td>', 'the strength of her hands is wonderful, nice job of reminding us that so often grace needs strength 8', '2003-11-02 09:24:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(469842, 44428, 6624, '<td valign="top">enchanting image and wonderful feet..the expression is good as well...the precursor to grace as we think of it but holding it all right there in the upper body 8</td>', 'enchanting image and wonderful feet..the expression is good as well...the precursor to grace as we think of it but holding it all right there in the upper body 8', '2003-11-02 09:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(469845, 44242, 12432, '<td valign="top">Impressive bridge. Your association with grace? Why not... Perhaps a closer view, more on the right, and taken closer to the ground would have been better, because the bushes in the foreground are not adding anything to what you wanted to express. Good exposure, colors and sharpness. Needs untilting by 1,5° ccw.</td>', 'Impressive bridge. Your association with grace? Why not... Perhaps a closer view, more on the right, and taken closer to the ground would have been better, because the bushes in the foreground are not adding anything to what you wanted to express. Good exposure, colors and sharpness. Needs untilting by 1,5° ccw.', '2003-11-02 09:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(469846, 44326, 12432, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky and well catched rays. Good title too. Foreground little bush plays a useful role here, by showing the sky''s direction. Very well done.</td>', 'Beautiful sky and well catched rays. Good title too. Foreground little bush plays a useful role here, by showing the sky''s direction. Very well done.', '2003-11-02 09:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(469849, 44355, 12432, '<td valign="top">IMO, the statue is not that graceful, with such heavy arms, but you managed quite well by isolating it from the rest of the image (PS, I suppose). Fact that others satues are around  makes this shot more interesting that if statue was alone. The pedestal of the right statue is a bit distractive.</td>', 'IMO, the statue is not that graceful, with such heavy arms, but you managed quite well by isolating it from the rest of the image (PS, I suppose). Fact that others satues are around  makes this shot more interesting that if statue was alone. The pedestal of the right statue is a bit distractive.', '2003-11-02 09:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(469850, 43606, 12432, '<td valign="top">Looks like an underexposed chocolate duck that went thru some postprocessing, except the crown. The idea is clever., and the ducks contours are graceful. I would crop out just where the chest joins the frame, darken completely the duck, brighten yellow colors on the crown and desaturate the sky colors. Black and white, with just the colored crown should also be tried. Might work well. I saved your image to try a workshop.</td>', 'Looks like an underexposed chocolate duck that went thru some postprocessing, except the crown. The idea is clever., and the ducks contours are graceful. I would crop out just where the chest joins the frame, darken completely the duck, brighten yellow colors on the crown and desaturate the sky colors. Black and white, with just the colored crown should also be tried. Might work well. I saved your image to try a workshop.', '2003-11-02 09:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(469851, 43991, 12432, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how it has been composed, but the result is stunning. Details are present but it''s not oversharpened. Perfect background (colorwise and sober). It''s definitly graceful too. One of the best ones up to now.</td>', 'I don''t know how it has been composed, but the result is stunning. Details are present but it''s not oversharpened. Perfect background (colorwise and sober). It''s definitly graceful too. One of the best ones up to now.', '2003-11-02 09:56:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(469871, 43920, 12061, '<td valign="top">theme : 2/3<br/>lighting: 3/3<br/>overall quality: 3/4<br/> <br/>I still feel something is missing in the theme, its not represented clearly...maybe its just me =/ Excellent job.</td>', 'theme : 2/3lighting: 3/3overall quality: 3/4 I still feel something is missing in the theme, its not represented clearly...maybe its just me =/ Excellent job.', '2003-11-02 11:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(469922, 44394, 2567, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the giggle.  Good shot, nice coloring.</td>', 'Thanks for the giggle.  Good shot, nice coloring.', '2003-11-02 12:16:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(469936, 44285, 12151, '<td valign="top">Very effective use of out-of-focus blurring for the overall pattern.</td>', 'Very effective use of out-of-focus blurring for the overall pattern.', '2003-11-02 12:42:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(469952, 43872, 13432, '<td valign="top">Nice.</td>', 'Nice.', '2003-11-02 13:32:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(469955, 44449, 13432, '<td valign="top">Very nice, good moment captured. 8</td>', 'Very nice, good moment captured. 8', '2003-11-02 13:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(469957, 44326, 13432, '<td valign="top">Wow...I love it, definitely one of my favorites. 10</td>', 'Wow...I love it, definitely one of my favorites. 10', '2003-11-02 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(469966, 44328, 13551, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Al the elements are there to tell the story.</td>', 'Nice capture. Al the elements are there to tell the story.', '2003-11-02 14:44:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(469967, 43879, 13551, '<td valign="top">Nice colours but the focus looks a bit off to me.</td>', 'Nice colours but the focus looks a bit off to me.', '2003-11-02 14:45:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(469969, 44336, 13551, '<td valign="top">Great colours and sharpness. Looks a bit more like power than grace to me though. A single skater might have fitted the brief better. Brilliant shot.</td>', 'Great colours and sharpness. Looks a bit more like power than grace to me though. A single skater might have fitted the brief better. Brilliant shot.', '2003-11-02 14:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(469970, 44261, 13551, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colours and composition. Not an easy shot to take. I would have liked to see the more depth of field or a faster shutter speed. Whatever was needed to make the drop sharper.</td>', 'Beautiful colours and composition. Not an easy shot to take. I would have liked to see the more depth of field or a faster shutter speed. Whatever was needed to make the drop sharper.', '2003-11-02 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(469971, 44359, 13551, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Not sure about the border.</td>', 'Great shot. Not sure about the border.', '2003-11-02 14:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(469976, 43992, 13551, '<td valign="top">Great light. Fits the brief very well and the panoramic format works brilliantly.</td>', 'Great light. Fits the brief very well and the panoramic format works brilliantly.', '2003-11-02 14:53:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(469978, 43795, 13551, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot. There is a hint of comedy, romance and nostalgia about this. The old lady perhaps about to send a letter to a loved one doused in her favourite scent. I really don''t like the border but that is a personal thing. Must be one of the best in this competition</td>', 'Fantastic shot. There is a hint of comedy, romance and nostalgia about this. The old lady perhaps about to send a letter to a loved one doused in her favourite scent. I really don''t like the border but that is a personal thing. Must be one of the best in this competition', '2003-11-02 14:57:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(469979, 43785, 13551, '<td valign="top">Beautiful night shot.</td>', 'Beautiful night shot.', '2003-11-02 14:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(469980, 44314, 13551, '<td valign="top">Excellent title.</td>', 'Excellent title.', '2003-11-02 15:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(469981, 44349, 13551, '<td valign="top">Beautiful and very graceful. The sky is excellent and the glow of the burner works well.</td>', 'Beautiful and very graceful. The sky is excellent and the glow of the burner works well.', '2003-11-02 15:02:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(469984, 44189, 12194, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The sharpness is amazing - I love how you can see the veins of the leaf. Also, a very cool color combination!!! 9</td>', 'Very nice! The sharpness is amazing - I love how you can see the veins of the leaf. Also, a very cool color combination!!! 9', '2003-11-02 15:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(469986, 44166, 8597, '<td valign="top">This is quite beautiful!</td>', 'This is quite beautiful!', '2003-11-02 15:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(469987, 44385, 8597, '<td valign="top">Nice image -- a bit of cropping might improve the composition by eliminating some of the distractions.  Just a thought...</td>', 'Nice image -- a bit of cropping might improve the composition by eliminating some of the distractions.  Just a thought...', '2003-11-02 15:24:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(469988, 43785, 8597, '<td valign="top">Great color!</td>', 'Great color!', '2003-11-02 15:24:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(469990, 43991, 63, '<td valign="top">The orange glow is distracting for me.</td>', 'The orange glow is distracting for me.', '2003-11-02 15:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(469991, 43649, 7778, '<td valign="top">Not a textbook composition (near-central, minimally left-tilted horizon, central subject in wide format, somewhat tightly cropped cloud swaths), but a glorious and powerful biblical image, given the spectacular scape and conditions (light, breeze etc). Pose and billowing white gown are striking and dramatically credible in this setting. The pure white, particularly, provides both a focal point within the changing tonalities of the ground and a convincing symbolism.<br/> <br/>Both title and border are appropiate extensions of this image. Excellent, beautiful, visionary.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Not a textbook composition (near-central, minimally left-tilted horizon, central subject in wide format, somewhat tightly cropped cloud swaths), but a glorious and powerful biblical image, given the spectacular scape and conditions (light, breeze etc). Pose and billowing white gown are striking and dramatically credible in this setting. The pure white, particularly, provides both a focal point within the changing tonalities of the ground and a convincing symbolism. Both title and border are appropiate extensions of this image. Excellent, beautiful, visionary.  ', '2003-11-02 15:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(469995, 44309, 63, '<td valign="top">How did you accomplish this and stay legal, hope you tell us.  It''s great.</td>', 'How did you accomplish this and stay legal, hope you tell us.  It''s great.', '2003-11-02 15:54:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(469999, 44432, 13551, '<td valign="top">Beautiful light and composition.</td>', 'Beautiful light and composition.', '2003-11-02 16:05:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(470020, 43996, 12432, '<td valign="top">Graceful indeed, plus a very present touch of impressionism in the background. If Claude Monet had painted animals, he would have painted what you saw. Water ripples under the beak are perfect. Original by it''s colors. Well done.</td>', 'Graceful indeed, plus a very present touch of impressionism in the background. If Claude Monet had painted animals, he would have painted what you saw. Water ripples under the beak are perfect. Original by it''s colors. Well done.', '2003-11-02 16:48:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(470021, 44432, 12432, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, difficult to express, but well done due to clever lighting. Conveys exactly what it is all about.</td>', 'Nice idea, difficult to express, but well done due to clever lighting. Conveys exactly what it is all about.', '2003-11-02 16:51:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(470022, 44422, 12432, '<td valign="top">Not really on topic, but good framing and attractive view of a trivial object.</td>', 'Not really on topic, but good framing and attractive view of a trivial object.', '2003-11-02 16:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(470077, 43649, 10402, '<td valign="top">A nearly centered horizon tends to split an image in half, and this is no exception. But it works here because the split emphasizes the difference between God and man. Similarly, centering the subject doesn''t give it as much attention as following the rule of thirds would. But that works here too because you want the center of attention to be God, which you can''t depict directly. But the model''s raised arms direct the viewer''s attention that way. So I think the composition is very effective even though you broke two "rules".</td>', 'A nearly centered horizon tends to split an image in half, and this is no exception. But it works here because the split emphasizes the difference between God and man. Similarly, centering the subject doesn''t give it as much attention as following the rule of thirds would. But that works here too because you want the center of attention to be God, which you can''t depict directly. But the model''s raised arms direct the viewer''s attention that way. So I think the composition is very effective even though you broke two "rules".', '2003-11-02 18:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(470080, 43636, 10402, '<td valign="top">I think these insects are graceful too, but it doesn''t really come across in this image. The composition is good, but the image is too small and blurry.</td>', 'I think these insects are graceful too, but it doesn''t really come across in this image. The composition is good, but the image is too small and blurry.', '2003-11-02 18:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(470085, 44211, 10402, '<td valign="top">The white silhouetted dancers make a great background for the photo of this figurine and adds to the message of grace.</td>', 'The white silhouetted dancers make a great background for the photo of this figurine and adds to the message of grace.', '2003-11-02 18:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(470086, 43962, 10739, '<td valign="top">A pity. The thubmnail was awesome, but the large pic is spoiled by the artifacts in the image (looks like too much compression or strong digital zoom). Try locating the tree off-centered</td>', 'A pity. The thubmnail was awesome, but the large pic is spoiled by the artifacts in the image (looks like too much compression or strong digital zoom). Try locating the tree off-centered', '2003-11-02 18:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(470089, 44289, 10402, '<td valign="top">I don''t really understand this one. All I see is a very noisy image of an upside-down face close-up. I don''t see any relationship to either christmas or grace. Is there supposed to be a deeper meaning?</td>', 'I don''t really understand this one. All I see is a very noisy image of an upside-down face close-up. I don''t see any relationship to either christmas or grace. Is there supposed to be a deeper meaning?', '2003-11-02 18:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(470091, 44242, 10739, '<td valign="top">really cool the final result. Things I would try to improve: a bit less exposed (to darken the green parts) and the sky is a bit noisy.</td>', 'really cool the final result. Things I would try to improve: a bit less exposed (to darken the green parts) and the sky is a bit noisy.', '2003-11-02 18:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(470094, 43994, 10739, '<td valign="top">This picture is really nice, very expresive, however I don''t think Grace was the best challenge topic for it</td>', 'This picture is really nice, very expresive, however I don''t think Grace was the best challenge topic for it', '2003-11-02 18:30:39.000000', NULL, 1),
