(470185, 44340, 3306, '<td valign="top">Interesting picture but its difficult to see the subject. I had to look for a while before I realized he was sitting on a block of something.</td>', 'Interesting picture but its difficult to see the subject. I had to look for a while before I realized he was sitting on a block of something.', '2003-11-02 20:19:29.000000', NULL, 1),
