(470253, 44318, 7778, '<td valign="top">I can see why one would choose this title. With a quietly rioting capture like this, I''d consider a more subtle one, perhaps, to leave much to the viewer (?). The latent message of this image strikes me as pervasively universal, one not requiring a messenger at all.<br/> <br/>The gracious aspect, to me, is strongly emphasized by the branches draping so wide across what appers to be a plateau or bluff, which bowers an obscured roadway.<br/> <br/>The light, too, is splendid. A great natural spectacle without flaw or articfice.</td>', 'I can see why one would choose this title. With a quietly rioting capture like this, I''d consider a more subtle one, perhaps, to leave much to the viewer (?). The latent message of this image strikes me as pervasively universal, one not requiring a messenger at all. The gracious aspect, to me, is strongly emphasized by the branches draping so wide across what appers to be a plateau or bluff, which bowers an obscured roadway. The light, too, is splendid. A great natural spectacle without flaw or articfice.', '2003-11-02 21:14:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(470259, 44189, 7778, '<td valign="top">Flawless, intricate, well composed, informative, as perfect as the subject. Great sample for a 10D! :-)</td>', 'Flawless, intricate, well composed, informative, as perfect as the subject. Great sample for a 10D! :-)', '2003-11-02 21:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(470285, 44353, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very graceful. A more effective composition would have more space in front of the bird than behind it. But that''s not always easy when shooting moving animals with a sluggish camera.</td>', 'Very graceful. A more effective composition would have more space in front of the bird than behind it. But that''s not always easy when shooting moving animals with a sluggish camera.', '2003-11-02 21:47:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(470292, 44362, 7628, '<td valign="top">spectacular color.  Some leave glow with back light, some leaves show great texture as the sulight goes accross them.  Nice.</td>', 'spectacular color.  Some leave glow with back light, some leaves show great texture as the sulight goes accross them.  Nice.', '2003-11-02 21:54:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(470297, 43738, 7628, '<td valign="top">The delicate ripples of the water are as graceful as the goose.  I wish the bird were sharper, and perhaps you could crip in a bit more from the bottom and right to make it a bit less centered</td>', 'The delicate ripples of the water are as graceful as the goose.  I wish the bird were sharper, and perhaps you could crip in a bit more from the bottom and right to make it a bit less centered', '2003-11-02 21:56:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(470300, 43991, 10402, '<td valign="top">An amazing shot! Beautiful and very graceful. Great composition and focus. A bit soft and there seems to be a slight color cast; some sharpening and color balance tweaking might improve it.</td>', 'An amazing shot! Beautiful and very graceful. Great composition and focus. A bit soft and there seems to be a slight color cast; some sharpening and color balance tweaking might improve it.', '2003-11-02 21:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(470301, 44309, 6771, '<td valign="top">This is a very beautiful picture(?)  I love the colors and effects.  I can see how this could be done, but it looks more like a painting now than a photograph.  I am not voting, just commenting on this challenge, but I would give this an much above average score.  nice work</td>', 'This is a very beautiful picture(?)  I love the colors and effects.  I can see how this could be done, but it looks more like a painting now than a photograph.  I am not voting, just commenting on this challenge, but I would give this an much above average score.  nice work', '2003-11-02 21:58:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(470302, 44223, 7628, '<td valign="top">fascinating.  What dramatic lighting, attention getting composition, the hands reaching up against the back light, and the little figure hunched over.</td>', 'fascinating.  What dramatic lighting, attention getting composition, the hands reaching up against the back light, and the little figure hunched over.', '2003-11-02 21:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(470304, 43564, 6771, '<td valign="top">Holy crap!  Looks almost like my highest rated photo! (garnered a 4th-Good Luck to you!)  Love the colors and silhouette.</td>', 'Holy crap!  Looks almost like my highest rated photo! (garnered a 4th-Good Luck to you!)  Love the colors and silhouette.', '2003-11-02 22:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(470306, 44386, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the angle so that the cross is included in the background.  A softer lighting would add to the feel of the prayer - not a flash, perhaps a light from the back so the child is in silhouette, with another light to pick out the cross -</td>', 'I like the angle so that the cross is included in the background.  A softer lighting would add to the feel of the prayer - not a flash, perhaps a light from the back so the child is in silhouette, with another light to pick out the cross -', '2003-11-02 22:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(470307, 44336, 10402, '<td valign="top">Hockey doesn''t usually come to mind when I think of grace, but you''ve captured it nicely (once I convince myself that #9 isn''t about to clobber #2 with his stick). A bit contrasty, but that sort of goes with the sport.</td>', 'Hockey doesn''t usually come to mind when I think of grace, but you''ve captured it nicely (once I convince myself that #9 isn''t about to clobber #2 with his stick). A bit contrasty, but that sort of goes with the sport.', '2003-11-02 22:01:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(470309, 43564, 7628, '<td valign="top">the warm glow of the sun contrast well with the cool diagonals of the clouds and sky.  I like the choice to make this a long composition, emphasizing the horizon.</td>', 'the warm glow of the sun contrast well with the cool diagonals of the clouds and sky.  I like the choice to make this a long composition, emphasizing the horizon.', '2003-11-02 22:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(470311, 44419, 6771, '<td valign="top">this is a beautiful shot.  Nice use of the sun as backlighting and also getting the exposure in fill flash(?)  The flowers appear just a bit washed out in color and slight noise in the sky.</td>', 'this is a beautiful shot.  Nice use of the sun as backlighting and also getting the exposure in fill flash(?)  The flowers appear just a bit washed out in color and slight noise in the sky.', '2003-11-02 22:03:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(470313, 44147, 7628, '<td valign="top">A nice idea - certainly true that such places can be full of real grace, but the photo is very stark, perhaps the lighting could have been warmer and the composition more focused, welcoming.  Perhaps with people - it is the people that bring the grace after all.</td>', 'A nice idea - certainly true that such places can be full of real grace, but the photo is very stark, perhaps the lighting could have been warmer and the composition more focused, welcoming.  Perhaps with people - it is the people that bring the grace after all.', '2003-11-02 22:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(470315, 44340, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the almost hidden figure, blending in with the trees, at peace with the surroundings.  I like the horizontal composition, meks me feel like I am walking through the woods, peering through the trees.  Seems like it could be sharper.</td>', 'I like the almost hidden figure, blending in with the trees, at peace with the surroundings.  I like the horizontal composition, meks me feel like I am walking through the woods, peering through the trees.  Seems like it could be sharper.', '2003-11-02 22:09:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(470318, 43994, 7628, '<td valign="top">grace by contrast - the organic lines of the leaf against the stark perpendiculars of the fence.</td>', 'grace by contrast - the organic lines of the leaf against the stark perpendiculars of the fence.', '2003-11-02 22:11:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(470326, 44333, 10402, '<td valign="top">A strong yellow cast here. Yellow symbo;izes optimism, sunshine, and happiness, but also hazard. All are appropriate for a two-year-old!</td>', 'A strong yellow cast here. Yellow symbo;izes optimism, sunshine, and happiness, but also hazard. All are appropriate for a two-year-old!', '2003-11-02 22:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(470333, 44189, 7628, '<td valign="top">One of my two favorites - I adore the detail, the simple whiteness, the curve of the edge, perfect against the soft green (great use of DOF)Nice composition with the line coming down into the corner, leaninding up into the curl at the top.  Wonderful. 10</td>', 'One of my two favorites - I adore the detail, the simple whiteness, the curve of the edge, perfect against the soft green (great use of DOF)Nice composition with the line coming down into the corner, leaninding up into the curl at the top.  Wonderful. 10', '2003-11-02 22:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(470335, 44318, 7628, '<td valign="top">feels like something out of Middle Earth.  I like the lines of light under the trees, the branches arching above. 9</td>', 'feels like something out of Middle Earth.  I like the lines of light under the trees, the branches arching above. 9', '2003-11-02 22:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(470336, 43576, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very colorful, and I suppose graceful. A bit jumbled for my tastes, but I do like the mist.</td>', 'Very colorful, and I suppose graceful. A bit jumbled for my tastes, but I do like the mist.', '2003-11-02 22:30:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(470338, 43649, 7628, '<td valign="top">Wonderful.  One of my two favorites - this one is so emotionally and visually compelling.  The guestures of the figure, the billowing robes that stand out from the bright sand, suspeniding the arms and focusing the viewer on their gesture appealing to the line of the horizon - the lines of clouds give such a feeling of distance and size of the world yet are simple anough to bring our eyes back to the figure and wonder how he fits in. 10 As much as I like my other favorite - this one is SO compelling, it HAS to win.  Good Luck!</td>', 'Wonderful.  One of my two favorites - this one is so emotionally and visually compelling.  The guestures of the figure, the billowing robes that stand out from the bright sand, suspeniding the arms and focusing the viewer on their gesture appealing to the line of the horizon - the lines of clouds give such a feeling of distance and size of the world yet are simple anough to bring our eyes back to the figure and wonder how he fits in. 10 As much as I like my other favorite - this one is SO compelling, it HAS to win.  Good Luck!', '2003-11-02 22:32:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(470340, 44363, 7485, '<td valign="top">Nice IR! Slightly wider crop (full tree, path to the corner) would be even better</td>', 'Nice IR! Slightly wider crop (full tree, path to the corner) would be even better', '2003-11-02 22:35:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(470341, 44419, 7485, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lighting!</td>', 'Gorgeous lighting!', '2003-11-02 22:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(470342, 44335, 7485, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but I would have cropped the bottom of (maybe such that the shoreline was a little below center)</td>', 'Very nice, but I would have cropped the bottom of (maybe such that the shoreline was a little below center)', '2003-11-02 22:41:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(470344, 44349, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good composition, but the sky lacks interest. Maybe darker and higher contrast?</td>', 'Good composition, but the sky lacks interest. Maybe darker and higher contrast?', '2003-11-02 22:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(470345, 44110, 10402, '<td valign="top">Very graceful (except perhaps for the thorn), but the white seems a bit dingy. And although some softness helps convey a feeling of grace, I think this image needs just a little sharpening. But though a bit lacking technically, the artistry of this image is superb.</td>', 'Very graceful (except perhaps for the thorn), but the white seems a bit dingy. And although some softness helps convey a feeling of grace, I think this image needs just a little sharpening. But though a bit lacking technically, the artistry of this image is superb.', '2003-11-02 22:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(470347, 44285, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great DOF, but maybe not the best subject for high-key? Still a really nice image...</td>', 'Great DOF, but maybe not the best subject for high-key? Still a really nice image...', '2003-11-02 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(470348, 43795, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and model, but the saturated whites are a problem</td>', 'Great idea and model, but the saturated whites are a problem', '2003-11-02 22:51:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(470352, 43649, 7485, '<td valign="top">One of the best photos in not just this challenge but all the challenges I''ve seen here so far! A perfect 10 and a sure winner. The composition and tonal scale are just amazing.</td>', 'One of the best photos in not just this challenge but all the challenges I''ve seen here so far! A perfect 10 and a sure winner. The composition and tonal scale are just amazing.', '2003-11-02 22:54:52.000000', NULL, 1),
