(470362, 44449, 1570, '<td valign="top">i rated this picture at 7, i like it a lot, even it''s grayish, foggy quality if only the duck wasn''t there!</td>', 'i rated this picture at 7, i like it a lot, even it''s grayish, foggy quality if only the duck wasn''t there!', '2003-11-02 23:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
