(470372, 44319, 1570, '<td valign="top">i rated this picture at 6, nice still life...</td>', 'i rated this picture at 6, nice still life...', '2003-11-02 23:07:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(470375, 44286, 1570, '<td valign="top">i rated this picture at 6, i think it got cropped too tightly to the chestnut horse or course...</td>', 'i rated this picture at 6, i think it got cropped too tightly to the chestnut horse or course...', '2003-11-02 23:10:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(470391, 44386, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint here; shooting from their point of view is usually more flattering for children and in this case it also let you include the crucifix which adds to the story. The flash cast a harsh shadow on the wall that I find rather distracting.</td>', 'Great viewpoint here; shooting from their point of view is usually more flattering for children and in this case it also let you include the crucifix which adds to the story. The flash cast a harsh shadow on the wall that I find rather distracting.', '2003-11-02 23:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(470393, 44416, 10402, '<td valign="top">Grace is apparent here on several levels. Besides the symbolism given in the title, and the grace of the fish itself, the rocks and the water ripples are very graceful. And the distortion of the water gives this image an impressionistic appearance that I find beautiful and graceful.</td>', 'Grace is apparent here on several levels. Besides the symbolism given in the title, and the grace of the fish itself, the rocks and the water ripples are very graceful. And the distortion of the water gives this image an impressionistic appearance that I find beautiful and graceful.', '2003-11-02 23:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(470411, 44341, 6870, '<td valign="top">You are absolutely right! How can frogs not be graceful? Especially gussied up frogs like these! I love the idea, and the direction from which the light is coming is very nice. To get an image with perhaps more friendly light, take away the flash or the bright light you''re using and experiment with sunlight on a bright day--but in the shade. I take mine in the shade of my front porch. This will give you nice light without the harsh shadows. Lively and fun shot!</td>', 'You are absolutely right! How can frogs not be graceful? Especially gussied up frogs like these! I love the idea, and the direction from which the light is coming is very nice. To get an image with perhaps more friendly light, take away the flash or the bright light you''re using and experiment with sunlight on a bright day--but in the shade. I take mine in the shade of my front porch. This will give you nice light without the harsh shadows. Lively and fun shot!', '2003-11-03 00:03:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(470415, 43737, 6870, '<td valign="top">The idea of an old shoe being graceful is really intriguing to me. This image tells stories, and so I like it a lot. It''s a tad out of focus, but the lighting is good, and I like the yellowish look to it, too. You might go textbook rule of thirds here, which would evoke thoughts and infer things beyond the frame of the image. Nice work.</td>', 'The idea of an old shoe being graceful is really intriguing to me. This image tells stories, and so I like it a lot. It''s a tad out of focus, but the lighting is good, and I like the yellowish look to it, too. You might go textbook rule of thirds here, which would evoke thoughts and infer things beyond the frame of the image. Nice work.', '2003-11-03 00:05:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(470655, 44224, 9027, '<td valign="top">nice idea. good lighting. love the clarity in the petals. would have liked to see the stem...perhaps.</td>', 'nice idea. good lighting. love the clarity in the petals. would have liked to see the stem...perhaps.', '2003-11-03 03:01:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(470657, 43794, 9027, '<td valign="top">the lighting reflecting off their skin (teeth and eyes also) ruins this a bit for me. perhaps with more subtle, softer lighting.</td>', 'the lighting reflecting off their skin (teeth and eyes also) ruins this a bit for me. perhaps with more subtle, softer lighting.', '2003-11-03 03:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(470659, 44355, 9027, '<td valign="top">nicely done. is this a figurine or something? how''d u get the white bg.</td>', 'nicely done. is this a figurine or something? how''d u get the white bg.', '2003-11-03 03:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(470661, 44326, 9027, '<td valign="top">beautiful clouds. love the blue tones in this. :o)</td>', 'beautiful clouds. love the blue tones in this. :o)', '2003-11-03 03:04:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(470663, 44227, 9027, '<td valign="top">cropping a bit strange. esp with the branch on the corner. could use slight adjustments in brightness to allow the details in the shadow to stand out more.</td>', 'cropping a bit strange. esp with the branch on the corner. could use slight adjustments in brightness to allow the details in the shadow to stand out more.', '2003-11-03 03:05:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(470665, 44243, 9027, '<td valign="top">overly processed, esp. evident in her lower torso. i think a more neutral shirt would have allowed her to stand out more. the cropping in the foreground seems a bit awkward.</td>', 'overly processed, esp. evident in her lower torso. i think a more neutral shirt would have allowed her to stand out more. the cropping in the foreground seems a bit awkward.', '2003-11-03 03:08:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(470666, 44361, 10858, '<td valign="top">This could have been a really good shot, but I think it''s too dark...</td>', 'This could have been a really good shot, but I think it''s too dark...', '2003-11-03 03:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(470667, 43564, 9027, '<td valign="top">i like the panoramic feel of this.  nice silohuetting. would like the sun to be shifted a little bit more off center.</td>', 'i like the panoramic feel of this.  nice silohuetting. would like the sun to be shifted a little bit more off center.', '2003-11-03 03:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(470670, 44318, 9027, '<td valign="top">thumbnail caught my attention. beautiful capture!!! love the colors and the organic curves created from the branches.</td>', 'thumbnail caught my attention. beautiful capture!!! love the colors and the organic curves created from the branches.', '2003-11-03 03:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(470672, 44285, 9027, '<td valign="top">love this abstract capture. nice dof.</td>', 'love this abstract capture. nice dof.', '2003-11-03 03:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
