(470691, 44449, 10084, '<td valign="top">Going through the entries again and commenting and came upon yours again. Up the score from a \"7\" to a \"10\" .<br/> <br/>Looking at the hazy background gives me the goosebumps. You know when you feel the cool, chilly air hit your skin. The \"graceful\" swan with the wings spread looks great. Beautiful reflection in the water. The duck also helps to add interest to the shot. Negative space is great and helps with the composition. Wonderful shot.</td>', 'Going through the entries again and commenting and came upon yours again. Up the score from a \"7\" to a \"10\" . Looking at the hazy background gives me the goosebumps. You know when you feel the cool, chilly air hit your skin. The \"graceful\" swan with the wings spread looks great. Beautiful reflection in the water. The duck also helps to add interest to the shot. Negative space is great and helps with the composition. Wonderful shot.', '2003-11-03 04:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(470692, 44339, 8765, '<td valign="top">Er þetta ekki Gunnar??? :)</td>', 'Er þetta ekki Gunnar??? :)', '2003-11-03 04:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
