(471078, 43987, 6845, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea. I like the light and the composition.</td>', 'Interesting idea. I like the light and the composition.', '2003-11-03 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(471081, 44374, 6845, '<td valign="top">The blades sure give you a feeling of what way the wind is blowing. Nice idea, I like the composition and the light.</td>', 'The blades sure give you a feeling of what way the wind is blowing. Nice idea, I like the composition and the light.', '2003-11-03 12:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(471087, 43649, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like this image but with the subject in the middle of the frame, I wish the background was more symmetrical. Maybe even if the point of view was moved more to the left to eliminate the mountains in the background. But in any case this is still a nice image and a good potrayal for the challenge.</td>', 'I like this image but with the subject in the middle of the frame, I wish the background was more symmetrical. Maybe even if the point of view was moved more to the left to eliminate the mountains in the background. But in any case this is still a nice image and a good potrayal for the challenge.', '2003-11-03 12:50:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(471088, 44173, 4090, '<td valign="top">would love to see this in Black and white</td>', 'would love to see this in Black and white', '2003-11-03 12:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(471090, 43636, 6845, '<td valign="top">The image is too blurry and too small for this subject imo. I like the idea, just not the execution.</td>', 'The image is too blurry and too small for this subject imo. I like the idea, just not the execution.', '2003-11-03 12:51:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(471092, 44432, 6845, '<td valign="top">Good, simple idea.  Works well for the challenge.</td>', 'Good, simple idea.  Works well for the challenge.', '2003-11-03 12:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(471095, 44360, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot. The inferred look is very nice and the tone achieved is very pleasing to me. I like the composition and the light. This is one of my favorites for the challenge.</td>', 'I really like this shot. The inferred look is very nice and the tone achieved is very pleasing to me. I like the composition and the light. This is one of my favorites for the challenge.', '2003-11-03 12:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(471097, 44382, 6845, '<td valign="top">The light is very harsh and flat. I like the compostion and the colore though.</td>', 'The light is very harsh and flat. I like the compostion and the colore though.', '2003-11-03 12:55:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(471098, 44339, 6845, '<td valign="top">This image is way too blown out for my taste. There is just not enough detail for me to find any interest in this image. Sorry.</td>', 'This image is way too blown out for my taste. There is just not enough detail for me to find any interest in this image. Sorry.', '2003-11-03 12:56:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(471100, 44238, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the foggy look and the light. The color also adds a certain element to the image. Good composition and idea.</td>', 'I like the foggy look and the light. The color also adds a certain element to the image. Good composition and idea.', '2003-11-03 12:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(471102, 44437, 6845, '<td valign="top">Looks out of focus. That aside, I really like the capture and the warmth of the image. The steam also adds a nice element. Good composition.</td>', 'Looks out of focus. That aside, I really like the capture and the warmth of the image. The steam also adds a nice element. Good composition.', '2003-11-03 12:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(471190, 44232, 13381, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot.  One suggestion: I''d love to see the gull on the rock be in sharp focus with the flying gulls a bit out of focus, rather than the other way around.</td>', 'Beautiful shot.  One suggestion: I''d love to see the gull on the rock be in sharp focus with the flying gulls a bit out of focus, rather than the other way around.', '2003-11-03 14:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(471197, 44352, 13381, '<td valign="top">I''ve been seeing a lot of variations on this theme: holy statues in outdoor settings. I like the effect of the sun flare in this shot, though.  It lends something to the picture as a whole.</td>', 'I''ve been seeing a lot of variations on this theme: holy statues in outdoor settings. I like the effect of the sun flare in this shot, though.  It lends something to the picture as a whole.', '2003-11-03 14:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(471210, 43785, 12194, '<td valign="top">Beautiful...very gracefull...people don''t ususally associate grace with urban landscapes and that''s why this is one of my favorites b/c it is different!!! I love the moon above and the color of the sky!!! Amazing! 10</td>', 'Beautiful...very gracefull...people don''t ususally associate grace with urban landscapes and that''s why this is one of my favorites b/c it is different!!! I love the moon above and the color of the sky!!! Amazing! 10', '2003-11-03 15:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(471214, 43490, 12194, '<td valign="top">Beaitiful...the butterfly is really sharp and the background blurry so the butterfly really stands out!</td>', 'Beaitiful...the butterfly is really sharp and the background blurry so the butterfly really stands out!', '2003-11-03 15:04:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(471217, 43564, 12194, '<td valign="top">Very nice...it is not ususal to see sunsets with the sun right in the middle of the photograph....9</td>', 'Very nice...it is not ususal to see sunsets with the sun right in the middle of the photograph....9', '2003-11-03 15:06:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(471222, 43872, 12194, '<td valign="top">Nice reflections!</td>', 'Nice reflections!', '2003-11-03 15:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(471223, 44350, 12194, '<td valign="top">Beautiful....but maybe the background could have been more blurry for the butterfly to stand out but that is just my opinion....i still like it...</td>', 'Beautiful....but maybe the background could have been more blurry for the butterfly to stand out but that is just my opinion....i still like it...', '2003-11-03 15:10:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(471225, 43902, 12194, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! I love cats and I take pictures of them all the time and I know how hard it is...... Good job</td>', 'Nice capture! I love cats and I take pictures of them all the time and I know how hard it is...... Good job', '2003-11-03 15:14:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(471226, 44419, 12194, '<td valign="top">Cool....like very supernatural</td>', 'Cool....like very supernatural', '2003-11-03 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(471227, 43987, 12194, '<td valign="top">cool idea!</td>', 'cool idea!', '2003-11-03 15:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(471228, 44348, 12194, '<td valign="top">cool lines in the picture</td>', 'cool lines in the picture', '2003-11-03 15:21:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(471235, 44261, 12194, '<td valign="top">WOOOW.... awesome...the colors and the drop... really cool - I have no words to describe the picture better that it does itself.......10</td>', 'WOOOW.... awesome...the colors and the drop... really cool - I have no words to describe the picture better that it does itself.......10', '2003-11-03 15:26:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(471239, 44318, 12392, '<td valign="top">The only discription I have is WOW!!!!!.........10+</td>', 'The only discription I have is WOW!!!!!.........10+', '2003-11-03 15:29:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(471241, 44362, 12392, '<td valign="top">I love all the colors....great job</td>', 'I love all the colors....great job', '2003-11-03 15:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(471242, 44362, 10145, '<td valign="top">Wow! Very pretty shot! I love the colors in the leaves...you can see the front color and then the back as well</td>', 'Wow! Very pretty shot! I love the colors in the leaves...you can see the front color and then the back as well', '2003-11-03 15:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(471243, 43987, 10145, '<td valign="top">Very neat concept, I like this...</td>', 'Very neat concept, I like this...', '2003-11-03 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(471248, 44224, 12194, '<td valign="top">interesting composition eventhough the rose could be a bit sharper... 6</td>', 'interesting composition eventhough the rose could be a bit sharper... 6', '2003-11-03 15:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(471249, 44212, 12194, '<td valign="top">too bad that the photo is so small....</td>', 'too bad that the photo is so small....', '2003-11-03 15:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(471252, 44309, 6888, '<td valign="top">the effects are way too distracting</td>', 'the effects are way too distracting', '2003-11-03 15:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(471262, 43879, 4008, '<td valign="top">I see a green glass object lit by one single light from behind. But to me it is unrecognisable and does not represent anything, I don''t recognise grace in any way. Looks a bit like a bird. Also the object does not seem to be in focus.</td>', 'I see a green glass object lit by one single light from behind. But to me it is unrecognisable and does not represent anything, I don''t recognise grace in any way. Looks a bit like a bird. Also the object does not seem to be in focus.', '2003-11-03 15:56:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(471265, 44373, 4008, '<td valign="top">yes, naturally beautiful, if without the building. The building draws so much attention in the picture that one does not see the beautiful foliage anymore. Maybe you could have taken only the part on the left, go closer or zoom or crop, leave out some sky and then have the viewer concentrate on that beauty.</td>', 'yes, naturally beautiful, if without the building. The building draws so much attention in the picture that one does not see the beautiful foliage anymore. Maybe you could have taken only the part on the left, go closer or zoom or crop, leave out some sky and then have the viewer concentrate on that beauty.', '2003-11-03 16:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(471269, 43438, 4008, '<td valign="top">I personally find the face the most graceful aspect of a sleeping person, the closed eyes and the face without expession. You have chosen the arm. O.k. your choice. The angle and composition puzzles me, it makes me look twice how this person is lying and how the arms are bent, it takes my attention away from what you want to express.</td>', 'I personally find the face the most graceful aspect of a sleeping person, the closed eyes and the face without expession. You have chosen the arm. O.k. your choice. The angle and composition puzzles me, it makes me look twice how this person is lying and how the arms are bent, it takes my attention away from what you want to express.', '2003-11-03 16:04:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(471272, 44385, 4008, '<td valign="top">I really would try to crop very close around the boy and girl, and in that way remove all the others from the picture.</td>', 'I really would try to crop very close around the boy and girl, and in that way remove all the others from the picture.', '2003-11-03 16:07:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(471274, 44107, 11486, '<td valign="top">Very beutifull arrangement, and a good photo also!</td>', 'Very beutifull arrangement, and a good photo also!', '2003-11-03 16:12:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(471275, 44281, 4008, '<td valign="top">She looks a very fit young women. I would guess a picture with her in a more streched out position on the rocks would give a more graceful quality to the picture, she looks to be in a bit awkward position now. Ot you could have emphasised the environment more by including more of the rock, show height or depth.</td>', 'She looks a very fit young women. I would guess a picture with her in a more streched out position on the rocks would give a more graceful quality to the picture, she looks to be in a bit awkward position now. Ot you could have emphasised the environment more by including more of the rock, show height or depth.', '2003-11-03 16:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(471276, 44317, 6008, '<td valign="top">The tone is good and helps convey what I assume is a sombre mood. I also  like the use of dof to bring out the dog tags as the main focal point. The only negative is the top dog tag looks a little too bright. Quite an emotive photograph.</td>', 'The tone is good and helps convey what I assume is a sombre mood. I also  like the use of dof to bring out the dog tags as the main focal point. The only negative is the top dog tag looks a little too bright. Quite an emotive photograph.', '2003-11-03 16:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(471277, 43894, 11486, '<td valign="top">Not a realy good sign of grace these days... But a good photo anyway.</td>', 'Not a realy good sign of grace these days... But a good photo anyway.', '2003-11-03 16:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(471278, 44302, 11486, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the clouds, the strong light and the shadow of the church. The leafs adds to the overall impression. <br/>One of the better photos in this challenge!</td>', 'I like the contrast between the clouds, the strong light and the shadow of the church. The leafs adds to the overall impression. One of the better photos in this challenge!', '2003-11-03 16:14:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(471279, 44189, 4008, '<td valign="top">Love this one for its very fine structure, its very matching subtle colors and the concentrated composition, with the curved end providing extra emphasis. Technically perfect as well.</td>', 'Love this one for its very fine structure, its very matching subtle colors and the concentrated composition, with the curved end providing extra emphasis. Technically perfect as well.', '2003-11-03 16:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(471281, 43747, 11486, '<td valign="top">I like the drawing better than the photo...</td>', 'I like the drawing better than the photo...', '2003-11-03 16:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(471282, 43785, 4008, '<td valign="top">Absolutely fitting the challenge !! Great capture, beautiful colors, moon included, very good. Maybe a bit more space on the right, show some more of the bridge, bringing the opera house out of the center, would have improved the composition further. 9</td>', 'Absolutely fitting the challenge !! Great capture, beautiful colors, moon included, very good. Maybe a bit more space on the right, show some more of the bridge, bringing the opera house out of the center, would have improved the composition further. 9', '2003-11-03 16:16:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(471283, 44339, 11486, '<td valign="top">To badly overepose to me</td>', 'To badly overepose to me', '2003-11-03 16:16:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(471284, 44400, 4008, '<td valign="top">I like the brown tints, the shape and angle of the leave, resting on the small tips,  and especially the shadows. Good one.</td>', 'I like the brown tints, the shape and angle of the leave, resting on the small tips,  and especially the shadows. Good one.', '2003-11-03 16:17:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471290, 43784, 4008, '<td valign="top">Very special atmosphere. The big bright spot is a bit disturbing, I would crop the image just below it, since the big bright spot and the area above it does not add much to the picture. If you crop away a bit from the sides as well, you still can maintain the impression of height in the image.</td>', 'Very special atmosphere. The big bright spot is a bit disturbing, I would crop the image just below it, since the big bright spot and the area above it does not add much to the picture. If you crop away a bit from the sides as well, you still can maintain the impression of height in the image.', '2003-11-03 16:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(471298, 44360, 13551, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Note sure if it fits the challenge too well.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Note sure if it fits the challenge too well.', '2003-11-03 16:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471299, 44132, 4008, '<td valign="top">Drop is a leave are always attractive and the sharpness here is good. Unfortunately the leave itself is not very attractive and the surroundings are a bit cluttered, especially the one piece of grass in front of the leave is disturbing. If possible, getting closer and lower and removing the grass in front, might have solved this, limiting also depth of field and therefore creating more impact of the drops.</td>', 'Drop is a leave are always attractive and the sharpness here is good. Unfortunately the leave itself is not very attractive and the surroundings are a bit cluttered, especially the one piece of grass in front of the leave is disturbing. If possible, getting closer and lower and removing the grass in front, might have solved this, limiting also depth of field and therefore creating more impact of the drops.', '2003-11-03 16:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(471319, 44127, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very attractive colors, but upper left part is distracting, as well as a too short DOF. Nice dtails in the center, and water is a good idea. Good framing.</td>', 'Very attractive colors, but upper left part is distracting, as well as a too short DOF. Nice dtails in the center, and water is a good idea. Good framing.', '2003-11-03 17:34:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(471327, 43692, 12432, '<td valign="top">Cute, but would have been better with some cropping at the bottom and left side, between left duckling and the group. Would give a better focus on the ducks Colors are a bit washed, and seems oversharpened.</td>', 'Cute, but would have been better with some cropping at the bottom and left side, between left duckling and the group. Would give a better focus on the ducks Colors are a bit washed, and seems oversharpened.', '2003-11-03 17:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(471334, 43909, 12432, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit complicated. Just one flower would have been more gracious. Fill-in flash flattens the depth and washes the colors. For indoor composed shots, whenever possible, it''s always better to use light (preferably halogen)coming from 2 or 3 directions, eventually flash on the ceiling on top. Or shot with daylight close to a window.</td>', 'Looks a bit complicated. Just one flower would have been more gracious. Fill-in flash flattens the depth and washes the colors. For indoor composed shots, whenever possible, it''s always better to use light (preferably halogen)coming from 2 or 3 directions, eventually flash on the ceiling on top. Or shot with daylight close to a window.', '2003-11-03 17:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(471340, 44450, 12432, '<td valign="top">Nice details, colors reflection and water ripples. Image is too small to appreciate it well, but it\''s sharp and well framed. Not exactly on topic.</td>', 'Nice details, colors reflection and water ripples. Image is too small to appreciate it well, but it\''s sharp and well framed. Not exactly on topic.', '2003-11-03 17:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(471346, 43794, 12432, '<td valign="top">Why did you use a flash? It washes the details and brightens exaggeratedly the skin. It''s a good idea, and expressions are perfect, but more attention to the lighting (coming from the side, or above, or from different points) would have led to something more gracious.</td>', 'Why did you use a flash? It washes the details and brightens exaggeratedly the skin. It''s a good idea, and expressions are perfect, but more attention to the lighting (coming from the side, or above, or from different points) would have led to something more gracious.', '2003-11-03 17:51:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(471348, 44149, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very well seen and framed I like it! Time elapsing, eternity... lot''s of symbols in one clock, but a nice one. This should win one the ribbons for me.</td>', 'Very well seen and framed I like it! Time elapsing, eternity... lot''s of symbols in one clock, but a nice one. This should win one the ribbons for me.', '2003-11-03 17:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(471352, 44147, 12432, '<td valign="top">Why not.? A daily shot but not very imaginative in terms of photographic quality, and that''s what is all about here.</td>', 'Why not.? A daily shot but not very imaginative in terms of photographic quality, and that''s what is all about here.', '2003-11-03 17:56:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(471353, 43436, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very well catched, good b/w choice, as usually for street shots IMO. Exposure is quite well managed in difficult conditions, and you''ve got the guy right on a gracious  movement. A really good shot!</td>', 'Very well catched, good b/w choice, as usually for street shots IMO. Exposure is quite well managed in difficult conditions, and you''ve got the guy right on a gracious  movement. A really good shot!', '2003-11-03 18:00:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(471360, 44351, 12432, '<td valign="top">Very well done, beautiful colors, sharp ducks (I suppose) squadron. Very elegant image, but the squadron should be off center, either by cropping out the foreground,  eventually leaving little branches tops, or cropping about 1/3 on top.</td>', 'Very well done, beautiful colors, sharp ducks (I suppose) squadron. Very elegant image, but the squadron should be off center, either by cropping out the foreground,  eventually leaving little branches tops, or cropping about 1/3 on top.', '2003-11-03 18:09:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(471361, 44303, 10739, '<td valign="top">A sharper picture would be really magic.</td>', 'A sharper picture would be really magic.', '2003-11-03 18:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(471365, 44173, 10739, '<td valign="top">The image looks kind of rough, I mean not smooth. That''s ok for a statue, but makes a picture harder</td>', 'The image looks kind of rough, I mean not smooth. That''s ok for a statue, but makes a picture harder', '2003-11-03 18:12:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(471368, 44447, 2158, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, but feel it could have done with a little levels adjustment to make the boat stand out just a little more.</td>', 'I like this photo, but feel it could have done with a little levels adjustment to make the boat stand out just a little more.', '2003-11-03 18:16:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(471370, 44261, 10739, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I just miss the whole leave being on focus to say it''s perfect</td>', 'Very nice picture. I just miss the whole leave being on focus to say it''s perfect', '2003-11-03 18:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(471373, 44428, 2158, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast between the clothing and the shoes.  That''s the real charm of childhood.</td>', 'I love the contrast between the clothing and the shoes.  That''s the real charm of childhood.', '2003-11-03 18:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(471375, 44302, 10739, '<td valign="top">The sky looks too artificial (may be because of the noise)</td>', 'The sky looks too artificial (may be because of the noise)', '2003-11-03 18:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(471419, 44143, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s very pink and vibrant, and the matching pink border is cute. The coloring is good, and the lighting/exposure is good, although there are a few shadows cast. A very pretty photograph.</td>', 'It''s very pink and vibrant, and the matching pink border is cute. The coloring is good, and the lighting/exposure is good, although there are a few shadows cast. A very pretty photograph.', '2003-11-03 18:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(471420, 44253, 6870, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this image says ''grace'' to me, but I like the harsh light, and the bizarre backgrouind of gladiolas. Very unique and interestng shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure this image says ''grace'' to me, but I like the harsh light, and the bizarre backgrouind of gladiolas. Very unique and interestng shot.', '2003-11-03 18:54:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(471423, 43996, 6870, '<td valign="top">Very interesting shot. The colors in the water are very nice, and set off the bird quite nicely.</td>', 'Very interesting shot. The colors in the water are very nice, and set off the bird quite nicely.', '2003-11-03 18:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(471424, 43552, 6008, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting concept, although personally it doesnt really do much for me. There is a slight red tinge to the hand but it seems well exposed.</td>', 'It''s an interesting concept, although personally it doesnt really do much for me. There is a slight red tinge to the hand but it seems well exposed.', '2003-11-03 18:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(471425, 44321, 6870, '<td valign="top">Intriguing  shot. I''m not sure why you chose to have this out of focus, but I do enjoy the shadow and playfulness of this image.</td>', 'Intriguing  shot. I''m not sure why you chose to have this out of focus, but I do enjoy the shadow and playfulness of this image.', '2003-11-03 18:57:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(471426, 43869, 6870, '<td valign="top">I like how the trees frame these geese. Colors are  nice, too. It''s like we''re peeking in on them. I think you could probably crop tigher and still get the effect you want--and the geese would be larger, too. Nice.</td>', 'I like how the trees frame these geese. Colors are  nice, too. It''s like we''re peeking in on them. I think you could probably crop tigher and still get the effect you want--and the geese would be larger, too. Nice.', '2003-11-03 18:58:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(471427, 44400, 6008, '<td valign="top">I''m really starting to like these simplistic images. It''s a classic with nice toning and sharp detail. The dof on the stem and far leaf is effective. Compositionally it''s also great. A very nice clean image.</td>', 'I''m really starting to like these simplistic images. It''s a classic with nice toning and sharp detail. The dof on the stem and far leaf is effective. Compositionally it''s also great. A very nice clean image.', '2003-11-03 18:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(471431, 44313, 6624, '<td valign="top">the light seems harsh and it appears over-sharpened</td>', 'the light seems harsh and it appears over-sharpened', '2003-11-03 19:02:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(471432, 43920, 6008, '<td valign="top">An interesting photograph. I can certainly see the link to grace. I like the strong blue background, and the warm tone on their skin on the left is also good, but I feel that for such a graceful motion that the shadows in the middle are a little too harsh. I would have perhaps liked to have seen more detail on the hands on the right, as well as the face on the foreground girl.</td>', 'An interesting photograph. I can certainly see the link to grace. I like the strong blue background, and the warm tone on their skin on the left is also good, but I feel that for such a graceful motion that the shadows in the middle are a little too harsh. I would have perhaps liked to have seen more detail on the hands on the right, as well as the face on the foreground girl.', '2003-11-03 19:03:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(471434, 44285, 6008, '<td valign="top">A very delicate abstract image. I like the diagonal line of the blade, as well as the patterns in the background. The use of dof here is, of course, exceptional and very effective in capturing the fragile mood of the image.</td>', 'A very delicate abstract image. I like the diagonal line of the blade, as well as the patterns in the background. The use of dof here is, of course, exceptional and very effective in capturing the fragile mood of the image.', '2003-11-03 19:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(471438, 44232, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that you included one of the birds on the rocks. Capturing the motion is good, the image is sharp, exposure is good. The only negative would be a suggestion of cropping out what seems to be a wing on the left hand side. It certainly captures the grace of flight.</td>', 'I like the fact that you included one of the birds on the rocks. Capturing the motion is good, the image is sharp, exposure is good. The only negative would be a suggestion of cropping out what seems to be a wing on the left hand side. It certainly captures the grace of flight.', '2003-11-03 19:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(471442, 43579, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is very pretty and certainly an interesting alternative to the usual sunset pictures. I like the gradient of the sky from dark to light to the oranges. It''s a very clean and sharp image.</td>', 'This is very pretty and certainly an interesting alternative to the usual sunset pictures. I like the gradient of the sky from dark to light to the oranges. It''s a very clean and sharp image.', '2003-11-03 19:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471445, 44349, 6008, '<td valign="top">There is a nice contrast between the silhouette of the balloon and the sky. Compositionally it''s good. Exposure is excellent. It''s nicely sharp and the gradient in the sky is also good. Grace is certainly shown. Nicely captured.</td>', 'There is a nice contrast between the silhouette of the balloon and the sky. Compositionally it''s good. Exposure is excellent. It''s nicely sharp and the gradient in the sky is also good. Grace is certainly shown. Nicely captured.', '2003-11-03 19:28:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(471456, 44319, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the warm tones of this. The lighting on the statue/mummy is wonderful with no glare and just enough shadow to make it interesting. I also like the shadowed background. The matching border also works. The detail is also very good.</td>', 'I like the warm tones of this. The lighting on the statue/mummy is wonderful with no glare and just enough shadow to make it interesting. I also like the shadowed background. The matching border also works. The detail is also very good.', '2003-11-03 19:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(471461, 43692, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is certainly cute, the color of the grass is good, compositionally it''s fine also. There seems to be quite harsh shadows, probably due to the time the photograph was taken. This only really becomes an issue on the middle large bird as the shadow obscures some of the ducklings.</td>', 'This is certainly cute, the color of the grass is good, compositionally it''s fine also. There seems to be quite harsh shadows, probably due to the time the photograph was taken. This only really becomes an issue on the middle large bird as the shadow obscures some of the ducklings.', '2003-11-03 19:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(471469, 43785, 13799, '<td valign="top">Good view of Sidney Opera House but the best detail is the moon in the sky</td>', 'Good view of Sidney Opera House but the best detail is the moon in the sky', '2003-11-03 19:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
