(471749, 44394, 10084, '<td valign="top">This is such a fun picture to look at. I like the soft focus effect used in the shot. The tutu on the cat is so cute. I can totally see this on the front of a greeting card with some unusual written inside. "8"</td>', 'This is such a fun picture to look at. I like the soft focus effect used in the shot. The tutu on the cat is so cute. I can totally see this on the front of a greeting card with some unusual written inside. "8"', '2003-11-04 04:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
