(471780, 44383, 4008, '<td valign="top">The strong light and the reflection on the wall does not do well for this image. Just holding it further away from the wall would have improved it, but the teapot also lends itself well to more of a still life type of picture.  Don''t know how it looks in color but could imagine it make the image more attractive.</td>', 'The strong light and the reflection on the wall does not do well for this image. Just holding it further away from the wall would have improved it, but the teapot also lends itself well to more of a still life type of picture.  Don''t know how it looks in color but could imagine it make the image more attractive.', '2003-11-04 06:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(471782, 43613, 4008, '<td valign="top">The color looks really off, on my monitor(s) it looks purple, I would expect a more red tint (white balance issue?). It might have worked to go really close and just photograph part of the leave and stem and show the early morning frost more clear, the current image is missing a strong structure to look at and getting close might have created a more restful strong image.</td>', 'The color looks really off, on my monitor(s) it looks purple, I would expect a more red tint (white balance issue?). It might have worked to go really close and just photograph part of the leave and stem and show the early morning frost more clear, the current image is missing a strong structure to look at and getting close might have created a more restful strong image.', '2003-11-04 06:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
