(471804, 44224, 12432, '<td valign="top">Good framing (except little triangle bottom right) and, specially attractive comination of colors. The rose is a bit overexposed and lacks of sharpness, although the focus seems ok (based on the keyboard). Seems that it''s the yellow brightness who make the rose blurry. Could easily be arranged with Photoshop or equivalent.</td>', 'Good framing (except little triangle bottom right) and, specially attractive comination of colors. The rose is a bit overexposed and lacks of sharpness, although the focus seems ok (based on the keyboard). Seems that it''s the yellow brightness who make the rose blurry. Could easily be arranged with Photoshop or equivalent.', '2003-11-04 07:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(471807, 44189, 12432, '<td valign="top">Graceful abstract. The advantage of this very textured leaf, it''s soft color and the sort of whip at the top work very well. Very well casted background. Framed with elegance.</td>', 'Graceful abstract. The advantage of this very textured leaf, it''s soft color and the sort of whip at the top work very well. Very well casted background. Framed with elegance.', '2003-11-04 07:49:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(471811, 44431, 12432, '<td valign="top">It''s a nice idea, but the background is very distractive, flamingo''s head is overexposed and the flamingo is not in a really graceful position. Here, he seems to sleep. If you had more patience, perhaps he/she would have walked in a different place.</td>', 'It''s a nice idea, but the background is very distractive, flamingo''s head is overexposed and the flamingo is not in a really graceful position. Here, he seems to sleep. If you had more patience, perhaps he/she would have walked in a different place.', '2003-11-04 07:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(471817, 44452, 12432, '<td valign="top">Beautiful action shot, splendid mix of soft and saturated colors ( a wee bit too much on pink and green) and perfect exposure. Sharp, just as necessary. It''s really very catched in the curve, giving a real impression of speed. Up to now, one of the best ones on the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful action shot, splendid mix of soft and saturated colors ( a wee bit too much on pink and green) and perfect exposure. Sharp, just as necessary. It''s really very catched in the curve, giving a real impression of speed. Up to now, one of the best ones on the challenge.', '2003-11-04 08:00:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(471821, 44433, 12432, '<td valign="top">Cute shot, good framing and duotone use. Well executed.</td>', 'Cute shot, good framing and duotone use. Well executed.', '2003-11-04 08:02:42.000000', NULL, 1),
