(471893, 43649, 4615, '<td valign="top">poster mayerial.  another 10 pointer.  Good luck!</td>', 'poster mayerial.  another 10 pointer.  Good luck!', '2003-11-04 09:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(471896, 44432, 4008, '<td valign="top">Good approach to the challenge, lighting the hands just to show the outlines worked well. I would have liked a bit more symmetry, less burned out fingertops and elimination of the white spot in the middle. 8</td>', 'Good approach to the challenge, lighting the hands just to show the outlines worked well. I would have liked a bit more symmetry, less burned out fingertops and elimination of the white spot in the middle. 8', '2003-11-04 09:07:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(471898, 44284, 4008, '<td valign="top">The cat is very fuzzy/unsharp, looks like movement blur since the tiles are sharp. The angle of view is a bit strange, with the floortiles as a wall behind the cat. You made it difficult for yourself by chosing difficult circumstances with strong contrast between the dark shadows and the light hair of the cat in the sunshine.</td>', 'The cat is very fuzzy/unsharp, looks like movement blur since the tiles are sharp. The angle of view is a bit strange, with the floortiles as a wall behind the cat. You made it difficult for yourself by chosing difficult circumstances with strong contrast between the dark shadows and the light hair of the cat in the sunshine.', '2003-11-04 09:12:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(471901, 44303, 4008, '<td valign="top">I am wonering why you did not desaturate the total, or alternatively leave the color in the total. The red leaves now draw all the attention, whereas the soft waterflow is the most graceful aspect of the picture. A viewpoint lower to the ground, looking up to the small waterfall would have concentrated more on that graceful aspect, and would have eliminated some further clutter.</td>', 'I am wonering why you did not desaturate the total, or alternatively leave the color in the total. The red leaves now draw all the attention, whereas the soft waterflow is the most graceful aspect of the picture. A viewpoint lower to the ground, looking up to the small waterfall would have concentrated more on that graceful aspect, and would have eliminated some further clutter.', '2003-11-04 09:15:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(471902, 44361, 4008, '<td valign="top">The image is so dark one can hardly see the graceful body movements. Of course I don''t know the circumstances, but if it would have been possible to get the three ladies in aroom with more light and without any background elements, it would have been a lot better.</td>', 'The image is so dark one can hardly see the graceful body movements. Of course I don''t know the circumstances, but if it would have been possible to get the three ladies in aroom with more light and without any background elements, it would have been a lot better.', '2003-11-04 09:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(471921, 43795, 13158, '<td valign="top">I love this!  Age CAN be graceful and beautiful.  I like your take on this challenge.  I like the black and white conversion, except for the paper, it is too bright and draws the eye away from your subject.  But otherwise, great image!</td>', 'I love this!  Age CAN be graceful and beautiful.  I like your take on this challenge.  I like the black and white conversion, except for the paper, it is too bright and draws the eye away from your subject.  But otherwise, great image!', '2003-11-04 10:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(471922, 44106, 13158, '<td valign="top">I like your interpretation of the challenge.  One thing that would have made it even better is the word "graceful" somewhere in the passage.</td>', 'I like your interpretation of the challenge.  One thing that would have made it even better is the word "graceful" somewhere in the passage.', '2003-11-04 10:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(471925, 43769, 13158, '<td valign="top">Slightly out of focus.  I like the crop though.</td>', 'Slightly out of focus.  I like the crop though.', '2003-11-04 10:29:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(471926, 44363, 13158, '<td valign="top">I love infrared shots!  This is gorgeous.</td>', 'I love infrared shots!  This is gorgeous.', '2003-11-04 10:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(471928, 43490, 13158, '<td valign="top">Great focus, and WILD, looks like the butterfly is looking at the camera!  Too cool!</td>', 'Great focus, and WILD, looks like the butterfly is looking at the camera!  Too cool!', '2003-11-04 10:32:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(471929, 44328, 6202, '<td valign="top">Very beautiful moment captured.  Definately fits this challenge well.  10.</td>', 'Very beautiful moment captured.  Definately fits this challenge well.  10.', '2003-11-04 10:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(471932, 44385, 6202, '<td valign="top">typical little princess.  all dressed up and then just hanging around.  darling capture.</td>', 'typical little princess.  all dressed up and then just hanging around.  darling capture.', '2003-11-04 10:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(471937, 44344, 6202, '<td valign="top">this would work much better if it weren''t so centered.  Rule of thirds would have improved this greatly.</td>', 'this would work much better if it weren''t so centered.  Rule of thirds would have improved this greatly.', '2003-11-04 10:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(471944, 43636, 8125, '<td valign="top">This image is a bit too small and appears out of focus, although that could be the effect of not being able to see it closer.  I do agree though, that the Praying Mantis is a ''graceful'' creature.</td>', 'This image is a bit too small and appears out of focus, although that could be the effect of not being able to see it closer.  I do agree though, that the Praying Mantis is a ''graceful'' creature.', '2003-11-04 10:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(471945, 43613, 9998, '<td valign="top">I love the rich colors and textures!</td>', 'I love the rich colors and textures!', '2003-11-04 10:44:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(471951, 44450, 9998, '<td valign="top">Great contrast with the smooth water and textured duck!</td>', 'Great contrast with the smooth water and textured duck!', '2003-11-04 10:47:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(471953, 44353, 8125, '<td valign="top">Swans are incredibly beautiful and graceful.  There seems to a bit too much light on the back, it gets a little washed out.  I wish there weren''t a shadow across her face.  Nicely composed.</td>', 'Swans are incredibly beautiful and graceful.  There seems to a bit too much light on the back, it gets a little washed out.  I wish there weren''t a shadow across her face.  Nicely composed.', '2003-11-04 10:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(471954, 44285, 7969, '<td valign="top">Very elegant, I love the water droplets and the purple tones.</td>', 'Very elegant, I love the water droplets and the purple tones.', '2003-11-04 10:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(471959, 44339, 8125, '<td valign="top">The image itself doesn''t say ''grace'' to me, but there may be something I''m missing.  I''m also not a big fan of the lighting.  It''s a bit too much for my taste and washes out the detail of your subject.</td>', 'The image itself doesn''t say ''grace'' to me, but there may be something I''m missing.  I''m also not a big fan of the lighting.  It''s a bit too much for my taste and washes out the detail of your subject.', '2003-11-04 10:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(471960, 43794, 8125, '<td valign="top">An idea very well executed - the composition is definately a strong point.  I like the use of black and white.  There are some slight distractions with a few small bright spots throughout the image, but without spot editing, this would be hard to remove.</td>', 'An idea very well executed - the composition is definately a strong point.  I like the use of black and white.  There are some slight distractions with a few small bright spots throughout the image, but without spot editing, this would be hard to remove.', '2003-11-04 11:00:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(471962, 43817, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very well composed, excellent choice of black and white.  Well done!</td>', 'Very well composed, excellent choice of black and white.  Well done!', '2003-11-04 11:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(471964, 44320, 8125, '<td valign="top">A beautiful swan - I like your composition - My only 2 wishes would be to see more detail of the back and more of the reflection.  Photographing white subjects in sunlight is difficult though.  Nice job.  :-)</td>', 'A beautiful swan - I like your composition - My only 2 wishes would be to see more detail of the back and more of the reflection.  Photographing white subjects in sunlight is difficult though.  Nice job.  :-)', '2003-11-04 11:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(471965, 43963, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry - I just don''t see what this is a picture of.</td>', 'I''m sorry - I just don''t see what this is a picture of.', '2003-11-04 11:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(471966, 44318, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful image - I could see it hanging on a wall.  I love the colors you captured and the composition of the image overall.  Well done.</td>', 'This is a beautiful image - I could see it hanging on a wall.  I love the colors you captured and the composition of the image overall.  Well done.', '2003-11-04 11:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(471968, 44343, 8125, '<td valign="top">Pets are always so much fun to photograph and I like your composition.  The color is a bit too dark and almost seems to have a ''hue'' to it.</td>', 'Pets are always so much fun to photograph and I like your composition.  The color is a bit too dark and almost seems to have a ''hue'' to it.', '2003-11-04 11:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(471971, 44261, 8125, '<td valign="top">Wow, a great capture.  I like how exceptionally clear your shot is at the water drop.</td>', 'Wow, a great capture.  I like how exceptionally clear your shot is at the water drop.', '2003-11-04 11:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(471973, 44321, 8125, '<td valign="top">lol - a great idea for this challenge.  I just wish the image were a bit bigger and more in focus.</td>', 'lol - a great idea for this challenge.  I just wish the image were a bit bigger and more in focus.', '2003-11-04 11:12:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(471976, 44344, 8125, '<td valign="top">The flower isn''t very clear, it may be slightly out of focus.  It may have been better to fill the frame more with the flower.  The leaves seem to overpower it a bit.</td>', 'The flower isn''t very clear, it may be slightly out of focus.  It may have been better to fill the frame more with the flower.  The leaves seem to overpower it a bit.', '2003-11-04 11:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(471978, 44460, 8125, '<td valign="top">I''m not seeing how this photograph fits into the ''grace'' challenge...  There is a bit too much light for my taste, although I know that was the intention.  The composition is good for a self-portrait.</td>', 'I''m not seeing how this photograph fits into the ''grace'' challenge...  There is a bit too much light for my taste, although I know that was the intention.  The composition is good for a self-portrait.', '2003-11-04 11:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(471979, 43785, 8125, '<td valign="top">A beautiful capture.  Colors and composition are excellent.</td>', 'A beautiful capture.  Colors and composition are excellent.', '2003-11-04 11:19:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(471980, 44444, 8125, '<td valign="top">Very nice, I like the reflection.  I know this is completely out of your control - but it would have been even better if that swan could have been just a few inches back from shore.  :-)  Well done!!</td>', 'Very nice, I like the reflection.  I know this is completely out of your control - but it would have been even better if that swan could have been just a few inches back from shore.  :-)  Well done!!', '2003-11-04 11:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(471984, 43849, 8125, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot!  Composition, lighting, subject - terrific!  Well done!!!</td>', 'I really like this shot!  Composition, lighting, subject - terrific!  Well done!!!', '2003-11-04 11:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(471988, 44358, 12792, '<td valign="top">Not to be picky, but where does grace fall into this?  Otherwise, good shot.</td>', 'Not to be picky, but where does grace fall into this?  Otherwise, good shot.', '2003-11-04 11:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(471994, 44400, 4090, '<td valign="top">like this alot , simple, focused, colour is great so only one vote 10/10 good luck</td>', 'like this alot , simple, focused, colour is great so only one vote 10/10 good luck', '2003-11-04 12:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(472006, 44224, 13158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful take on the challenge, great focus on the flower and I love the crop.</td>', 'Beautiful take on the challenge, great focus on the flower and I love the crop.', '2003-11-04 12:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(472007, 44394, 13158, '<td valign="top">LOL, too funny!  Nice take on the challenge, but that poor kitty has got to be wondering what in the world is going on!</td>', 'LOL, too funny!  Nice take on the challenge, but that poor kitty has got to be wondering what in the world is going on!', '2003-11-04 12:33:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(472009, 43717, 13158, '<td valign="top">Awesome focus!  Great texutre, the feathers on the bird are remarkable, makes me want to reach out and touch them.</td>', 'Awesome focus!  Great texutre, the feathers on the bird are remarkable, makes me want to reach out and touch them.', '2003-11-04 12:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(472011, 44343, 13158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful cat, the picture is a bit dark though.</td>', 'Beautiful cat, the picture is a bit dark though.', '2003-11-04 12:37:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(472012, 44066, 13158, '<td valign="top">How awesome to catch this shot!</td>', 'How awesome to catch this shot!', '2003-11-04 12:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(472014, 44289, 13158, '<td valign="top">What is it?</td>', 'What is it?', '2003-11-04 12:40:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(472021, 44314, 13158, '<td valign="top">LOL, just what I like, ORIGINALITY!  Bit out of focus though, but I like it.</td>', 'LOL, just what I like, ORIGINALITY!  Bit out of focus though, but I like it.', '2003-11-04 12:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(472025, 43794, 2170, '<td valign="top">too bad there are such sharp highlights on the woman.</td>', 'too bad there are such sharp highlights on the woman.', '2003-11-04 12:51:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(472026, 44360, 2170, '<td valign="top">i think i''d rather see this duotoned instead of IR''d.  just me.  nice shot.</td>', 'i think i''d rather see this duotoned instead of IR''d.  just me.  nice shot.', '2003-11-04 12:52:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(472028, 43785, 13158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!!  Love the moon in the back, and the lines of the building.  Nice take on the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful!!  Love the moon in the back, and the lines of the building.  Nice take on the challenge.', '2003-11-04 12:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(472029, 43438, 2170, '<td valign="top">too noisy.</td>', 'too noisy.', '2003-11-04 12:53:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(472030, 44253, 13158, '<td valign="top">Beautiful high key image.  Nice crop and perfect shadows.  Love it!</td>', 'Beautiful high key image.  Nice crop and perfect shadows.  Love it!', '2003-11-04 12:54:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(472031, 44290, 2170, '<td valign="top">i shouldn''t think this is funny, but i love it.  i really like the old old old vise you''ve got going.  i would have preferred seeing this without the foot and with very minimal amount of the hand showing (and not bracelets).  otherwise, great!</td>', 'i shouldn''t think this is funny, but i love it.  i really like the old old old vise you''ve got going.  i would have preferred seeing this without the foot and with very minimal amount of the hand showing (and not bracelets).  otherwise, great!', '2003-11-04 12:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(472037, 44309, 2170, '<td valign="top">i do not care for the coloring of this at all.  sorry.</td>', 'i do not care for the coloring of this at all.  sorry.', '2003-11-04 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(472038, 43994, 2170, '<td valign="top">gorgeous!  did you find it, or place it?</td>', 'gorgeous!  did you find it, or place it?', '2003-11-04 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(472040, 44432, 2170, '<td valign="top">the lighting is very well done.</td>', 'the lighting is very well done.', '2003-11-04 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(472042, 44400, 2170, '<td valign="top">lovely set-up.  great lighting and dof.</td>', 'lovely set-up.  great lighting and dof.', '2003-11-04 13:02:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(472044, 44223, 2170, '<td valign="top">i absolutely love this photo more than you could ever possibly know.  :)</td>', 'i absolutely love this photo more than you could ever possibly know.  :)', '2003-11-04 13:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(472045, 43948, 2170, '<td valign="top">i''ll bet those feathers tickle.  mine do.  :D</td>', 'i''ll bet those feathers tickle.  mine do.  :D', '2003-11-04 13:05:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(472073, 43991, 6845, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. I like the soft look and feel of this image.The composition and light are very pleasing.</td>', 'Nice capture. I like the soft look and feel of this image.The composition and light are very pleasing.', '2003-11-04 13:40:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(472075, 44189, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and the way the lines lead upward tword the tip, which in its self adds a great deal to the image.</td>', 'I like the composition and the way the lines lead upward tword the tip, which in its self adds a great deal to the image.', '2003-11-04 13:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(472078, 44280, 6845, '<td valign="top">This, for me, is one of the best flower shots in the challenge. The light is done very well, soft and gentle. The composition is also nice.</td>', 'This, for me, is one of the best flower shots in the challenge. The light is done very well, soft and gentle. The composition is also nice.', '2003-11-04 13:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(472080, 44444, 6845, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition of this image. The black and white tones are very nice and show alot of detail.</td>', 'I really like the composition of this image. The black and white tones are very nice and show alot of detail.', '2003-11-04 13:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(472086, 43785, 6845, '<td valign="top">Personally, I feel that if this was entered into the urban landscape challenge it would have had a chance at winning. I also feel it is a good image for this challenge as well. The light and composition are very pleasing to look at. The Hot spot in the middle is a little distracting, but I am sure there was nothing you could have done for that. Any way, nice image.</td>', 'Personally, I feel that if this was entered into the urban landscape challenge it would have had a chance at winning. I also feel it is a good image for this challenge as well. The light and composition are very pleasing to look at. The Hot spot in the middle is a little distracting, but I am sure there was nothing you could have done for that. Any way, nice image.', '2003-11-04 13:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(472093, 43497, 13403, '<td valign="top">i am jealous.   simply because you get to swim with dolphins..</td>', 'i am jealous.   simply because you get to swim with dolphins..', '2003-11-04 13:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(472096, 44318, 6008, '<td valign="top">Wonderful warm fall colors. I also like the play of light and shadow on the ground. This is a very pretty and picturesque shot, very calming.</td>', 'Wonderful warm fall colors. I also like the play of light and shadow on the ground. This is a very pretty and picturesque shot, very calming.', '2003-11-04 13:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(472107, 44350, 6008, '<td valign="top">My initial thought was that the foreground leaf on the left that is out of focus is a little distracting. Cropping just above it would still have given you some room at the bottom and not taken away from the overall look and feel. The image is sharp where it needs to be, nicely clean, and the tones are good. Well spotted.</td>', 'My initial thought was that the foreground leaf on the left that is out of focus is a little distracting. Cropping just above it would still have given you some room at the bottom and not taken away from the overall look and feel. The image is sharp where it needs to be, nicely clean, and the tones are good. Well spotted.', '2003-11-04 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(472113, 44021, 6008, '<td valign="top">The use of dof is effective, the lighting is good, although there is one spot on the top of his/her head that''s a little bright. To me the focus looks like it was set on the beads rather than the face, but the face still contains fairly clear details. Compositionally it''s fine, although curious as to how effective it would have been as a vertical shot instead of horizontal.</td>', 'The use of dof is effective, the lighting is good, although there is one spot on the top of his/her head that''s a little bright. To me the focus looks like it was set on the beads rather than the face, but the face still contains fairly clear details. Compositionally it''s fine, although curious as to how effective it would have been as a vertical shot instead of horizontal.', '2003-11-04 14:04:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(472141, 44437, 10397, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photo. It would have been better if it was sharper and maybe if the curves were adjusted to hide some of the noise in the file. A beautiful morning all the same!</td>', 'This is a very nice photo. It would have been better if it was sharper and maybe if the curves were adjusted to hide some of the noise in the file. A beautiful morning all the same!', '2003-11-04 14:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(472145, 44276, 10397, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting!</td>', 'Nice lighting!', '2003-11-04 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(472148, 43747, 10397, '<td valign="top">uhhh...That''s definately not the model for that illustration...</td>', 'uhhh...That''s definately not the model for that illustration...', '2003-11-04 14:41:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(472163, 44243, 6008, '<td valign="top">I like the unusual pose, although I''m unsure of having the rest of her arms cropped out of the frame. The skin tone is good, no harsh shadows on her face, the expression is also good. There is enough light on her hair that the shape of her head doesnt look distorted due to some of the hair blending into the background.  The catchlights in the eyes and the light on her lower lip add a nice touch. The line of light above her right eyebrow could have probably been avoided with some makeup, but overall it''s a good portrait.</td>', 'I like the unusual pose, although I''m unsure of having the rest of her arms cropped out of the frame. The skin tone is good, no harsh shadows on her face, the expression is also good. There is enough light on her hair that the shape of her head doesnt look distorted due to some of the hair blending into the background.  The catchlights in the eyes and the light on her lower lip add a nice touch. The line of light above her right eyebrow could have probably been avoided with some makeup, but overall it''s a good portrait.', '2003-11-04 14:48:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(472170, 43717, 6008, '<td valign="top">Composition is good, the lighting/exposure is good, the details are nice and sharp, although I think the pattern of his.. whatever you call the thing under his beak.. makes it seem a little out of focus. Obviously the two light smudges on the dark background are a little distracting, but I realise for DPC there is nothing that can be done for them. Nice close-up shot.</td>', 'Composition is good, the lighting/exposure is good, the details are nice and sharp, although I think the pattern of his.. whatever you call the thing under his beak.. makes it seem a little out of focus. Obviously the two light smudges on the dark background are a little distracting, but I realise for DPC there is nothing that can be done for them. Nice close-up shot.', '2003-11-04 14:52:13.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(472175, 44364, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is a cute candid. The flesh tones are good, lighting is good, however, her sleeve seems a little too bright. The background is a little too much in focus and as such makes the image a little cluttered. Isolating her away from the background or having a plain background would have helped. Similarly I would have liked to have seen more of her in the frame than the background. I''m wondering if the cluttered feel of the shot was partly your decision to go black and white also. There really needs to be more contrast for the black and white to be truly effective.</td>', 'This is a cute candid. The flesh tones are good, lighting is good, however, her sleeve seems a little too bright. The background is a little too much in focus and as such makes the image a little cluttered. Isolating her away from the background or having a plain background would have helped. Similarly I would have liked to have seen more of her in the frame than the background. I''m wondering if the cluttered feel of the shot was partly your decision to go black and white also. There really needs to be more contrast for the black and white to be truly effective.', '2003-11-04 15:02:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(472180, 44431, 6008, '<td valign="top">This is compositionally good, the pose of the flamingo is good, as is the coloring of the bird. Lighting seems a little harsh on the very top of the flamingo''s body, but not distractingly so. It''s not the sharpest image, but does capture grace well.</td>', 'This is compositionally good, the pose of the flamingo is good, as is the coloring of the bird. Lighting seems a little harsh on the very top of the flamingo''s body, but not distractingly so. It''s not the sharpest image, but does capture grace well.', '2003-11-04 15:06:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(472184, 44302, 6008, '<td valign="top">The sky seems a little over-edited making it have somewhat of an unrealistic look. The very bright spots are also fairly distracting. I like how it''s framed with the leaves, but the top right corner section has a loss of detail, which makes it just look like a big black blob. The focus also seems to be on the branches instead of the steeple, which has fairly soft edges in comparison. The edges also have a slight halo suggesting that they may have been oversharpened.</td>', 'The sky seems a little over-edited making it have somewhat of an unrealistic look. The very bright spots are also fairly distracting. I like how it''s framed with the leaves, but the top right corner section has a loss of detail, which makes it just look like a big black blob. The focus also seems to be on the branches instead of the steeple, which has fairly soft edges in comparison. The edges also have a slight halo suggesting that they may have been oversharpened.', '2003-11-04 15:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(472185, 44318, 10263, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous lines in the branches and shadows. Very graceful</td>', 'Gorgeous lines in the branches and shadows. Very graceful', '2003-11-04 15:19:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(472187, 44207, 10263, '<td valign="top">Graceful, beautiful lines. Love the shades.</td>', 'Graceful, beautiful lines. Love the shades.', '2003-11-04 15:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(472191, 44428, 10263, '<td valign="top">Nooooooooooooo not ugly. A beautiful duckling or swan :) I love the old shoes with the pretty dress.</td>', 'Nooooooooooooo not ugly. A beautiful duckling or swan :) I love the old shoes with the pretty dress.', '2003-11-04 15:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(472200, 44432, 10263, '<td valign="top">Simple, beautiful, full of grace</td>', 'Simple, beautiful, full of grace', '2003-11-04 15:36:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(472201, 44285, 10263, '<td valign="top">Definate WOW effect. Graceful lines and beautiful colors</td>', 'Definate WOW effect. Graceful lines and beautiful colors', '2003-11-04 15:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(472202, 44335, 13839, '<td valign="top">breath taking</td>', 'breath taking', '2003-11-04 15:39:34.000000', NULL, 1),
