(472701, 44419, 11417, '<td valign="top">Hi all,<br/> <br/>Thanks for your comments. I did not have a lot of time to work on this concept, and I''ve seen that the flowers were kind of over washed. I tried to add some light on the flowers by using a mirror, but did not really work. anyway, I would be more than happy if someone could do this shot and succeed. For the trick (I used a flash light), go to the magic trick link. Please let me know if you try it!!<br/> <br/><a href="//deadlink" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Magic trick</a> <br/> <br/>Thanks!!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-19 11:49:20.</i></td>', 'Hi all, Thanks for your comments. I did not have a lot of time to work on this concept, and I''ve seen that the flowers were kind of over washed. I tried to add some light on the flowers by using a mirror, but did not really work. anyway, I would be more than happy if someone could do this shot and succeed. For the trick (I used a flash light), go to the magic trick link. Please let me know if you try it!! Magic trick  Thanks!!', '2003-11-05 00:15:48.000000', '2003-11-19 11:49:20.000000', 0),
