(472940, 44165, 10084, '<td valign="top">Gave you a "7" on this shot. I like that you choose to use B&amp;W on the shot. When I think "Grace" I think the color white. The soft focus of the background helps to give this mood. <br/> <br/>The contrast is quite good on the shot. Helps give that grace feeling on the statues face. Very nice. Another great one from Pitsaman :)</td>', 'Gave you a "7" on this shot. I like that you choose to use B&W on the shot. When I think "Grace" I think the color white. The soft focus of the background helps to give this mood.  The contrast is quite good on the shot. Helps give that grace feeling on the statues face. Very nice. Another great one from Pitsaman :)', '2003-11-05 02:29:48.000000', NULL, 0),
