(473191, 44309, 200, '<td valign="top">I was wondering how this could have been legaly created. Interesting effects. It looks like some high pass has been used. I dont have neat image, so im not familiar with its effects. Why then is neat image legal but not other photo shop filters? A bit frustrating, eh?</td>', 'I was wondering how this could have been legaly created. Interesting effects. It looks like some high pass has been used. I dont have neat image, so im not familiar with its effects. Why then is neat image legal but not other photo shop filters? A bit frustrating, eh?', '2003-11-05 06:30:44.000000', NULL, 0),
