(473301, 43717, 13509, '<td valign="top">Thank you for all your comments<br/>Just to answer some questions... <br/> <br/>ellamay: the pelican is actually in sunlight, rather lucky that day I think, having the light at a fairly good angle<br/> <br/>f=32: haha, I was thinking of the title ''yearning to be a swan'', but thought it was unsuitable, perhaps too explicit....</td>', 'Thank you for all your commentsJust to answer some questions...  ellamay: the pelican is actually in sunlight, rather lucky that day I think, having the light at a fairly good angle f=32: haha, I was thinking of the title ''yearning to be a swan'', but thought it was unsuitable, perhaps too explicit....', '2003-11-05 08:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
