(473537, 43649, 9146, '<td valign="top">David,<br/> <br/>Absolutely gorgeous.<br/> <br/>Very emotive and evocative. Being my only willing model I understand how exhausting and frustrating it can be trying to "act" and "direct" simultaneously.<br/> <br/>Congrats on another green :)<br/> <br/> <br/>Edit: it seems I was a little premature with the green...Congrats on your yellow!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-05 12:22:56.</i></td>', 'David, Absolutely gorgeous. Very emotive and evocative. Being my only willing model I understand how exhausting and frustrating it can be trying to "act" and "direct" simultaneously. Congrats on another green :)  Edit: it seems I was a little premature with the green...Congrats on your yellow!', '2003-11-05 10:59:35.000000', '2003-11-05 12:22:56.000000', 0),
(473549, 44318, 4008, '<td valign="top">Thanks you all for your appreciation and your encouraging words.<br/> <br/>How I found it ? Well, sometimes you just get lucky. I was hunting for autumn pictures, walking around in a deerpark (got some lovely deer shots as well), which consists of some open fields and some more dense wood areas. Often too messy for a picture, with no clear structure to make a strong composition, until I got across this more open wood area with the light shining through the leaves and the branches overhead. I immediately saw the opportunity. I especially like the colors and the depth in this picture.<br/> <br/>But it shows again : you only stumble across it, if you are out there, not if you stay at home !</td>', 'Thanks you all for your appreciation and your encouraging words. How I found it ? Well, sometimes you just get lucky. I was hunting for autumn pictures, walking around in a deerpark (got some lovely deer shots as well), which consists of some open fields and some more dense wood areas. Often too messy for a picture, with no clear structure to make a strong composition, until I got across this more open wood area with the light shining through the leaves and the branches overhead. I immediately saw the opportunity. I especially like the colors and the depth in this picture. But it shows again : you only stumble across it, if you are out there, not if you stay at home !', '2003-11-05 11:04:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(473558, 43649, 7969, '<td valign="top">David I have never been so glad to see a shot ''lose'' its ribbon, now you will get the one I really feel you deserved.  Congrats!!</td>', 'David I have never been so glad to see a shot ''lose'' its ribbon, now you will get the one I really feel you deserved.  Congrats!!', '2003-11-05 11:07:39.000000', NULL, 0),
