(473887, 44290, 13136, '<td valign="top">From reading some of the comments and seeing the 18-1s, I guess some people were offended by my picture. While I do tend toward the irreverent, I do not intend to offend anyone with my ideas. This picture is NOT an attack on religion.<br/> <br/>This picture is about Grace, whether based on a belief in God or in an individuals belief in themselves. It says that Grace is sometimes the only and usually the best defense against the pressures put on us daily whether by external sources or (especially) by ourselves. I was trying to show Grace being maintained even under direct assault.<br/> <br/>And, of course, humor will almost always play alarge roll in my pictures.<br/> <br/>By the way, the figurine was not harmed in the making of this picture and it went back to Goodwill in the same condition it was when I bought it.<br/> <br/>Anyway, no big deal. Thanks to everyone who left constructive criticism or compliments.<br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'From reading some of the comments and seeing the 18-1s, I guess some people were offended by my picture. While I do tend toward the irreverent, I do not intend to offend anyone with my ideas. This picture is NOT an attack on religion. This picture is about Grace, whether based on a belief in God or in an individuals belief in themselves. It says that Grace is sometimes the only and usually the best defense against the pressures put on us daily whether by external sources or (especially) by ourselves. I was trying to show Grace being maintained even under direct assault. And, of course, humor will almost always play alarge roll in my pictures. By the way, the figurine was not harmed in the making of this picture and it went back to Goodwill in the same condition it was when I bought it. Anyway, no big deal. Thanks to everyone who left constructive criticism or compliments.  ', '2003-11-05 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(473964, 43649, 3575, '<td valign="top">David, I love it! The last time I was there the brine flies were killing me. I thought I was a die-hard photographer! LOL. Actually, in my mind, this doesn''t represent any religion, just a complete humbling before God. Very, very nice.</td>', 'David, I love it! The last time I was there the brine flies were killing me. I thought I was a die-hard photographer! LOL. Actually, in my mind, this doesn''t represent any religion, just a complete humbling before God. Very, very nice.', '2003-11-05 14:11:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(474041, 43649, 9889, '<td valign="top">Damn... this is a picture that when you see the thumbnail you think: <br/> <br/>"what is that xxxx (censored)!!! How could it win a ribbon??"<br/> <br/>So you zoom on it, to have confirmation about your first impression and you just get amazed! =)<br/> <br/>I love this pic and it is a perfect example of how thumbnails could (or maybe should) be removed from a photographic website! ;)</td>', 'Damn... this is a picture that when you see the thumbnail you think:  "what is that xxxx (censored)!!! How could it win a ribbon??" So you zoom on it, to have confirmation about your first impression and you just get amazed! =) I love this pic and it is a perfect example of how thumbnails could (or maybe should) be removed from a photographic website! ;)', '2003-11-05 14:59:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(474046, 44400, 5728, '<td valign="top">This was one of my top favourites. The lighting here is phenominal! (yeah I spellt that wrong, I know. I just can''t be bothered looking in a dictionary :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-11-05 15:42:52.</i></td>', 'This was one of my top favourites. The lighting here is phenominal! (yeah I spellt that wrong, I know. I just can''t be bothered looking in a dictionary :-)', '2003-11-05 15:03:55.000000', '2003-11-05 15:42:52.000000', 0),
(474141, 43649, 6870, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by kiwiness:</b></div><hr/><i> <br/>David I love this shot! 79 attempts? You must have done a lot of running back and forward.<br/> <br/>Isn''t this where they do those land speed records?</i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I kept having to move 15 feet or so to the right so there wouldn''t be so many foot prints!<br/> <br/>About 75 miles to the west is where they do the land speed records. Yes. It''s a large salt desert!<br/> <br/>Thanks for the votes!</td>', 'Originally posted by kiwiness: David I love this shot! 79 attempts? You must have done a lot of running back and forward. Isn''t this where they do those land speed records?  I kept having to move 15 feet or so to the right so there wouldn''t be so many foot prints! About 75 miles to the west is where they do the land speed records. Yes. It''s a large salt desert! Thanks for the votes!', '2003-11-05 16:08:31.000000', NULL, 0),
