(474274, 43649, 3102, '<td valign="top">I think this is an awesome shot, and I''m glad to see it with a ribbon!  One funny thing, though.  Every time I see the thumbnail, to me it looks like a groundhog with a shadow behind it.  Is it obvious that I''m originally from Punxsutawney, PA???</td>', 'I think this is an awesome shot, and I''m glad to see it with a ribbon!  One funny thing, though.  Every time I see the thumbnail, to me it looks like a groundhog with a shadow behind it.  Is it obvious that I''m originally from Punxsutawney, PA???', '2003-11-05 17:21:03.000000', NULL, 0),
