(481022, 44385, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>As I said during the voting I find this to be a very cute image.  There are a few minor flaws in it that would really improve on it.  For one thing there is a very nasty glare in front of the little boys foot that just grabs the attention.  Another thing is there are just too many extra people in the photo.  getting rid of the little boy to the right side and the woman in the bottom corner would help a lot.<br/> <br/>I think the lighting is fairly well on this shot.  It''s too bad you didn''t get the little girl looking at you instead of the way she is.<br/> <br/>I think it does meet the challenge well.  <br/></td>', 'Critique Club As I said during the voting I find this to be a very cute image.  There are a few minor flaws in it that would really improve on it.  For one thing there is a very nasty glare in front of the little boys foot that just grabs the attention.  Another thing is there are just too many extra people in the photo.  getting rid of the little boy to the right side and the woman in the bottom corner would help a lot. I think the lighting is fairly well on this shot.  It''s too bad you didn''t get the little girl looking at you instead of the way she is. I think it does meet the challenge well.  ', '2003-11-11 20:04:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(481033, 44305, 6202, '<td valign="top">Critique Club<br/> <br/>This is an excellent idea, however your technique is off slightly.  You have excellent focus on the jeans with wonderful detail and then the foot has little detail. I would like to see more of the "footprints" in this. <br/> <br/>As for meeting the challenge I can see where it is coming from but i have a feeling some didn''t feel the same way.  Keep thinking though, I like how you were thinking here.  It really was a wonderful idea.</td>', 'Critique Club This is an excellent idea, however your technique is off slightly.  You have excellent focus on the jeans with wonderful detail and then the foot has little detail. I would like to see more of the "footprints" in this.  As for meeting the challenge I can see where it is coming from but i have a feeling some didn''t feel the same way.  Keep thinking though, I like how you were thinking here.  It really was a wonderful idea.', '2003-11-11 20:09:38.000000', NULL, 0),
